<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.5">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">Bible in Fouta-Jalon Pular</book>
  <para style="ide">© Pioneer Bible Translators - Republic of Guinea, West Africa -- April 2009</para>
  <para style="rem">For any non-Paratext use of this text, permission must be obtained from the copyright holder.</para>
  <para style="mt">NO LUUKA YOTTINIRI LINJIILA ON NON</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hunorde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ɓay woodiino yimɓe ɗuuɗuɓe, nangannooɓe wallifagol fillayeeji fii piiji feƴƴunooɗi hakkunde men, <verse number="2" style="v"/>wano ɓee tawanooɓe gila ka fuɗɗoode yottinirnoo non e men, ɓen seeditorɓe gite mun, wonti kurkantooɓe daaluyee on, <verse number="3" style="v"/>min kadi mi taw no hawranimmi, yo Tawaafiilu tedduɗo, tippude e koo ko mi tefi, mi fensiti gila ka fuɗɗoode, weeɓitirangol on ɗun bindudi rewrundi, <verse number="4" style="v"/>fii no andiron pellital wongal ngal e nder ɗii janndeeji ɗi jannaɗon.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Feɲɲinannde Jibineede Yaayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Fewndo *Heroodu laaminoo diiwal *Yahuuda ngal, wooduno *yottinoowo sadaka wi'eteeɗo Zakariyaa'u jeyaaɗo e mojobere oo wi'eteeɗo Abiiya. Sonna makko ko e leɲol *Haaruuna jeyaa, on no wi'ee Elisabaatu. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ɓe ɗiɗoo non ko ɓe feewuɓe yeeso Alla, awa kadi hiɓe jokkunoo yamirooje e sariyaaji Joomiraaɗo on e ɓaawo feloore. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Kono tawi ɓe maraa ɓiɗɗo, ɓay hari Elisabaatu wonaa jiidotooɗo, awa kadi mo kala e maɓɓe nawyii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tawi non e nder ko kanko Zakariyaa'u o gollaynoo golle yottingol sadakaaji ka Alla, ɗun ko fewndo ko mojobere makko nden ardinaa yottingol sadakaaji, <verse number="9" style="v"/>o toɗɗorano urɓa tippude e naamuuji maɓɓe kamɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen naatugol ka nder juulirde Joomiraaɗo on, fii ittugol sadaka urngallooji sunneteeɗi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Fewndo on saa'i ittugol sadaka urngallooji, tawi jamaa on fow no juula ka yaasi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ko fewndo on saa'i malaa'ikaajo Joomiraaɗo on feeɲani mo, no darii ka ɲaamo ittirde sadaka urngallooji. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ɓay Zakariyaa'u yi'ii on malaa'ikaajo, o ɗenƴii, o huli. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kono malaa'ikaajo on wi'i mo: «Wota a hulu, yo Zakariyaa'u, ko fii toraare maa nden jaɓaama. Sonna maa Elisabaatu jibinante boobo gorko, a innay on Yaayaa. <verse number="14" style="v"/>O wonane welo-welo e weltaare, awa kadi yimɓe buy weltoray jibinegol makko, <verse number="15" style="v"/>sabu o wonay aaden mawɗo yeeso Joomiraaɗo on. O yaroytaa njaram mandilinayɗan e kala ko caakinta. *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on wonoyay e makko gila ka teege yumma makko, <verse number="16" style="v"/>awa kadi o artiroyay *Banii-Isra'iilayankeeɓe buy e laawol Joomiraaɗo on, on Alla maɓɓe. <verse number="17" style="v"/>O yaaray yeeso Joomiraaɗo on e nder ruuhu e doole wa Iiliiya, fii no o artira ɓerɗe baabiraaɓe e telen-ma ɓiɓɓe mun, o artira murtuɓe ɓen e telen-ma faamu feewuɓe ɓen, e fii no o eɓɓirana Joomiraaɗo on jamaa hebulaniiɗo mo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Zakariyaa'u wi'i malaa'ikaajo on: «Ko honno ɗun henirantammi? Ko fii mi nawyii, awa ɓeyngu an kadi wonii nayeejo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Malaa'ikaajo on jaabii mo: «Ko min woni Jibriilu, darotooɗo takko Allaahu on. Ko mi imminaaɗo fii yewtugol ma, humpite oo kibaaru moƴƴo. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Jooni, a mbobiɗay, a waawataa wowlude ɗoo e ɗun laataade, sabu a hoolaaki ɗii konguɗi an laatoytooɗi e saa'i happaaɗo on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Tawi non jamaa on no habbii Zakariyaa'u, hiɓe jiɓii ko honɗun neeɓini mo ka nder *juulirde mawnde ton. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ɓay o yaltii, o waawaali ɓe yewtude hay fus. Ɓe ndaari, ɓe tawi o feɲɲinanaama ka nder juulirde mawnde ton. O woni e eɓɓirangol ɓe juuɗe, o lutti mbobiɗude.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ɓay ɲalaaɗe makko yottingol sadakaaji ɗen timmii, o yiltitii ka suudu makko. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ɓay feƴƴii e ɗun, sonna makko Elisabaatu ƴetti reedu. O suuɗitii e nder lebbi jowi, himo wi'a:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>«E hino ko Joomiraaɗo on waɗanimmi kon,</para>
  <para style="q2">o yeƴƴitike lan jooni,</para>
  <para style="q2">o ittanii lan kaa hersa</para>
  <para style="q3">ka mi wondunoo e hakkunde ɓee yimɓe.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Feɲɲinannde Jibineede Iisaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ka lewru jeegaɓuru, Allaahu on nuli oo malaa'ikaajo wi'eteeɗo Jibriilu e ndee saare Naasirata jeyaande e ngal diiwal Jaliilu <verse number="27" style="v"/>haa e oo jiwo wi'eteeɗo Mariyama, mo gorko wi'eteeɗo Yuusufu jeyaaɗo e bolondaa Daawuuda ƴami. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Malaa'ikaajo on naati ka on jiwo, wi'i: «Mi salminii ma, an oo yeɗaaɗo sulfu. Joomiraaɗo on no wondi e maa.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngol kongol jiɓi mo, o miijii ko honɗun e salminaango nii. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Malaa'ikaajo on wi'i mo: «Wota a hulu yo Mariyama, sabu a heɓii sulfu immorde ka Allaahu on. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Awa a ƴettay reedu, jibinaa boobo gorko, innoyaa mo Iisaa. <verse number="32" style="v"/>O wonay mawɗo, o noddiree Geɗal Jom Ɓural on. Allaahu Joomiraaɗo on jonnoyay mo jullere laamu maama makko Daawuuda nden. <verse number="33" style="v"/>O laamoyto suudu Yaaquuba ndun haa poomaa, awa kadi laamu makko ngun lannataa.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Mariyama wi'i malaa'ikaajo on: «E ko honno ɗun laatorta, ɓay mi andaali gorko?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Malaa'ikaajo on jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ruuhu Seniiɗo on aray e maa, bawgal Jom Ɓural on ɗuwirte<note caller="a" style="f">1.35 Maa: <char style="it">«ɗuhirte».</char> </note> ɗowdi mun ndin. Ko ɗun si boobo *seniiɗo heɓoyteeɗo on noddiroyte *Ɓiɗɗo Alla. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Jooni non, Elisabaatu oo musiɗɗo maa ko sowiiɗo, o sowike kanko kadi e nder nayeewu makko boobo gorko. On wi'anooɗo jiidotaako no e nder lewru jeegaɓuru mun <verse number="37" style="v"/>sabu alaa ko Allaahu on ronki.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Onsay Mariyama wi'i: «Min ko mi korɗo Joomiraaɗo on. Yo woniranan wano wiiruɗon non.» Onsay malaa'ikaajo on yahi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Mariyama Humpitoroyi Elisabaatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>E nder ɗen balɗe ɗon, Mariyama immii no heɲii yahugol e saare goo ka hoore pelle e nder ndii leydi bolondaa Yahuuda. <verse number="40" style="v"/>O naati ka suudu Zakariyaa'u, o salmini Elisabaatu. <verse number="41" style="v"/>No Elisabaatu nanirnoo salminaango Mariyama ngon, ɓiɗɗo makko on memminii ka nder reedu makko, kanko Elisabaatu o heewi Ruuhu Seniiɗo on, <verse number="42" style="v"/>o ewnii ko tiiɗi, o wi'i: «An ko a barkinaaɗo e hakkunde rewɓe ɓen, awa kadi ɓiɗɗo mo saawuɗaa on ko barkinaaɗo! <verse number="43" style="v"/>E ko honno mi newniranaa yo yumma Koohoojo an on seeno ka an. <verse number="44" style="v"/>No hito salminaango maa ngon naatirnoo ka noppi an, boobo mo mi saawi on memminii weltaare ka reedu an. <verse number="45" style="v"/>On hooliiɗo ko Joomiraaɗo on fodi ɗun kon ko laatotooɗun, haray ko malaaɗo!»</para>
  <para style="s">Beytol Mariyama ngol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Onsay Mariyama wi'i:</para>
  <para style="q">«Wonkii an kin no manta Joomiraaɗo on.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ruuhu an on no weltanii Allaahu on,</para>
  <para style="q3">on Dandoowo lan,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>ɓay o liiƴii giiɗe makko ɗen e ndee lo'ere an</para>
  <para style="q3">min oo korɗo makko.</para>
  <para style="q2">Ko ɗun waɗi, gila hande kala jamaanu aroyayngu</para>
  <para style="q3">wi'oyay ko mi barkinaaɗo,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>ɓay Jom Bawgal on waɗanii lan piiji mawnuɗi,</para>
  <para style="q2">innde makko nden ko hormorteende.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Awa kadi yurmeende makko nden no layude</para>
  <para style="q2">e hoore ɓen hulooɓe mo,</para>
  <para style="q3">gila e jamaanu heɓi e jamaanu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>O golliri doole jungo makko ngon golle mawɗe.</para>
  <para style="q2">O saakiti ɓen waɗuɓe e ɓerɗe mun miijooji townitaare.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>O jippini ɓen marɓe doole ka julle mun laamu.</para>
  <para style="q2">O towni lo'uɓe ɓen.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>O harniri weelaaɓe ɓen piiji moƴƴi.</para>
  <para style="q2">O raɗii alɗuɓe ɓen juuɗe mehe.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>O faabii *Isra'iila'en, ɓen jiyaaɓe makko.</para>
  <para style="q2">O anditi fii yurmeende makko nden,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="55" style="v"/>wano o fodirnoo maamaaɓe men ɓen</para>
  <para style="q2">e Ibraahiima e jurriya mun on non haa poomaa.»</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="56" style="v"/>Mariyama wondi ɗon e Elisabaatu e nder lebbi tati. Onsay o yiltitii ka makko.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Jibineede Yaayaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Ɓay hewtii ka Elisabaatu jibinta, o jibini boobo gorko. <verse number="58" style="v"/>No kawtalɓe makko ɓen e siɓɓe makko ɓen humpitornoo nden yurmeende nde Joomiraaɗo on yeɗi mo, ɓe weltodi e makko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Ka ɲallal jeetataɓal, ɓe ari *sunningol boobo on, ɓe faalaa mo innitirde ben makko Zakariyaa'u. <verse number="60" style="v"/>Kono yumma makko ƴetti haala kan, wi'i: «Oo'o, ko Yaayaa o innetee!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Ɓe wi'i mo: «Hay gooto e musiɓɓe maa ɓen innaaka nden innde ɗon!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Ɓe landori ben boobo on eɓɓirangol mo juuɗe fii andugol ko honno o innata boobo on. <verse number="63" style="v"/>Zakariyaa'u torii alluwal, o windi ɗon: «Ko Yaayaa o innetee.» Onsay ɓe fow ɓe ŋalɗi. <verse number="64" style="v"/>Ɗon kisan, o hetti hunduko makko kon e ɗenngal makko ngal, o wowli, o jarni Alla. <verse number="65" style="v"/>Onsay yimɓe kawtal ngal fow huli, awa kadi koɗooli wonɗi ka hoore pelle Yahuuda ɗin fow hollondiri fii kon ko waɗi ɗon. <verse number="66" style="v"/>Kala nanuɗo ɗun miijii e ɓernde mun, wi'i: «Ko honɗun oo boobo laatotoo?» Tawi bawgal Joomiraaɗo on no wondi e makko.</para>
  <para style="s">Beytol Zakariyaa'u ngol</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v"/>Ɓay Zakariyaa'u ben boobo on heewii Ruuhu Seniiɗo on, o woni e haalugol ko o longinaa, o wi'i:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="68" style="v"/>«Mantoore wonanii Joomiraaɗo on, on Alla Isra'iila'en,</para>
  <para style="q2">e nder ko o faabii o sotti jamaa makko on kon.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="69" style="v"/>O yeɗii en Dandoowo mawɗo</para>
  <para style="q2">e nder nduu suudu Daawuuda, on jiyaaɗo makko</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>wano o daalirnoo e kundule annabaaɓe makko laaɓuɓe ɓen</para>
  <para style="q2">gila e duuɓi feƴƴunooɗi,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>hisingol en e juuɗe ayɓe men e kala aɲuɓe en.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="72" style="v"/>Ko nii o yeɗirnoo maamiraaɓe men ɓen yurmeende,</para>
  <para style="q2">o anditi *ahadi makko seniindi ndin,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="73" style="v"/>ɗun ko woondoore nde o woondannoo ben men Ibraahiima nden</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="74" style="v"/>fii jattingol en e juuɗe ayɓe men ɓen</para>
  <para style="q2">e newnangol en rewugol mo e ɓaawo kulol</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="75" style="v"/>e nder laaɓal e peewal yeeso makko,</para>
  <para style="q2">e nder ngurndan men ɗan fow.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="76" style="v"/>An-le oo boobo, a innete annabaajo Alla Jom Ɓural on,</para>
  <para style="q2">sabu a hikkanto Joomiraaɗo on yeeso</para>
  <para style="q2">fii moƴƴinangol mo laawi makko ɗin,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="77" style="v"/>fii no o andinira jamaa makko on wonde</para>
  <para style="q2">ko yaafuyee junuubaaji maɓɓe ɗin o yeɗirta ɓe kisiyee,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="78" style="v"/>ko fii Alla men on ko heewuɗo yurmeende,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɗun ko nden nde o imminirani en ndaygu immorde ka dow</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="79" style="v"/>fii ndayginangol wonɓe ka niwre ɓen</para>
  <para style="q2">e ɓen jooɗiiɓe ka ɗowdi mayde</para>
  <para style="q2">e fii ardagol en e laawol ɓuttu.»</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="80" style="v"/>Paykun kun njanɗi, ruuhu makko on kadi tiiɗi. Ko ka wulaa o daakinoo haa ɲande o feeɲannoo *Banii-Isra'iila'en.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Jibineede Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mat. 1.18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>E nder ɗen balɗe ɗon Awgustu lanɗo mawɗo Roomu on yamiri winditagol laamateeri makko ndin fow. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Fewndo nden winditannde aranere, hari ko Kiriniiyu woni ko halfinaa ardagol leydi Sirii ndin. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mo kala winditorayno ka saare mun.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yuusufu kaɲun kadi iwri ka diiwal Jaliilu e ndee saare Naasirata fii yahugol ka diiwal Yahuuda, ka saare Daawuuda wi'eteende Bayti-Lahiimi, ɓay hari ko o jeyaaɗo e nder ɓeynguure Daawuuda nden, awa kadi ko e ndun suudu o jeyaa, <verse number="5" style="v"/>fii no o winditodira e Mariyama on ƴamaaɗo makko, tawi on ko sowiiɗo. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Fewndo ɓe wonnoo ɗon, saa'i ka Mariyama jibinta hewti. <verse number="7" style="v"/>O firtii dikkuru makko ndun. O buumi mo e wudere, o wallini e nder kunnawal ɲamminirgal daabeeji, ɓay hari ɓe heɓaali werde ka suudu hoɓɓe.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hakkunde Malaa'ikaaɓe ɓen e Ngaynaakooɓe ɓen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tawi e on jemma, no woodunoo e ngal diiwal ɗon ngaynaakooɓe daakinooɓe fii aynugol gureeli mun ɗin. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Malaa'ikaajo Joomiraaɗo on feeɲani ɓe, annoora Joomiraaɗo on jalbini nokkuure ka ɓe woni ɗon. Ɓe huli fota. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kono malaa'ikaajo on wi'i ɓe: «Wota on hulu, sabu miɗo feɲɲinande on Kibaaru Moƴƴo mo welo-welo moolanaango wonanayngo jamaa on fow. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Hande e ndee saare Daawuuda, on daɲanaama ton Dandoowo, on-le ko *Almasiihu on, ko kanko woni Joomi on. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Awa seedee mun, on taway boobo penu no buumaa e nder wudere, wallinaa e nder kunnawal.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>No o gaynirnoo wowlude ɗun, ɗon kisan konu malaa'ikaaɓe moolanaangu tawti malaa'ikaajo on, no manta Allaahu on, hiɓe wi'a:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>«Mangural wonanii Allaahu on ka kammu,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓuttu wonii e oo aduna,</para>
  <para style="q2">hakkunde ɓen ɓe o waɗani sulfu makko on!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ɓay malaa'ikaaɓe ɓen ƴentii, ngaynaakooɓe ɓen wi'indiri: «Mahen Bayti-Lahiimi ndaaroyen ko waɗi ton kon, ɗun ko koo ko Joomiraaɗo on andini en fii mun!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ɓe yahi heɲa, ɓe tawoyi Mariyama e Yuusufu ton, tawi boobo penu on kadi no wallinaa ka nder kunnawal. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe yi'ii mo, ɓe fillitii ko ɓe wowlananoo kon fii on boobo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kala nanunooɓe ko ɓen ngaynaakooɓe yewtaynoo kon wontiri ɗun ŋalaw. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Mariyama mari ɗun fow ka ɓernde mun, maanditii fii miijitagol. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ontuma ngaynaakooɓe ɓen yiltitii, hiɓe manta mawnina Allaahu on fii kala ko ɓe nanunoo e ko ɓe yi'i wano ɓe wowlirananoo non tigi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ɓay balɗe jeetati ɗen timmii, o sunninaa o innaa Iisaa, innde nde malaa'ikaajo on toɗɗaninoo boobo on nden ado neene makko saawude mo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Weeɓitiraa Yeeso Joomiraaɗo on</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ɓay ɲalaaɗe fii laɓɓinagol maɓɓe ngol timmii, wano Sariya Muusaa on wiirunoo non, ɓe naɓi boobo on *Yerusalaam fii weeɓitangol mo Joomiraaɗo on, <verse number="23" style="v"/>(wano windori non ka Sariya Joomiraaɗo on: «Kala boobo gorko afo on ka neene mun ko Joomiraaɗo on jeyi.»),<note caller="b" style="f">2.23 Maa:<char style="it">«Kala boobo gorko afo on ka neene mun noddiroyte laaɓuɗo Joomiraaɗo on.» </char> Egg. 13.2, 13.12 e Lew. 12.6 </note> <verse number="24" style="v"/>e fii ittugol sadaka legetereeji ɗiɗi maa gabooji kecci ɗiɗi wano wiiranoo non ka Sariya Joomiraaɗo on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tawi no woodunoo Yerusalaam gorko wi'eteeɗo Sim'uunu. On ko feewuɗo e kadi ko rewoowo Joomiraaɗo on. Himo tijjaninoo *Isra'iila'en on Dandoowo, tawi kadi *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on no e hoore makko. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ruuhu Seniiɗo on feɲɲinanno mo wonde o maayataa ado o yi'ude Almasiihu Joomiraaɗo on. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ruuhu Seniiɗo on ardii mo haa ka *juulirde mawnde. Fewndo ko mawɓe paykun kun addata kun, ɗun ko Iisaa, fii laatinangol kun aadaaji maɓɓe tippude e Sariya Muusaa on, <verse number="28" style="v"/>kanko Sim'uunu o tambii paykun kun ka juuɗe makko, o jarni Alla, o wi'i:</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>«Jooni non, yaa an Joomiraaɗo,</para>
  <para style="q2">a accay jiyaaɗo maa on maaya e nder ɓuttu</para>
  <para style="q2">wano daalirannoɗaa mo non,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>sabu mi yi'irii gite an ɗen kisiyee iwruɗo e maa on,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>mo moƴƴinɗaa yeeso jamaaji ɗin fow,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>ɗun-le ko ndaygu hentinanayngu leƴƴi aduna on fow</para>
  <para style="q2">e darja wonanayɗo jamaa maa *Isra'iila on.»</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ben makko e yumma makko ŋalɗi fii ko wowlanoo fii makko kon. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Sim'uunu du'anii ɓe, wi'i Mariyama neene paykun kun: «Awa kun paykun wonoyay fii liɓugol woɓɓe, ɓanta ɓeya e nder leydi Isra'iila ndin e fii wonugol maande nde yimɓe ɓen yeddata, <verse number="35" style="v"/>e fii no miijooji ɓerɗe buy feeɲira. An kadi a heɓay nguli ɓernde wa tufiraande kaafa.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Tawi no woodunoo ɗon kadi debbo haaloowo ko Alla longini ɗun wi'eteeɗo Hannatu, on ko geɗal Fanu'iila, jeyaaɗo e bolondaa Asiira, duuɓinɗo fota. On ko yeru duuɓi jeeɗiɗi wondunoo e moodi mun gila curbayaagal makko. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ontuma o heynii haa o heɓi duuɓi cappanɗe jeetati e nay. E nder ɗun kadi, o iwataano ka juulirde mawnde, himo duuminoo ton e rewugol Alla, hoora, toroo jemma e ɲalorma. <verse number="38" style="v"/>On debbo hewti e on saa'i tigi, himo jarna Alla, himo wowlana kala tijjinooɗo hisineede ndee saare Yerusalaam fii kun paykun.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ɓay Yuusufu e Mariyama waɗii ko Sariya Joomiraaɗo on yamiri kon fow, ɓe yiltitii ka saare maɓɓe Naasirata, ɗun ko e nder Jaliilu. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Tawi paykun kun no njanɗude tun tiiɗa e nder ko kun heewata faamu kon. Awa kadi sulfu Alla on no e hoore makkun.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Iisaa Paykun ka Juulirde Mawnde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Tawi mawɓe Iisaa ɓen yahayno hitaande kala Yerusalaam fii *Juldeere Yawtaneede nden<note caller="c" style="f">2.41 Egg. 12 </note>. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ɓay kun heɓii duuɓi sappoo e ɗiɗi, ɓe yaadi e makkun e nden juldeere wano woowiri non. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Ɓay juldeere nden feƴƴii, mawɓe paykun kun hooti, kono kaɲun paykun kun, ɗun ko Iisaa, luttiti Yerusalaam, tawi mawɓe makkun ɓen andaali. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ɓay hiɓe sikka paykun kun no wondi e ɓe ɓe ardunoo ɓen, ɓe yahi yeru ɲallal. Onsay ɓe woni e ɗaɓɓitugol kun e hakkunde siɓɓe maɓɓe ɓen e andindiraaɓe maɓɓe ɓen. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe yiitaali kun, ɓe yiltitii Yerusalaam fii ɗaɓɓitoygol kun. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Balɗe tati ɓaawo ɗun, ɓe tawoyi kun ka juulirde mawnde, hikun jooɗii hakkunde karamokooɓe ɓen, heɗitii ɓe, e kadi hikun landotonoo ɓe lande. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nanunooɓe hikun yewta ɓen fow ŋalɗi sabu hakkille makkun ɗen e ko kun jaabotonoo kon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ɓay mawɓe makkun ɓen yi'ii kun, ɓe ŋalɗi, neene makkun wi'i kun: «Boobo an, ko honɗun waɗanɗaa men ɗun? E hino ɗun fow min e ben maa meɗen ɗaɓɓitude ma e nder sokola!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kun wi'i ɓe: «Ko fii honɗun ɗaɓɓitirton mi? Hari on andaa miɗo haani wonude ka suudu Ben an?» <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kono kamɓe ɓe faamaali ngol kongol ngol kun haalani ɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ontuma kun yiltodi e maɓɓe Naasirata, kun yankinanii ɓe. Neene makkun mari ɗin piiji fow ka ɓernde mun maanditii. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Tawi kun paykun, ɗun ko Iisaa, no mawnude tun, faamu makko on kadi ko yeeso tun woni yaarude, himo ɓeydoo tun welude Allaahu on e yimɓe ɓen.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Waaju Yaayaa ngun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mat. 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Mrk. 1.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yhn. 1.19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ka laamu Tibariiyu heɓi duuɓi sappoo e jowi ɗon, ɗun ko lanɗo mawɗo Roomu on, fewndo onsay hari ko Pilaatu Pontii woni lanɗo diiwal Yahuuda ngal, tawi ko *Heroodu laamii diiwal Jaliilu ngal, tawi ko Filiipu miɲɲiraawo makko on kadi laamii ɗee leyɗe ɗoo, ɗun ko Ituuriiya e Taraahuuniti, tawi ko Lisaaniiyu laamii diiwal Abiliiya ngal, <verse number="2" style="v"/>fewndo Hannaana e Qayaafa wonnoo *yottinooɓe mawɓe sadaka, Allaahu on daalanno Yaayaa mo Zakariyaa'u ka wulaa. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onsay Yaayaa yahi daande Yurdayniwol fow himo waajoo yimɓe ɓen yo ɓe aru ɓe *lootee maande tuubuubuyee fii yo junuubaaji maɓɓe ɗin yaafe <verse number="4" style="v"/>wano windori non ka deftere fii ɗii konguɗi annabi *Isaaya:</para>
  <para style="p">«Kaa hawa ko hawa ewnotooɗo ka wulaa, wi'a:</para>
  <para style="q">Moƴƴinee laawol Joomiraaɗo on,</para>
  <para style="q2">fewnon juri makko ɗin.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ayɗe ɗen fow uddete,</para>
  <para style="q2">pelle njane e tosooke ɗen fow joltinee.</para>
  <para style="q">Ɗate ɓoyliiɗe ɗen fewnee,</para>
  <para style="q2">laawi kaanuɗi ɗin newɗinee.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Kala neɗɗanke yi'ay kisiyee iwruɗo ka Alla on.»<note caller="d" style="f">3.6 Isa. 40.3-5 </note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>O wi'ayno ɗin jamaaji arayɗi e makko fii *lootegol maande tuubuubuyee: «Ko onon yo iwdi kuura! Ko hombo tindini on dogugol tikkere aroyaynde nden? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Awa yo kuuɗe mon ɗen hollu wonde on tuubii. Hara on hooloraali wi'ugol wonde ko Ibraahiima woni maama mon, ko fii mi andinii on, Alla no waawi wattude ɗee kaaƴe ɗoo ɓiɓɓe Ibraahiima. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Toode teenirde nden no waalii ka binde leɗɗe. Kala leggal ngal rimataa ɓiɓɓe moƴƴuɓe, ngal soppete, ngal bugee ka yiite!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Onsay yimɓe ɓen landii mo: «Ko honɗun men waɗata jooni?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>O jaabii ɓe: «Kala marɗo dolokkaaji ɗiɗi yo sendodu ɗi e mo maraa. Kala jogiiɗo kadi ɲaametee yo o warru wano non.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ƴantooɓe* sagalle ɓen ari e makko fii lootegol maande tuubuubuyee, ɓe wi'i mo: «Karamoko, ko honɗun men haani waɗude?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «Wota on ƴantu toonin ko yamiraɗon kon.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Suufaaɓe goo kadi landii mo: «Menen-le, ko honɗun men haani waɗude?»</para>
  <para style="p">O jaabii ɓe: «Wota on jattu hay gooto kaalisi, wota on ittin hay gooto e hoore tooɲe, yo njoddi mon ndin yonu on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Tawi mo bee e maɓɓe no miijotonoo ka ɓernde mun si tawii wonaa Yaayaa woni *Almasiihu on, ko fii hari jamaa on no sabbinoo on. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kanko Yaayaa o jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: «Min, ko ndiyan mi woni on lootirde, kono ɓurɗo lan doole on, mo mi hewtaa hay firtugol ɓoggi paɗe mun, no arude. On non ko *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on e yiite o lootirta on. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Himo jogii feeteewo makko ngon ka jungo, ko o hentinira bete<note caller="ɗ" style="f">3.17 Maa: <char style="it">«gete».</char> </note> makko on, o mooɓa ɲaametee on ka beembal makko, o sunnira foron on yiite nge ɗaanotaako.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tawi Yaayaa no feɲɲinanaynoo jamaa on Kibaaru Moƴƴo wondude e waajuuji heewuɗi. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kono ɓay Yaayaa felii *Heroodu lanɗo diiwal ngal, sabu ko on resi sonnaajo yumma-gooto mun on kon, ɗun ko debbo wi'eteeɗo Heroodiiya, wondude e kala bonnereeji ɗi o waɗaynoo, <verse number="20" style="v"/>onsay Heroodu ɓeyditiri ɗun hendagol Yaayaa, soka mo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Lootiraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mat. 3.13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Mrk. 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Fewndo ko jamaa on fow ari fii lootegol maande tuubuubuyee, Iisaa kadi lootoraa. Fewndo ko o du'otoo, kammu ngun udditii, <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ruuhu Seniiɗo on ƴetti mbaadi gabooru tippii e makko. Onsay hawa nanii ka kammu, no wi'a: «Ko an woni Ɓiɗɗo an yiɗaaɗo on, miɗo weltor-maa.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Iwdi Iisaa ndin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mat. 1.1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ko Iisaa fuɗɗii waajaade, ko wa mo duuɓi cappanɗe tati. Ko o tuumanooɗo wonugol geɗal Yuusufu, on ɓiɗɗo Helii, <verse number="24" style="v"/>mo Matsaata, mo Lewi, mo Malkii, mo Yannaa, mo Yuusufu, <verse number="25" style="v"/>mo Mataasiyaa, mo Amuusa, mo Naahuuma, mo Haslii, mo Najji, <verse number="26" style="v"/>mo Maasa, mo Mataasiyaa, mo Sim'ii, mo Yuusuka, mo Yahuuza, <verse number="27" style="v"/>mo Yuuhanna, mo Reesa, mo Zarubaabila, mo Sa'alti'iila, mo Neerii, <verse number="28" style="v"/>mo Malkii, mo Addii, mo Qusaama, mo Almudaama, mo Iiri,</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>mo Yuusii, mo Aliyaasaru, mo Yuriima, mo Matsaata, mo Lewi, <verse number="30" style="v"/>mo Sim'uunu, mo Yahuuda, mo Yuusufa, mo Yuunaana, mo Alyaqiima, <verse number="31" style="v"/>mo Malayaa, mo Maynaana, mo Mataasa, mo Naasaana, mo Daawuuda, <verse number="32" style="v"/>mo Yassaa'u, mo Obiida, mo Bo'aaza, mo Salmaana, mo Nahasuuna, <verse number="33" style="v"/>mo Ammiina-Daaba, mo Adumiina, mo Arnii, mo Hasruunu, mo Faarisa, mo Yahuuda,</para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>mo Yaaquuba, mo Issaaqa, mo Ibraahiima, mo Taaraha, mo Naahuura, <verse number="35" style="v"/>mo Seruuja, mo Ra'uwa, mo Faalaja, mo Aabira, mo Saalaha, <verse number="36" style="v"/>mo Kiinaana, mo Arfaksaada, mo Saama, mo Nuuhu, mo Laamaka, <verse number="37" style="v"/>mo Matuusaalaha, mo Hanuuka, mo Yaarada, mo Mahalaliila, mo Kiinaana, <verse number="38" style="v"/>mo Anuusa, mo Siita, mo *Aadama, mo Allaahu on.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Ibuliisa Ndarndori Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat. 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mrk. 1.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iisaa iwi Yurdayniwol no heewi *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on. Ruuhu on nawri mo ka wulaa. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ko ton Ibuliisa ndarndii mo fodde balɗe cappanɗe nay. O ɲaamaali hay fus e nder ɗen balɗe ɗon fow. Ɓawto ɗun o weelaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onsay Ibuliisa wi'i mo: «Si tawii ko a *Ɓiɗɗo Alla, yamir ndee hayre yo nde wontu ɲaametee.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «No windii wondema: ‹Neɗɗo hinaa ɲaametee tun wuurirta.› »<note caller="e" style="f">4.4 Yaɲ. 8.3 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Onsay Ibuliisa naɓi mo ka ɓuri toowude, o holli mo laamateeriiji aduna on fow yeru hinƴaango yiitere. <verse number="6" style="v"/>O wi'i mo: «Mi jonnete laamu e hoore majji ɗi fow wondude e darja majji on, ɓay mi jonnanooma ɗi, awa-le mi okkay ɗi mo mi faalanaa woo. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Si tawii a sujjanii lan, ɗii fow wontante.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «No windii wondema: ‹Ko Alla Joomiraaɗo maa on sujjantaa, rewaa mo kanko tun.› »<note caller="f" style="f">4.8 Yaɲ. 6.13 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ibuliisa nawri mo kadi Yerusalaam, joɗɗinoyi mo ka hoore warɲakere *juulirde mawnde, o wi'i mo: «Si tawii ko a Ɓiɗɗo Alla, hocco ɗon, cikkoɗaa ka leydi, <verse number="10" style="v"/>ko fii no windii wondema: ‹O yamiray malaa'ikaaɓe makko ɓen fii maa, yo ɓe reene, <verse number="11" style="v"/>awa kadi ɓe tamborte juuɗe maɓɓe ɗen fii wota koyngal maa ngal feggo e hayre.› »<note caller="g" style="f">4.11 Zab. 91.11-12 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «No windii wondema: ‹Wota a ndarndo Joomiraaɗo on, on Alla maa.› »<note caller="h" style="f">4.12 Yaɲ. 6.16 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ɓay Ibuliisa lannii mo ndarndaade e ɗii ɗoo fow, o pottitii mo haa o eɓɓa feere goo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Golle Iisaa ɗen Jaliilu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mat. 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Mrk. 1.14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Iisaa yiltodi e bawgal Ruuhu Allaahu on ka diiwal Jaliilu. Fii makko andii e nokkeeli heeduɗi ɗon ɗin fow. <verse number="15" style="v"/>O jannayno ka juulirɗe maɓɓe. Yimɓe ɓen fow manti mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>O yahi Naasirata ka o ne'aa ɗon. E *ɲalaande fowteteende nden, ɗun ko asewe, o naati ka juulirde wano o woowiri non. O immii fii jangugol. <verse number="17" style="v"/>O jonnaa deftere annabi Isaaya nden, o udditi nde, o hawrondiri e cortewol ka ɗunɗoo windii:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>«Ruuhu Joomiraaɗo on no e hoore an,</para>
  <para style="q">sabu ko min woni Suɓaaɗo on</para>
  <para style="q2">fii feɲɲinangol miskinɓe ɓen Kibaaru Moƴƴo on.</para>
  <para style="q">O nelii lan</para>
  <para style="q2">fii hollitugol nangaaɓe ɓen hettugol hoore mun,</para>
  <para style="q2">hollita bumɓe ɓen hettugol giiɗe mun ɗen,</para>
  <para style="q2">hollita njaggaaɓe ɓen kadi hettugol hoore mun,</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>e fii humpitugol on ndee hitaande nde Joomiraaɗo on waɗi moƴƴere mun nden e mun.»<note caller="i" style="f">4.19 Isa. 61.1-2 </note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ontuma o ɲobbi deftere nden, o jonni nde wallitotooɗo on, o jottii. Tawi yimɓe ɓen fow ka nder juulirde no punnii mo. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Oo daaluyee mo nanirɗon noppi mon ɗin laatike hande.» <verse number="22" style="v"/>Fow seeditanii mo, ŋalɗidi e ɗin konguɗi makko moƴƴi ɗi o yewtaynoo, hiɓe wi'a: «Wonaa ɓiɗɗo Yuusufu on nii?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i ɓe: «Miɗo andi on wowlanay lan ngol tindol ɗoo: Ɲawndoowo, ɲawndu hoore maa tigi. Kala ko men nani waɗii Kafernahuum, waɗu ɗun kadi ka leydi maa ɗoo.» <verse number="24" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: «Mi wowlanay on haqiiqa, annabaajo hay e gooto teddinaaka ka leydi mun. <verse number="25" style="v"/>E hino goonga ko mi woni on wowlande: E fewndo jamaanu Iiliiya, hari keynguuɓe buy no woodi e nder leydi Isra'iila. Ko fewndo onsay wonnoo duuɓi tati e lebbi jeegoo kammu ngun no uddii ndiyan ɗan toɓɓaali, heege tiiɗunge waɗi e leydi ndin fow, <verse number="26" style="v"/>kono hari Iiliiya nulaaka e hay gooto e ɓen keynguuɓe, si hinaa e debbo keynguujo mo Sarfati, ɗun ko e nder leydi Siduuna. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tawi kadi e fewndo jamaanu annabi Iliyaasa, ɓe ɗamajan buy no leydi Isra'iila, kono hari hay gooto e maɓɓe sellinaaka, si hinaa oo Siriyankeejo wi'eteeɗo Na'amaana.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe nanii ɗii konguɗi makko, wonnooɓe ka nder juulirde ɓen fow tikki. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ɓe immii, ɓe duɲiri mo ka ɓaawo saare, ɓe naɓi mo haa ka fello ngon ƴellitii ɗon fii bugagol mo ley. Tawi nden saare ko e falo ngon fello darnaa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kono o ukkitii hakkunde maɓɓe, o feƴƴi, o yahi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Raɗori Jinna, Ɲawndiri Ɲabbeeli Buy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Mrk. 1.21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iisaa yahi Kafernahuum, nden saare ko jeyaande e diiwal Jaliilu, himo janna e ɲalaande fowteteende nden, ɗun ko aseweere nden. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ko o jannaynoo kon ŋalɗini jamaa on, sabu himo wowliraynoo bawgal.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Tawi no ka nder juulirde ton neɗɗo mo jinnawii bonngii nangi, on sonki, wi'i: <verse number="34" style="v"/>«Hey, ko honɗun faalanaɗaa men, an Iisaa oo jeyaaɗo Naasirata? Hara ko mulugol men aranɗaa? Min miɗo andi ko hombo wonu-maa, ko a *Seniiɗo mo Alla!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa yamiri ngii, wi'i: «Fanku, yaltaa e oo neɗɗo!» Jinnawii ngin liɓi mo hakkunde maɓɓe, ngii yalti e makko, ngii barminaali mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Fow ŋalɗi, no wi'indira: «E ko honɗun woni ngol kongol? Oo no yamira jinnaaji bonɗi ɗin e hoore doole e bawgal, ɗi yalta!» <verse number="37" style="v"/>Kibaaru fii makko lolli e nokkeeli heeduɗi ɗon ɗin fow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ɓay o iwii ka juulirde, o yahi ka galle Sim'uunu. Tawi esiraawo Sim'uunu suddiiɗo on no nawni nawnaare nguli-ɓandu tiiɗuki. Ɓe torii mo kanko Iisaa ballal. <verse number="39" style="v"/>O ugginii e hoore makko, o yamiri nawnaare nden, nde yalti e makko. Ɗon kisan on immii, o woni e kurkanagol ɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ɓay naange ngen mutii, kala marnooɓe ɲawɗo noone ɲaw fow, ɓe addi ɓe e makko. O *fawi juuɗe makko ɗen e hoore mo kala e maɓɓe, o sellini ɓe. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Tawi kadi jinnaaji no yaltude e buy e maɓɓe, hara hiɗi sonka, wi'a: «Ko an woni Ɓiɗɗo Alla on!» Kono o toŋani ɗi, o salii ɗi wowla, ɓay hari hiɗi andi ko kanko woni *Almasiihu on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>No weetirnoo bimbi, Iisaa yalti yaari e nokkuure wulɗinnde. Jamaaji ɗin woni e ɗaɓɓitugol mo, ɓe ari haa e makko. Ɓe faalaa mo tongude ɗon, hara o accaali ɓe ɗon. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Kono o wi'i ɓe: «Bee mi feɲɲinana ɗeya ca'e kadi Kibaaru Moƴƴo on, ɗun ko kibaaru fii *laamu Alla ngun, sabu ko fii ɗun mi neliraa.» <verse number="44" style="v"/>Onsay o woni e waajagol ka juulirɗe diiwal Yahuuda.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Taalibaaɓe ɓe Iisaa Adii Noddude ɓen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat. 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mrk. 1.16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ɲande goo, tawi Iisaa no e daande nduu *Weendu Jaani-Saarata. Tawi jamaa no duɲindira e fee makko fii heɗagol daaluyee Allaahu on. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O haynii laakoy ɗiɗoy ka sera weendu, tawi yungooɓe ɓen no jippii fii lootugol *jalaaji maɓɓe ɗin. <verse number="3" style="v"/>O ƴawi e gokkun e koy laakoy, ɗun hawrondiri e kun Sim'uunu kun, o yamiri onɗon woɗɗintingol ɓe pencen on seeɗa. Ontuma o jooɗii e nder makkun, o woni e jannugol jamaa on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ɓay o gaynii jannude, o wi'i Sim'uunu: «Nawru laakun kun ka luggi ɗon, bugoɗon jalaaji mon ɗin, nangon liƴƴi.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sim'uunu jaabii mo: «Jom amen, oo jemma feƴƴuɗo ɗoo fow meɗen yungude, men heɓaali hay fus. Kono sabu ko maakuɗon kon, mi bugoto jalaaji ɗin.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe waɗii ɗun, ɓe nangi liƴƴi ɗuuɗuɗi, benii jalaaji maɓɓe ɗin fuɗɗii taƴude. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe ɓaaƴi ɓeya wondiɓɓe maɓɓe wonɓe e kuma laakun fii ko ara wallitoo ɓe. Ɓen ari ɓe hebbini laakoy koy ɗiɗoy non, haa koy faalaa mutude.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ɓay Sim'uunu Petruusu yi'ii ɗun, o yani e ley koyɗe Iisaa, o wi'i: «Koohoojo an, woɗɗitee lan, sabu min ko mi junuubankeejo!» <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ŋalaw heɓi mo, heɓidi mo e ɓe o wondunoo ɓen fow, sabu ngol nangugol ɗin liƴƴi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ko wano non kadi Yaaquuba e Yuuhanna ɓee ɓiɓɓe Zabadii wondiɓɓe Sim'uunu ŋalɗirnoo.</para>
  <para style="p">Onsay Iisaa wi'i Sim'uunu: «Wota a hulu, gila jooni a wonay yungoowo yimɓe.» <verse number="11" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe artiri laakoy koy ka pencen, ɓe acci fow ɗon, ɓe jokki mo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Ɲawndiri mo Ɗamajan</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mat. 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Mrk. 1.40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tawi Iisaa no e saare goo. Onsay mo ɗamajan heewi e ɓandu mun yi'i mo, ari yani yeeso makko. O jeeji mo, o wi'i: «Koohoojo, si hiɗon faalaa, hiɗon waawi lan sellinde, mi laaɓa!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Iisaa fonti jungo mun ngon, meemi mo, wi'i: «Miɗo faalaa, laato selluɗo laaɓaa.» Ɗon kisan ɗamajan ɗan yalti e makko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i mo: «Wota a wowlan ɗun hay gooto. Kono non a yahay hollitoyoɗaa *yottinoowo sadaka on, ittaa sadaka fii ko laɓɓinaɗaa kon wano Muusaa yamiri non fii yo ɗun wonan ɓe seedee.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Kono tawi innde makko nden no ɓurtude lollude, jamaaji buy mooɓii fii jentagol mo e fii ɲawndegol ɲabbeeli maɓɓe, <verse number="16" style="v"/>kono tawi Iisaa no woowunoo pottitaade ka weddii, toroo Alla.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Imminiri Maaya-Ɓanduujo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mat. 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Mrk. 2.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ɲande goo tawi Iisaa no jannude. Hari *Fariisiyaaɓe e jannooɓe fii Sariya on no jooɗii ɗon, hiɓe iwri e koɗooli diiwal Jaliilu ngal fow e diiwal Yahuuda ngal e ka saare Yerusalaam. Tawi bawgal Joomiraaɗo on no wondi e makko no o ɲawndira. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Tawi kadi woɓɓe arii no rondii jukkuɗo e ɓoggi-dimborɗi. Hiɓe ɗaɓɓa fii no ɓe naadira mo ka nder suudu, ɓe wallina mo yeeso Iisaa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe heɓaali ka ɓe naadira mo sabu ɗuuɗugol jamaa on, ɓe ƴawdi e makko ka hoore suudu, ɓe tufi ton yolnde, ɓe tippindini mo e ɓoggi-dimborɗi ɗin e hakkunde jamaa on yeeso Iisaa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa yi'ii gomɗinal maɓɓe ngal, o wi'i: «Musiɗɗo, junuubaaji maa ɗin yaafaama.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Onsay Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on woni e wi'indirgol: «Ko hombo woni oo hoynoowo? Ko hombo waawi yaafaade junuubu ko wonaa Alla?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Iisaa andi ɗin miijooji maɓɓe, o wi'i: «Ko honɗun miijantoɗon ɗun ka ɓerɗe mon? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Enee, hakkunde wi'ugol ‹junuubaaji maa ɗin yaafaama› e ‹immo yahaa›, ko honɗun e ɗii ɗoo ɓuri weeɓude?» <verse number="24" style="v"/>O wi'i kadi: «Fii no andiron wonde *Ɓii-Aaden on no mari bawgal ka aduna ɗoo fii yaafagol junuubaaji», o wi'i jukkuɗo on: «Immo ƴettaa ɓoggi-dimborɗi maa ɗin, hootaa ka maa.» <verse number="25" style="v"/>On immii ɗon kisan e tawnde maɓɓe, o ƴetti ɓoggi-dimborɗi makko ɗin, o hooti ka makko, himo manta Alla. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kaawee heɓi ɓe fow, ɓe manti Alla, ɓe huli fota, hiɓe wi'a: «Hande men yi'ii huunde hawniinde!»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Matta Jokkiri Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mat. 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Mrk. 2.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun, Iisaa yalti. Ko o yahata, o yi'i ƴantoowo sagalle wi'eteeɗo Lewi no jooɗii ka ƴantirde sagalle. O wi'i: «Aru jokkaa mi!» <verse number="28" style="v"/>Lewi acci ɗon ko o joginoo kon fow, o immii, o jokki mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Lewi waɗani mo caatal mawngal ka mun, yimɓe buy ƴantooɓe sagalle wondude e yimɓe goo jooɗodi e maɓɓe. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on jeyaaɓe e fedde maɓɓe nden ŋuni taalibaaɓe Iisaa ɓen, ɓe wi'i ɓe: «E ko fii honɗun ɲaamidanton, yaridon e junuubankeeɓe ɓen e ƴantooɓe sagalle ɓen?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Hinaa selluɓe ɓen hatonjini e ɲawndoowo, kono ko ɲawɓe ɓen. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Min, wonaa noddugol feewuɓe ɓen mi arani, kono ko junuubankeeɓe ɓen fii yo ɓe tuubu.»</para>
  <para style="s">Landal fii Hoorugol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat. 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mrk. 2.18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Onsay woɓɓe wi'i mo kanko Iisaa: «Taalibaaɓe Yaayaa ɓen e taalibaaɓe Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen kaɲun hooray, juula soono woo. An-le, ɓe maa ɓen no ɲaamude, yara!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii ɓe wi'i: «Taw si on waaway hoorinde njaatigiiɓe jom jomba ɲande peera on, hara himo wondi e maɓɓe? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Aray e saa'i nde jom jomba pottinaa e hakkunde maɓɓe, onsay e ɗen balɗe ɗon ɓe hooray.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>O haalani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i: «Hay gooto ƴettataa ceelol bagi keso, walkira dolokke kiɗɗo. Si hinaa ɗun, haray ontigi bonnii kesun ɗun, walkere nden kadi yaadataa e kiɗɗun ɗun. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Hay gooto loowataa njaram *wiiɲu kesan e nder bootooji guri kiɗɗi. Si hinaa ɗun, ɗan njaram kesan wonay sabu ko feeri ɗin guri, njaram ɗan hibba, bootooji guri ɗin kadi bona. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kono njaram kesan ko e nder bootooji guri kesi loowetee. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Kala yaruɗo njaram kiɗɗan faaletaake njaram kesan, ko fii o wi'ay: ‹Ko kiɗɗan ɗan ɓuri welude.› »</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Landal fii Ɲalaande Fowteteende nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat. 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mrk. 2.23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>E aseweere goo, ɗun ko *ɲalaande fowteteende nden, hari Iisaa no rewude e gese ngawri, taalibaaɓe makko ɓen no woocora cawti ɗen gese, worsa ɗi, ɲaama. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Fariisiyaaɓe* goo wi'i: «Ko honɗun waɗanton koo ko dagaaki e ɲalaande fowteteende nden?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Kono Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Hara on jangaali ko Daawuuda waɗunoo kon fewndo o weelaa, kanko e yimɓe wondunooɓe e makko ɓen? <verse number="4" style="v"/>O naati ka nder suudu Alla, o ƴetti bireediije weeɓitaaɗe fii sadaka ɗen, o ɲaami ko daganinoo *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen tun kon, o okkori kadi wonduɓe e makko ɓen.» <verse number="5" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i: «Ko *Ɓii-Aaden on woni jom ɲalaande fowteteende nden.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Selliniri Maaya-Jungoojo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat. 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mrk. 3.1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>E aseweere goo, Iisaa naati ka juulirde, o woni e jannugol. Tawi goɗɗo no nder ton mo jungo mun ɲaamo maayi. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Nde tawnoo jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen e Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen no faalaa heɓude ko ɓe lamitora, ɓe tooɲa Iisaa, tawi hiɓe ndaara si o ɲawnday e asewe, ɗun ko ɲalaande fowteteende nden. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kono tawi Iisaa no andunoo ɗin miijooji maɓɓe. Onsay o wi'i maaya-jungoojo on: «Immo daroɗaa ka hakkunde ɗoo.» On immii, darii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i ɓe: «Mi landike on, hara no dagii ka goɗɗo waɗa ko moƴƴi maa ko boni, danda wonkii maa wona sabu makki e aseweere?» <verse number="10" style="v"/>Onsay o ndaari ɓe fow, o wi'i on neɗɗo: «Fontu jungo maa ngon.» On fonti ngo, jungo makko ngon selli. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ɗun tikkini Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen fota, ɓe woni e yeddondirgol ko honɗun ɓe waɗata Iisaa.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Suɓori Sahaabaaɓe mun ɓen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mat. 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mrk. 3.13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>E nder ɗen balɗe ɗon, Iisaa yaari ka fello fii toragol Alla, o waali toraade. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ɓay weetii, o noddi taalibaaɓe makko ɓen, o suɓii sappoo e ɗiɗo e maɓɓe, o toɗɗii ɓe *sahaabaaɓe: <verse number="14" style="v"/>ɗun ko Sim'uunu, on mo o jammi Petruusu, e Andaraawu neene-gooto Sim'uunu on, e Yaaquuba e Yuuhanna e Filiipu e Bartolomaawu <verse number="15" style="v"/>e Matta e Tooma e Yaaquuba mo Alfaa e Sim'uunu tawdaaɗo e fedde *Zelotiiɓe ɓen, <verse number="16" style="v"/>e Yahuuda mo Yaaquuba e Yudaasi Iskariiyu, janfoytooɗo mo on.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Waaju ngun ka hoore Fello</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mat. 4.23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-11">Mrk. 3.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Iisaa jippodi e ɓen taalibaaɓe ɓe o suɓii, o darii e nokkuure ndeylere ka falo. Tawi taalibaaɓe makko ɗuuɗuɓe no e nden nokkuure, wondude e jamaa moolanaaɗo iwruɗo e cenɗe ɗen fow e diiwal Yahuuda ngal e saare Yerusalaam nden e ɗii baŋŋeeji Tiiri e Siduuna ka daande baharu. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ɓen ko arnooɓe heɗagol mo e fii ɲawndegol ɲabbeeli mun. Ɓe jinna tampinnoo ɓen sellinaa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Awa kadi mo kala e maɓɓe no faalanoo mo meemude, ɓay himo wondunoo e bawgal ɲawndaynoongal ɓe fow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>O ɓanti gite makko ɗen, o ndaari taalibaaɓe ɓen, o wi'i:</para>
  <para style="p">«On malii yo onon miskinɓe,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay *laamu Alla ngun ko onon wonani.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>On malii yo onon weelaaɓe fewndo ɗoo,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay on harnoyte.</para>
  <para style="q">On malii yo onon wullooɓe fewndo ɗoo,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay on weltoyto.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>On wonay malaaɓe nde yimɓe ɓen aɲi on</para>
  <para style="q2">e nde ɓe raɗii on, ɓe yenni on,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓe ɲiddini inɗe mon ɗen sabu Ɓii-Aaden on.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Nden ɲande, weltee, jiɲon welo-welo,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay hiɗon maranaa njoddi mawndi ka kammu,</para>
  <para style="q2">ko fii ko nii kadi mawɓe maɓɓe ɓen warraynoo annabaaɓe ɓen.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kono bone wonanii on onon alɗuɓe ɓen,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay on hendike neweende ko mon kon!</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Bone wonanii on onon ɓee haaruɓe jooni,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay on weeloyte.</para>
  <para style="q">Bone wonanii on onon ɓee jalooɓe hande,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay on yoomoyay wullon.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Bone wonanii on nde yimɓe ɓen fow wowli on ko moƴƴi,</para>
  <para style="q2">ɓay ko non mawɓe maɓɓe ɓen wowliraynoo</para>
  <para style="q2">fii ɓee waɗitiiɓe annabaaɓe.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Yiɗugol Ayɓe mun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>«Kono min mi wi'ay on yo onon ɓee heɗiiɓe lan: Yiɗee ayɓe mon ɓen, moƴƴoɗon e aɲuɓe on ɓen, <verse number="28" style="v"/>du'anoɗon huɗooɓe on ɓen, toranoɗon tampinooɓe on ɓen. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Mo bantike ma e waɓɓugo, tuɗan mo ngoya kadi. Mo jattii ma waramba, wota a haɗu mo ƴettude fokiya on kadi. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Okkor kala toriiɗo ma, hara kadi a ƴantaali ko maa kon e juuɗe jattuɓe ma ɓen. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Waɗanee yimɓe ɓen wano faaliraɗon yo ɓe waɗan on non.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>«Si on yiɗii yiɗuɓe on ɓen, haray ko moƴƴere honde heɓoyton? Ko fii hay junuubankeeɓe ɓen no yiɗi yiɗuɓe ɓe ɓen. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Si on moƴƴike e moƴƴiiɓe e mo'on ɓen, haray ko moƴƴere honde heɓoyton? Hay junuubanke'en ko non warrata. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Si on ɲawlii ɓe tanƴiniɗon yoɓitay on ɓen, haray ko moƴƴere honde heɓoyton? Hay junuubanke'en ɲawlindiray fii yo ɓe yoɓitindir. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kono yiɗee ayɓe mon ɓen, waɗanon ɓe ko moƴƴi, ɲawlon ɓe hara on habbaaki yoɓiteede. Ɗun on heɓoyay njoddi mawndi, wonoyon kadi ɓiɓɓe Jom Ɓural on, sabu himo moƴƴani dulluɓe ɓen e bonɓe ɓen. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wonee yurmeteeɓe wano Baaba mon Jom Ɓural on woniri Yurmeteeɗo non.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Ɲaawitagol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mat. 7.1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>«Wota on ɲaawu, ɗun on ɲaawetaake. Wota on felu, ɗun on feletaake. Yaafee, ɗun on yaafoyte. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Okkee, ɗun on okkorte. On etirante sariyaare yeɗɗunde, timmunde, yeƴaande haa juuri, waɗaneɗon ka jiifaaji mon. Ko fii ko sariyaare nde etirɗon nden etiranteɗon.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>O wowlani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i: «Hara bunɗo no waawi ɗowude bunɗo? Hara ɓe ɗiɗoo non ɓe yanidaali e nder ngayka? <verse number="40" style="v"/>Taalibaajo ɓuraa karamoko mun. Kono kala taalibaajo eltiiɗo wa'ay wa karamoko mun.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>«Ko honno yiirataa lojol wongol ka yiitere musiɗɗo maa on, hara a yi'aali falimawal wongal ka yiitere maa ngal? <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ko honno wawrataa wi'ude musiɗɗo maa: ‹Musiɗɗo, accu mi ittane lojol ngol ka yiitere maa›, hara an, a wattanaali yiila e falimawal wongal ka yiitere maa ngal? Ko an yo faasiqiijo, ittu taho falimawal wongal ka yiitere maa ngal, onsay non a yi'ay no ittiranaa musiɗɗo maa on lojol wongol ka yiitere makko ngol.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Leggal e Ɓiɓɓe Mun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mat. 7.16-20</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12.33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>«Leggal moƴƴal rimataa ɓiɓɓe bonɓe, wano non kadi leggal bongal rimataa ɓiɓɓe moƴƴuɓe. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Leggal kala no anditiree ɓiɓɓe mun: ko fii on ittataa ƴibbe e bulle-koɲon, wano non kadi on ittataa sungala<note caller="j" style="f">6.44 Maa: <char style="it">«sumbala».</char> </note> e bulle-bete. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Neɗɗo moƴƴo on yaltinay moƴƴere ka moƴƴuki ɓernde mun, neɗɗo bonɗo on kadi yaltina bonki ka bonki mun, ko fii ko ko heewi e ɓernde woo hunduko wowlata.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Ɲinnugol Waajuuji ɗin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat. 7.24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>«Ko fii honɗun noddanton mi ‹Koohoojo, Koohoojo›, hara on waɗataa ko mi wi'i on kon? <verse number="47" style="v"/>Kala neɗɗo arɗo e an, nani waajuuji an ɗin huutori ɗi, mi hollay on no on wa'i. <verse number="48" style="v"/>On no wa'i wa darnuɗo suudu. Hara o jasu gaawol luggungol haa e fetere, o fuɗɗii ɗon mahude. Nde waamere nden waɗi, ndiyan ɗan ari e suudu ndun, ɗan waawataa ndu dillinde, ko fii daroodi mayru on no tiiɗi. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Kono kala nanuɗo konguɗi an ɗin, huutoraali ɗi, on no wa'i wa darnuɗo suudu ndu jasanaaka gaawol. Ilol ndiyan ɗan hawri e mayru tun, ndu yani kisan, fii mayru on mula few.»</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Kurkaadu Suufaajo on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mat. 8.5-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-54">Yhn. 4.46-54</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ɓay o gaynii waajaade jamaa heɗitiiɗo mo on, o naati Kafernahuum. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tawi hooreejo suufaaɓe teemedere no mari kurkaadu ndu o yiɗunoo, hari ndun no nawni haa moggo mayde. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ɓay o nanii fii Iisaa, o nuli mawɓe *Yahuudiyankeeɓe goo e makko fii toragol mo arugol ɲawndana mo ndun kurkaadu makko. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe arii ɓe tawii Iisaa, ɓe jeeji mo ɓe multi, ɓe wi'i: «Himo handi e waɗaneede ɗun, <verse number="5" style="v"/>ko fii himo yiɗi leɲol men ngol, awa-le kadi ko kanko darni juulirde amen nden.» <verse number="6" style="v"/>Iisaa yaadi e maɓɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓay o ɓattike suudu hooreejo suufaaɓe ɓen, on suufaajo nuli yiɓɓe mun goo e Iisaa ko wi'a mo: «Koohoojo, wota on tampintino, sabu mi foddaa e mo'on ka suudu an. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi si min tigi mi foddaa e arugol haa ka mon. Kono maakee tun kongol gootol, kurkaadu an ndun ndikkay. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ko fii min tigi ko mi wonɗo e ley kongol hooreeɓe goo, min kadi miɗo mari suufaaɓe wonɓe e ley kongol an. Si mi wi'ii goɗɗo e ɓen ‹yahu›, o yahay. Si mi wi'ii oya on ‹aru›, o aray. Awa kadi si mi wi'ii kurkaadu an ndun ‹waɗu ɗun›, ndu waɗay.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa nanii ɗin konguɗi makko, o ŋalɗi, o fewti e jamaa jokkuɗo mo on, o wi'i ɓe: «Mi andinii on, hay ka *Isra'iila'en mi yi'aali neɗɗo gomɗinirɗo wa oo.» <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ɓay nulanooɓe ɓen yiltitike ka suudu, ɓe tawti kurkaadu nawnunoondu ndun ndikkii.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Ɓiɗɗo Keynguujo on Wurnitiraa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>E nder ɗen balɗe ɗon, Iisaa yahi e saare wi'eteende Naa'ina, taalibaaɓe makko ɓen wondude e jamaa ɗuuɗuɗo yaadi e makko. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ko o hewtaynoo ka naatirgal saare, o fotti e rondiiɓe furee, hari on furee ko ɓiɗɗo bajjo ka neene mun, tawi kadi neene makko ko keynguujo. Tawi jamaa ɗuuɗuɗo e nden saare no wondi e on debbo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ɓay Koohoojo on yi'ii on keynguujo, o yurmaa mo, o wi'i mo: «Wota a wullu!» <verse number="14" style="v"/>O ɓadii furee on, o *fawi jungo makko ngon e hoore goyki kin, rondiiɓe furee on dartii, o wi'i: «Suka, mi yamirii ma yo a immo!» <verse number="15" style="v"/>Onsay mayɗo on immii jooɗii, o fuɗɗii yewtude. Iisaa jonniti mo yumma makko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ɓe fow ɓe huli, ɓe manti Alla, ɓe wi'i: «Annabaajo kelɗuɗo feeɲii e fewndo men. Allaahu on arii faabagol yimɓe mun ɓen!» <verse number="17" style="v"/>Fii ngal kuugal makko lolli e diiwal Yahuuda ngal haa e baŋŋeeji heeduɗi ɗon ɗin fow.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Lande Yaayaa ɗen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mat. 11.2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Taalibaaɓe Yaayaa ɓen humpiti mo kanko Yaayaa kon ko waɗi fow. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yaayaa noddi ɗiɗo e taalibaaɓe mun ɓen, o immini ɓe e Koohoojo on yo ɓe lando mo: «Taw si ko onon woni haanuɗo arude on, kaa hara yo men habbo goɗɗo goo?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓen imminaaɓe hewtii, ɓe wi'i Iisaa: «Ko Yaayaa *lootoowo maande tuubuubuyee on immini men haa e mon fii landagol on si ko onon woni haanuɗo arude on, kaa hara yo men habbo goɗɗo goo?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ko e on saa'i mo ɓe hewti e mun tigi, Iisaa sellini ɲawɓe e jukkuɓe buy e jinnaaɓe, o wuntini kadi bumɓe buy. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ontuma o jaabii ɓen ɓe Yaayaa immini, o wi'i ɓe: «Yahee fillitanoɗon Yaayaa ko yi'uɗon kon e ko nanuɗon kon wonde, bumɓe ɓen yi'ii, boofooɓe ɓen yahii, ɓe ɗamajan ɓen sellinaama, ɓe laaɓii, pahiɗuɓe ɓen nanii, mayɓe no immintineede, Kibaaru Moƴƴo on no feɲɲinaneede miskinɓe ɓen. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kala mo feggaaki e an ko malaaɗo.<note caller="k" style="f">7.23 Maa: <char style="it">«Kala mo ronkaali gomɗinde lan ko malaaɗo.» </char> </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓen ɓe Yaayaa nelunoo yiltitike, onsay Iisaa fuɗɗii yewtude jamaa on fii Yaayaa, o landii ɓe ɗunɗoo, o wi'i: «Ko honɗun yahunoɗon ndaaroygol ka wulaa? Hara ko kuɗol ngol hendu ndun dimbata? <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kaa ko honɗun yahunoɗon ndaarugol? Ko neɗɗo ɓorniiɗo conci dimi? Ndaaree ɓee ɓorniiɓe conci dimi, wuuruɓe ngurndan moƴƴan no e nder galleeji laamu. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ko honɗun non yahunoɗon ndaarugol? Ko annabaajo? Hiiyii, min mi wi'ay on, ko ko ɓuri annabaajo. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ko oo ɗoo woni mo fii mun windii on:</para>
  <para style="q">‹Awa, miɗo imminde nulaaɗo an on yeeso maa,</para>
  <para style="q2">fii ko fertano-maa laawol maa ngol.›<note caller="m" style="f">7.27 Mal. 3.1 </note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>«Mi andinii on, alaa mo suddiiɗo jibini ɓurɗo Yaayaa. Kono non ɓurɗo fanɗude on ka laamateeri Alla no ɓuri mo teddude.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>(Jamaa heɗinooɗo mo on e ƴantooɓe sagalle ɓen jaɓi laawol Alla feewungol ngol e nder ko ɓe lootanoo maande tuubuubuyee ko Yaayaa lootaynoo kon. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kono Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen e waawuɓe fii Sariya ɓen bugitii ko Allaahu on eɓɓannoo ɓe kon, ɓe salii Yaayaa loota ɓe maande tuubuubuyee.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>«Hara ko e honɗun mi eɓɓindirta ɓee yimɓe nguu jamaanu? E ko honɗun ɓe nandi? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Hiɓe nandi e fayɓe jooɗiiɓe e kubitirde, hara ɓen no noddindira, wi'a:</para>
  <para style="p">‹Men wuttanii on ceri, on amaali,</para>
  <para style="q2">men yimanii on gimɗi yurmuɗi, on wullaali!›</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>«Ko fii Yaayaa lootoowo maande tuubuubuyee on arno, o ɲaamataano ko defaa, o yarataano ko mandilinta, wi'uɗon: ‹On ko mo jinna!› <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ɓii-Aaden* on kadi arii no ɲaama no yara, wi'uɗon: ‹On ko reereɗuɗo, yaroowo, welduɗo e ƴantooɓe sagalle e junuubanke'en!› <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kono jaɓuɓe faamu Allaahu on ɓen hollay wonde ko ngu feewungu.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Debbo Junuubankeejo on Yaaforaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Fariisiyaajo goo wi'eteeɗo Sim'uunu torii Iisaa hawtidugol e makko. Iisaa naati ka suudu Fariisiyaajo on, o toolii fii nafagol. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tawi debbo junuubankeejo no e nden saare, on humpitii Iisaa no nafaade ka suudu Fariisiyaajo on. O ardi e tindohun hayre daneere tew angiri, <verse number="38" style="v"/>o wontiri ɓaawo Iisaa, o ugginii ka hoore koyɗe makko, o wulli haa gonɗi makko ɗin ɓuɓɓini koyɗe Iisaa ɗen. Ontuma debbo on fittiri ɗe sukundu mun ndun, o lunnii ɗe, o wuji ɗe angiri.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ɓay Fariisiyaajo noddunooɗo Iisaa on yi'ii ɗun, o wi'i e ɓernde makko: «Si tawno oo ko annabaajo, o andayno ko hombo woni oo debbo meemuɗo mo e ko honno on sifori, sabu oo ko junuubankeejo!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Iisaa ƴetti haala kan, wi'i: «Sim'uunu, no woodi ko mi haalanay-maa.»</para>
  <para style="p">On jaabii: «Maakee yo karamoko'en.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>O wi'i: «Goɗɗo no ɲawlunoo yimɓe ɗiɗo. Gooto on no joganii mo *dinaruuji teemeɗɗe jowi, oya on ko *dinaruuji cappanɗe jowi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓen heɓaali ko yoɓitira mo, o yaafanii ɓe ɗiɗoo non ko ɓe ɲawlii mo kon. Ko hombo e ɓen ɗiɗo ɓurata mo yiɗude?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Sim'uunu jaabii: «Haray ko ɓurɗo ɲamaande tiiɗunde on.»</para>
  <para style="p">Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «A ɲaawirii no moƴƴiri.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>O fewti e debbo on, o wi'i Sim'uunu: «A yi'ii oo debbo? An, mi naatii ka suudu maa, a okkoraali lan ndiyan ko mi sembora, kono oo ɗoo ɓuɓɓinirii koyɗe an ɗen gonɗi mun ɗin, o fittirii ɗe sukundu makko ndun. <verse number="45" style="v"/>A hirbanooki lan lunniɗaa, kono kanko gila mi naati ɗoo, himo lunnaade lan koyɗe ɗen. <verse number="46" style="v"/>A waɗaali nebban ka hoore an, kono kanko o waɗii angiri ka koyɗe an. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Awa mi andinii ma, junuubaaji makko e ɗuuɗude yaafaama, ko ɗun waɗi si giggol makko ngol no tiiɗi. Kono mo yaafaama seeɗa, ko seeɗa yiɗata.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i debbo on: «Junuubaaji maa ɗin yaafaama.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Onsay ɲaamidaynooɓe e makko ɓen miijii e ɓerɗe mun: «Ko hombo woni oo neɗɗo yaafotooɗo hay junuubaaji?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ontuma o wi'i debbo on: «Gomɗinal maa ngal dandii ma. Yahu e hoore ɓuttu.»</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Ɗowtunooɓe Iisaa ɓen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun, Iisaa yahayno gila e saare heɓi e saare, gila e hoɗo haa e koɗolun wondude e *sahaabaaɓe makko ɓen sappoo e ɗiɗo, hara himo waajoo feɲɲina Kibaaru Moƴƴo *laamu Alla ngun. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Himo wondunoo kadi e rewɓe goo ɲawndaaɓe jinnaaji bonɗi e ɲabbeeli, wano Mariyama oo jammaaɗo Mariyama Magaduuna, mo jinnaaji jeeɗiɗi yaltinaa e mun, <verse number="3" style="v"/>e Yuuwanna on ko sonnaajo Kuusa oo mbatulaajo *Heroodu, e Suusanatu, e woɓɓe goo wallitoraynooɓe ɓe keyeeji mun.</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Remoowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-23">Mat. 13.1-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-20">Mrk. 4.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Jamaa njano mooɓii, yimɓe buy iwri e ca'e heewuɗe, ari e makko. O waɗani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo: <verse number="5" style="v"/>«Ko remoowo yaltunoo sankugol awdi mun ndin. E nder ko o sankata kon, gabbe goo yani ka ɗatal, feƴƴooɓe ɓen yaaɓi, colli ɗin kadi moɗi ɗe. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Goɗɗe ɗen yani e hoore fetere, no ɗe fuɗirnoo, ɗe yoori, ɓay ɗe alaa e ɓuuɓol. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Goɗɗe goo kadi yani ka sooƴoore, ɗe fuɗidi e mayre, sooƴoore nden moɗi ɗe. <verse number="8" style="v"/>Goɗɗe goo yani ka leydi moƴƴiri. Ɗe fuɗi, ɗe rimi cawti ɗi gabbe teemedere.» Wa fewndo ko o yewtaynoo ɗun, o ewnii, o wi'i: «Mo no mari noppi nanirɗi yo nanu!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Onsay taalibaaɓe makko ɓen landii mo ko ngal misal ɗoo firi. <verse number="10" style="v"/>O jaabii ɓe: «Onon on yeɗaama andugol gundooji laamu Alla ngun. Kono ɓeya luttuɓe, ɗun wowlirante ɓe mise, fii yo ɓe ndaaru, hara ɓe yi'ataa, yo ɓe nanu, hara ɓe faamataa.<note caller="n" style="f">8.10 Isa. 6.9-10 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>«E hino ko ngal misal firi: Awdi ndin ko daalol Alla ngol. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nde awdi sankaandi ndin saami ka ɗatal, ɗun no wa'i wa nde woɓɓe nani daalol ngol, kono Ibuliisa ara itta ngol e ɓerɗe maɓɓe fii wota ɓe gomɗin sakko ɓe dandee. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Nde awdi sankaandi ndin saami ka fetere, ɗun no wa'i wa nde woɓɓe nani daalol ngol, ɓe jaɓira ngol weltaare. Kono ɓe alaa ɗaɗi. Ɓe gomɗinay haa e saa'i, kono si ɓe ndarndaama, ɓe tertoo. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Nde awdi sankaandi ndin saami ka sooƴoore, ɗun no wa'i wa nde woɓɓe nani daalol ngol, kono hara ɓe moɗiraama anndeeji aduna e jawle aduna e faaleeji ngurndan aduna e nder yaadu maɓɓe ndun, ɓe ronka rimude moƴƴa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Nde awdi sankaandi ndin saami ka leydi moƴƴiri, ɗun no wa'i wa nde woɓɓe naniri daaluyee on ɓernde laaɓunde moƴƴunde, jogitoo mara. Ko ɓen woni rimooɓe e nder wakkilaare.</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Lampu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Mrk. 4.21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>«Hay gooto huɓɓintaa lampu buuma mo maa sorna mo e ley danki. Kono o joɗɗinay mo e kene fii no naatooɓe ɓen yi'ira ndaygu ngun. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ko fii alaa ko suuɗii ko feeɲataa, kala gundoo ko sakkitorta ko feeɲoygol. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Awa wattanee yiila e no heɗorton non, ko fii ko marɗo ɓeydantee, kono mo maraa on jaɓitante hay ko o sikki himo mari kon.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Ɓeynguure Iisaa nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mat. 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Mrk. 3.31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Yumma Iisaa e yumma-gootooɓe makko ɓen ari, kono ɓe waawaali tumbondirde e makko hakkee yimɓe. <verse number="20" style="v"/>O humpitaa wonde: «Yumma mon e yumma-gootooɓe mon ɓen no darii ka yaasi, hiɓe faalaa yiidude e mon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kono o jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: «Yumma an e yumma-gootooɓe an ɓen ko heɗotooɓe daaluyee Alla on, ɲinna mo.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Deeƴiniri Waabiliire nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mat. 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Mrk. 4.35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ɲande goo Iisaa bakii e laakun wondude e taalibaaɓe mun ɓen. O wi'i ɓe: «Lumbiten ka gaɗa weendu.» Ɓe yahi. <verse number="23" style="v"/>E nder ko ɓe lumbata kon, Iisaa ɗaanii. Waabiliire tiiɗunde wondunde e hendu tippii ka weendu, laakun kun fuɗɗii heewude ndiyan, ɗun wonani ɓe nawaare hulɓiniinde.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ɓe ari, ɓe findini mo, ɓe wi'i: «Karamoko'en, Karamoko'en, en mulay woni!»</para>
  <para style="p">O immii, o toŋani hendu ndun e morlooɗe ndiyan ɗen, ɗe deeƴiti, onsay ɓuttu waɗi. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ontuma o wi'i ɓe: «Ko honto gomɗinal mon ngal woni?»</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓe huli, ɓe ŋalɗi, hiɓe wi'indira: «Ko hombo woni oo neɗɗo yamiroowo hay hendu ndun e ndiyan ɗan, ɗun ɗoftoo mo?»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Selliniri Jinnaaɗo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mat. 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Mrk. 5.1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ɓe hewtoyi e ndii leydi ɓee Gadariyankooɓe tiindondirndi e ngal diiwal Jaliilu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa jippike ka leydi, neɗɗo jeyaaɗo e nden saare mo jinnaaji buy nangi, ari e makko. Tawi gila neeɓii o ɓornotaako conci, o naatataa e suudu, ko ka hakkunde genaale o hoɗunoo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>No o yiirunoo Iisaa, o sonki, o yani e ley koyɗe makko, o ewnii, himo wi'a: «Ko honɗun faalanaɗaa lan an Iisaa *Ɓiɗɗo Alla Jom Ɓural on? Mi torike ma wota a lettan!» <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ngii jinnawii bonngii wi'i ɗun sabu ko Iisaa yamiraynoo ngin yaltugol e oo neɗɗo kon. Tawi ngin jinnawii nangayno mo soono woo, o dumbee juuɗe e koyɗe fii aynugol mo, kono o bonnayno ɗen jolokooje fow, onsay jinnawii ngin nawra mo ka wulaaji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa landii mo: «Ko honno inneteɗaa?»</para>
  <para style="p">Tawde hari jinnaaji buy no e makko, o jaabii: «Ko Konu.» <verse number="31" style="v"/>Awa kadi hiɗi jeejaynoo Iisaa fii wota o yamir ɗi yahugol ka *gaygii ngin alaa kattudi ngin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tawi wuro kose moolanaango no ooraynoo ka falo. Onsay jinnaaji ɗin jeeji Iisaa yo o accu ɗi naata e ɗin koseeji. O newnani ɗi ɗun. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Jinnaaji ɗin yalti e on neɗɗo, ɗi naati e nder ɗin koseeji. Onsay koseeji ɗin giddi ka falo, ɗi unoyii ka weendu, ɗi yoolii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ɓay ornaynooɓe ɗi ɓen yi'ii ɗun, ɓe dogi, ɓe fillitoyii ɗun ka saare e ka fulawaaji. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Onsay yimɓe ɓen ari yi'ugol kon ko waɗi. Ɓe ari e Iisaa, ɓe tawi on neɗɗo mo jinnaaji ɗin yalti e mun no jooɗii ka ley koyɗe Iisaa, himo ɓornii, himo wondi e hakkille timmuɗe, ɓe huli. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Yi'unooɓe ko waɗi kon fillitanii ɓe no jinnanooɗo on selliniraa. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Onsay jeyaaɓe e diiwal Gadariyankooɓe ɓen fow torii mo yaltugol ka maɓɓe sabu kulol ngol ɓe heɓi ɗon ngol. Ontuma Iisaa bakii ka laakun yiltitii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Onsay neɗɗo mo jinnaaji ɗin yaltinaa e mun on torii Iisaa wondugol e makko. Kono Iisaa yilti mo, o wi'i mo: <verse number="39" style="v"/>«Hootu ka mon, fillitoyoɗaa ko Alla waɗan-maa kon.» Onsay o yahi, o ukkii ka saare, o fillitii kala ko Iisaa waɗani mo kon.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Wurnitiri Jiwo, O Sellini Debbo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mat. 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Mrk. 5.21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa lumbitii, jamaa on jaɓɓii mo, ko fii hari fow no sabbii mo. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Tun oo hooreejo juulirde maɓɓe wi'eteeɗo Yaayirusu ari e makko. Onsay o yani e ley koyɗe Iisaa, o torii mo hewtugol ka suudu makko, <verse number="42" style="v"/>ɓay tawi jiwo makko bajjo mo wa duuɓi sappoo e ɗiɗi no e daande mayde.</para>
  <para style="p">Wa fewndo kanko Iisaa o yahata ka oo neɗɗo, tawi jamaa on no ɓittiri mo cenɗe ɗen fow. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Tawi kadi debbo no e nden nokkuure, heɓii duuɓi sappoo e ɗiɗi, himo soncaade. Awa kadi o ittii jawle makko fow o yoɓii ɲawndooɓe ɓen, kono hay gooto e maɓɓe waawaali mo sellinde. <verse number="44" style="v"/>On debbo wontiri ɓaawo Iisaa. No o meemirnoo kombol dolokke makko on, ko o soncotonoo kon taƴi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i: «Ko hombo meemimmi?»</para>
  <para style="p">Tun mo kala wi'i wonaa kaɲun. Onsay Petruusu wi'i: «Karamoko'en, jamaa on no hundi on, awa kadi hiɓe hiɓɓii on!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Kono Iisaa jaabii, o wi'i: «Goɗɗo meemii lan, ko fii mi andii wonde bawgal an ngal gollii goɗɗun.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nde debbo on tawnoo ko o waɗi kon pulfitike, o ari himo diwna, o yani e ley koyɗe Iisaa, o furɲiti yeeso jamaa on fow ko fii honɗun o meemani mo e ko honno kadi o selliniraa ɗon kisan. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «Jiwo an, gomɗinal maa ngal sellinii ma. Yahu e hoore ɓuttu.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko Iisaa yewtata ɗun, gorko jeyaaɗo ka hooreejo juulirde nden ari, wi'i mo: «Jiwo maa on maayii. Hay tertiɗaa sonjugol oo karamokoojo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kono ɓay Iisaa nanii ɗun, o wi'i hooreejo juulirde nden: «Wota a hulu, gomɗin tun, jiwo maa on hisay.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa hewtii ka hooreejo juulirde nden, o jaɓaano naatidude hay e gooto ka suudu si hinaa Petruusu e Yaaquuba e Yuuhanna wondude e yumma jiwo on e ben jiwo on. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Tawi fow no wulla fesa fii on jiwo. Onsay Iisaa wi'i: «Wota on wullu mo, ko fii o maayaali, o ɗaani.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe jali mo, ko fii hiɓe andi jiwo on maayii. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa nangi jungo jiwo on, o ewnii, o wi'i: «Jiwo, immo!» <verse number="55" style="v"/>Tun wonkii jiwo on arti, o immii ɗon kisan. Onsay Iisaa yamiri ɓe okkorgol mo ɲaametee. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Kaawee heɓi mawɓe jiwo on. Kono o yamiri ɓe wota ɓe wowlan hay gooto kon ko waɗi ɗon.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Sahaabaaɓe ɓen Sappoo e Ɗiɗo Nuliraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:2-20">Mat. 10.2-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Mrk. 6.7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>O noddi ɓe o suɓunoo ɓen sappoo e ɗiɗo, o okki ɓe bawgal e doole e hoore jinnaaji ɗin fow e fii sellingol ɲabbeeli. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O immini ɓe waajoyagol fii *laamu Alla ngun e sellingol ɲawɓe ɓen. <verse number="3" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «Wota on yooɓo hay huunde e nder yaadu mon ndun, gila e tuggordu maa bonfo maa ɲaametee goo haa naɓani e kaalisi. Awa kadi wota on yooɓo dolokkaaji ɗiɗi.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: «Kala suudu ka naatoyɗon, weeree ɗon haa tuma fokkituɗon woo, <verse number="5" style="v"/>e kala saare nde yimɓe ɓen jaɓaali on e mun, nde hiɗon yalta ɗon woo, honkee mbullaari teppe mon ɗen fii yo ɗun wonan ɓe seedee ella maɓɓe on.» <verse number="6" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe yahi koɗolun e koɗolii, hiɓe waajoo fii Kibaaru Moƴƴo on e kadi hiɓe sellina hen fow ɲawɓe ɓen.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Ŋalaw Heroodu on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mat. 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-16">Mrk. 6.14-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Heroodu* lanɗo diiwal Jaliilu ngal humpitii fii ko woni waɗude kon, ɗun jiiɓi mo ɓernde, sabu hari woɓɓe no wi'a ko Yaayaa immintinaa e hakkunde mayɓe ɓen, <verse number="8" style="v"/>woɓɓe ɓen no wi'a wondema ko Iiliiya feeɲiti, woɓɓe goo no wi'a wondema ko goɗɗo e annabaaɓe hiɓɓe ɓen immitii. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kono Heroodu wi'i: «Mi taƴiino daande Yaayaa nden, e hara ko hombo woni oo mo mi nanata fii mun nii?» Gila ɗun himo etoo no o yi'ira mo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Ɲamminiri Yimɓe Guluuje Njowo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mat. 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Mrk. 6.30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yhn. 6.1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓen *sahaabaaɓe ɓe o imminnoo hewtitii, ɓe sifanii mo kanko Iisaa ko ɓe waɗoyi kon fow. Onsay o yaadi e maɓɓe haa e takko ndee saare Bayti-Sa'iida, ɓe bakitii ɗon. <verse number="11" style="v"/>No yimɓe ɓen humpitornoo ɗun, ɓe jokki mo. Onsay Iisaa tolni ɓe, o yewti ɓe fii laamu Alla ngun, o ɲawndi kadi ɓen hatonjinɓe e ɲawndeede.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Tawi ɲallal ngal woɗɗike. Onsay sappoo e ɗiɗooɓe ɓen ari e makko, ɓe wi'i mo: «Accitee non jamaa on, ɓe yaha ka koɗooli e ka fulawaaji kawtirɗi e ɗoo, ɓe ɗaɓɓoya ko ɓe ɲaama e ka ɓe waaloo, ko fii ko e nokkuure wulɗinnde wonɗen ɗoo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i ɓe: «Onon tigi okkoree ɓe ko ɓe ɲaama.»</para>
  <para style="p">Kono ɓe jaabii, ɓe wi'i: «Ko bireediije jowi e liƴƴi ɗiɗi pet men mari ɗoo, si hinaa hara menen tigi men yahay men soodoya ko oo jamaa ɗoo fow ɲaama!» <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tawi worɓe wonɓe ɗon ɓen tun ko wa ɓe guluuje njowo.</para>
  <para style="p">Onsay Iisaa yamiri taalibaaɓe mun ɓen, wi'i: «Joɗɗiniree ɓe mojobe mojobe, mojobere kala cappanɗe njowo.» <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ɓe joɗɗiniri ɓe no o wi'iri ɓe non. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa ƴetti bireediije ɗen jowi e liƴƴi ɗin ɗiɗi, o ɓanti gite makko ɗen, o fewti ka kammu, o du'ii. Ontuma o taƴiti ɗe, o woni e jonnugol taalibaaɓe makko ɓen fii yo ɓen hewtin jamaa on. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Fow ɲaami haa haari. Ɓe mooɓiti debeeje sappoo e ɗiɗi kunte ko lutti.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Qirritannde Petruusu nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mat. 16.13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Mrk. 8.27-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ɲande goo tawi Iisaa no wondi e taalibaaɓe mun ɓen ka wirnii, himo toraade Alla. Ontuma o landii ɓe ɗunɗoo, o wi'i: «E wi'i jamaa on, ko hombo woni lan min?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ɓe jaabii mo, ɓe wi'i: «Woɓɓe no wi'a ko onon woni Yaayaa lootaynooɗo on, woɓɓe kadi no wi'a ko onon woni Iiliiya, woɓɓe goo kadi no wi'a ko on annabaajo kiɗɗo goo immintinaa.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Onsay o landii ɓe, o wi'i: «Onon non wi'uɗon ko hombo woni lan min?»</para>
  <para style="p">Petruusu jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ko onon woni *Almasiihu Alla on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Iisaa yamiri ɓe, tentini, wota ɓe wowlan ɗun hay gooto. <verse number="22" style="v"/>O ɓeyditi e ɗun, o wi'i: «Maa *Ɓii-Aaden on tampa fota, mawɓe ɓen e hooreeɓe *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen fow wikkoo mo, o waree, o immintinoyee ka ɲalaande tammere.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe fow wonde: «Kala faalaaɗo jokkude lan, yo o hayfintino, o ƴetta ɲande woo ɲande *leggal makko altindiraangal ngal,<note caller="ɲ" style="f">9.23 <char style="it">«Ƴettugol leggal mun altindiraangal ngal»</char> ko hebilagol jokkugol Iisaa haa maaya.</note> o jokkammi. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Kala faalaaɗo dandude ngurndan mun, ɗan hayriray mo, kono kala non mo ngurndan mun hayriraa sabu an min, haray ontigi dandoyay ɗan. <verse number="25" style="v"/>E ko nafa honɗun woodani neɗɗo heɓugol aduna on fow si o hayrintinike maa si o halkitike kanko tigi? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Awa kadi, kala hersirɗo lan, hersiri konguɗi an ɗin, Ɓii-Aaden on kadi hersiroyay mo tuma o ardoyi e mangural makko ngal e mangural Baabaajo on wondude e malaa'ikaaɓe laaɓuɓe ɓen. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Miɗo wowlande on goonga, no woodi woɓɓe e mon onon wonɓe ɗoo ɓen, ɓe maayataa ado ɓe yi'ude laamu Alla ngun.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Waylannde Mbaadi Iisaa ndin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mat. 17.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Mrk. 9.2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ɓay wa balɗe jeetati feƴƴii ɓawto yewtugol mo ɓe ɗin konguɗi, onsay o noddi Petruusu e Yuuhanna e Yaaquuba, ɓe yahi ka fello fii toragol Alla. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Fewndo ko o torotoo, mbaadi yeeso makko ngon waylii, dolokke makko on wonti daneejo jalbuɗo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>E nder ɗun, yimɓe ɗiɗo feeɲi no yewtida e makko, tawi ɓen-le ko Muusaa e Iiliiya. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ɓen no feeɲidi e annoora, hiɓe yewta fii yaadu makko sakkitordu ndun Yerusalaam. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tawi Petruusu e wondiɓɓe mun ɓen no soƴƴaade, kono ɓe ŋonti, ɓe yi'i annoora Iisaa on e ɓen yimɓe ɗiɗo ɓe o wondunoo e mun. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Fewndo ɓee yimɓe ɗiɗo seedata e Iisaa, Petruusu wi'i mo: «Karamoko'en, no moƴƴi ka wonen ɗoo. Darnen togooji tati, onon wonndu, Muusaa wonndu, Iiliiya kadi wonndu.» Tawi kanko Petruusu o andaa ko o woni wowlude.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko o wowlata ɗun, duulere ari buumi ɓe. Ko nden duulere buumata ɓe, ɓe huli. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Onsay hawa yalti ka duulere, no wi'a: «Oo ɗoo ko Ɓiɗɗo an Suɓaaɗo on. Heɗitee mo!» <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ɓay ngol ewol waɗii, ɓe tawi ko Iisaa tun lutti ɗon. Taalibaaɓe ɓen mari ɗun fanki. Ɓe fillitanaaki hay gooto kon ko ɓe yi'i ɗon e nder ɗen balɗe ɗon.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Selliniri Paykun Jinnaakun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mat. 17.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:14-27">Mrk. 9.14-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Bimbi nden ɲande ko ɓe jippotoo ka ley fello, jamaa moolanaaɗo ari fottugol e Iisaa. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Onsay gorko goo ewnii ka hakkunde jamaa ton, o wi'i: «Karamoko'en, mi torike on tenƴinee oo ɓiɗɗo an, ko fii ko bajjo an on nii. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Nde jinnawii ngin nangi mo woo, o sonkay, o iiroo, o yaltina ngurda. Ngii letta mo, awa kadi ko karahan ngii yaltirta e makko. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Mi torike taalibaaɓe mon ɓen raɗagol ngii jinnawii, kono ɓe waawaali.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii, wi'i: «Onon ko on jamaanu ɓoyliingu ngu gomɗinaa. Ko haa honde tuma mi wondata e mon, miɗo muɲɲanoo on? Awa addu ɗoo ɓiɗɗo maa on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Wa ko o ɓannata paykun kun, jinnawii ngin liɓi kun ka leydi, kun iirii. Kono Iisaa toŋani ngii. Onsay o sellini paykun kun, o jonniti kun ben makkun. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Fow ŋalɗi fii mangural Allaahu on.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Hiitori fii Mayde mun nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mat. 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Mrk. 9.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">Wa fewndo ko fow ŋalɗidi e ko o waɗaynoo kon kanko Iisaa, onsay o wi'i taalibaaɓe ɓen: <verse number="44" style="v"/>«Onon heɗitee fota ɗii konguɗi ɗoo: Ɓii-Aaden on janfoyte, wattee e juuɗe yimɓe ɓen.» <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kono hari taalibaaɓe ɓen alaa faamude ɗin konguɗi, sabu hari hiɗi wirnanii ɓe fii wota ɓe andu ko ɗi firi. Awa kadi hari hiɓe huli landitagol mo ɗi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Ɓurɗo Teddude on e Hakkunde Maɓɓe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mat. 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Mrk. 9.33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Onsay yeddondiral waɗi hakkunde maɓɓe fii andugol ko hombo e maɓɓe ɓuri teddude. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Nde tawnoo Iisaa kaɲun no andunoo ɗin miijooji maɓɓe, o ƴetti paykun, o joɗɗini takko makko. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Kala jaɓuɗo kun paykun e innde an, haray ko min o jaɓi. Awa kadi kala jaɓuɗo lan, haray ko Nuluɗo lan on o jaɓi. Ko fii ko ɓurɗo fanɗude on e mon woni tedduɗo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Yuuhanna ƴetti haala kan, wi'i: «Karamoko'en, men yi'ii goɗɗo no raɗoo jinnaaji e innde mo'on. Men toŋani mo ɗun, ɓay o wondaa e amen fii jokkugol on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «Wota on toŋan mo ɗun. Ko fii kala mo wonaa gaɲo mon, haray ko giɗo mon.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Samariyankeeɓe ɓen Salornoo Tolnude Iisaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii balɗe ɗe Iisaa ittetee ka aduna ɗoo ɗen hewtii, o fiɓi anniyee yahugol Yerusalaam. <verse number="52" style="v"/>O immini woɓɓe ko hikkoo yeeso makko, ɓen yahi haa e hoɗo Samariyankeeɓe goo fii eɓɓindanagol mo ɗon kanko Iisaa. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Kono ɓen yimɓe jaɓaali mo tolnude, ɓay ko Yerusalaam o sutii. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe yi'ii ɗun, Yaaquuba e Yuuhanna wi'i Iisaa: «Koohoojo amen, hiɗon faalaa yo men wi'u yo yiite ngen iwu ka kammu ara mula ɓee?» <verse number="55" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa fewti e maɓɓe, feli ɓe fota. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ontuma ɓe yaari e hoɗo goo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii ɓen Faalaaɓe Jokkude Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mat. 8.19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>E nder ko ɓe yahata kon, goɗɗo wi'i mo: «Mi jokkete kala ka yaaruɗaa.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ndoni ɗin no mari gayɗe mun, awa kadi colli ɗin ka weeyo no mari ɲakkaaji mun, kono Ɓii-Aaden on kan alaa hay ka fowtina hoore mun nden.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i goɗɗo goo: «Jokkan!»</para>
  <para style="p">On jaabii mo: «Koohoojo, newnanee lan taho, mi yaha mi wattinoya ben an en.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Kono Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Accu mayɓe ɓen wattina mayɓe mun ɓen, kono an yahaa feɲɲinoyaa fii laamu Alla ngun.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v"/>Goɗɗo goo kadi wi'i mo: «Koohoojo, mi jokkay on, kono newnanee lan taho, mi yaha mi waynoyoo ɓeynguure an nden.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i onɗon kadi: «Kala fawuɗo jungo mun e hoore keri sarin, ontigi yeƴƴitii ɓaawo, haray on nafataa laamu Alla ngun.»</para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Taalibaaɓe ɓen Cappanɗe Njeeɗiɗo e Ɗiɗo Nuliraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-14">Mat. 10.5-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ɓay feƴƴii e ɗun, Koohoojo on toɗɗii fahin taalibaaɓe cappanɗe njeeɗiɗo e ɗiɗo. O imminiri ɓe ɗiɗo ɗiɗo ko yaha adoyoo mo e ca'e ɗen fow e kala nokkeeli ɗi o rewoyta e mun. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «Baagol ngol no ɗuuɗi, kono wa'ooɓe ɓen ɗuuɗaa. Awa jooni, toree non Jom baagol ngol yo o addu wa'ooɓe ka baagol makko. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jooni miɗo imminirde on wa baaloy e hakkunde caapaali, yahee. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Awa kadi wota on yooɓo bonfohun kaalisi maa sasa maa paɗe goo, hara kadi on hiwraaki hay gooto ka hoore laawol. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kala suudu ndu naatoton e mun, wi'ee taho: ‹Yo ɓuttu wonu e nduu suudu!› <verse number="6" style="v"/>Si ɓii-ɓuttu no e nder ndun suudu, ɓuttu mon on juuroto mo. Si ko liddu mun, on ɓuttu wontanay on. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tabitee e ndun suudu ɗon, ɲaamon yaron ko ɓe okkori on ɗon woo, ko fii golloowo no handi e njoddi mun, hara on waɗaali naata e nduu yalta e nduu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>«Kala saare nde naatuɗon e mun tolnaɗon, ɲaamee ko ɓannanaɗon kon. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Sellinon ɲawɓe ɓe tawɗon ɗon ɓen, wi'on ɓe wonde *laamu Alla ngun ɓadike ɓe. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kono kala saare nde naatuɗon e mun, ɓe salii on tolnude, yahee ka fottirde maɓɓe, wi'on: <verse number="11" style="v"/>‹Men fiɗɗay e mon mbullaari saare mon nangundi men ndin e koyɗe! Kono andee tun wonde, laamu Alla ngun ɓadike!› <verse number="12" style="v"/>Mi andinii on, ɲande ɲaawoore nden ko ndee saare *Saduuma ɓuretee hoynaneede edii nden saare ɗon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>«Bone wonanii ndee saare Kuuraziin e ndee saare Bayti-Sa'iida! Ko fii si tawno ɗii kaawakeeji moƴƴi waɗunooɗi ka mon, ko non waɗirnoo e ɗee ca'e Tiiri e Siduuna, harayno neeɓii ko jeyaaɓe e ɗen ca'e ɓornii conci heynorɗi, ɓe wujitii ndoondi fii hollugol wonde ɓe tuubii. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi, ɲande ɲaawoore nden ko Tiiri e Siduuna ɓuretee hoynaneede edii onon. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Onon non, ɓee ɓe Kafernahuum, hiɗon sikka fii mon ɓantete haa ka aljanna? Oo'o, on bugete ka jahannama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>«Kala heɗitiiɗo on onon ɓee taalibaaɓe an, haray ko min o heɗitii. Kala bugitiiɗo on, haray ko min o bugitii. Awa-le kala bugitiiɗo lan, haray ko Nuluɗo lan on o bugitii.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ɓen cappanɗe njeeɗiɗo e ɗiɗo artidi e weltaare, ɓe wi'i: «Koohoojo amen, hay jinnaaji ɗin yankinanike men e innde mon!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Mi yi'ayno Ibuliisa no iwa ka kammu yanira wa farɲitere. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Awa mi okkii on bawgal tippugol e bolle ɗen e jahe ɗen e kala bawɗe gaɲo on, hara hay fus heɓaali on. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Wota on weltor ko jinnaaji ɗin yankinanii on kon. Kono weltoree ko inɗe mon ɗen windaa ka kammuuli kon.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Weltaare Iisaa nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mat. 11.25-27</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 13:16-17">13.16-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ko e on saa'i ɗon tigi, Iisaa heɓi weltaare fota immorde e *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on, o wi'i: «Mi yettii ma yo Baaba, Jom leydi e kammu, fii koo ko wirnanɗaa ɗun ɓen faamuɓe e ɓee gandiɗuɓe, feɲɲinanɗaa ɗun ɓee fayɓe. Hiiyii, ko fii ko ɗun wonnoo yiɗi maa on yo Baaba.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>«Awa, Baaba an wattii fow e juuɗe an. Awa kadi hay gooto andaa ko hombo woni Ɓiɗɗo on si hinaa Baabaajo on, wano tawiri non kadi hay gooto andaa ko hombo woni Baabaajo on si hinaa Ɓiɗɗo on e on mo Ɓiɗɗo on faalaa mo feɲɲinande.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Onsay o fewtiti taalibaaɓe ɓen o wi'i ɓe e qunuutu: «Gite yi'uɗe ko yi'uɗon kon malii! <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ko fii mi andinii on, annabaaɓe e lamɓe buy faalano yi'ude koo ko wonɗon yi'ude, kono ɓe yi'aali. Ɓe faalano kadi nanude koo ko wonɗon nanude, kono ɓe nanaali.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Samariyankeejo Moƴƴo on</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Onsay goɗɗo e waawuɓe fii Sariya ɓen immii landii mo fii ndarndagol mo, o wi'i mo: «Karamoko'en, ko honɗun mi haani waɗude fii yo mi heɓu ɗan *ngurndan poomayankejan?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «Ko honɗun windii ka defte Sariya? Ko honno faamirɗaa ɗun?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>O jaabii mo, o wi'i: «Yo a yiɗir Alla Joomiraaɗo maa on ɓernde maa nden fow e wonkii maa kin fow e doole maa ɗen fow e hakkil maa kin fow<note caller="ŋ" style="f">10.27a Yaɲ. 6.5 </note>, yiɗiraa ɲokondo maa on wano yiɗirɗaa hoore maa non.»<note caller="p" style="f">10.27b Lew. 19.18 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «A jaaborii no moƴƴiri. Warru non, a heɓay ɗan ngurndan.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kono tawi on no faalaa hollude peewal mun ngal, o wi'i Iisaa: «Ko hombo non woni on ɲokondo an?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabori mo nii, o wi'i: «Goɗɗo no iwraynoo Yerusalaam, no yaha Yeerikoo. O hawrondiri e wuyɓe, ɓen ɓoori mo, piyi mo haa moggo mayde, ɓe yahi, ɓe acci mo ɗon. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hawrondiri *yottinoowo sadaka no feƴƴaynoo ɗon, o yi'i oo neɗɗo, o takkii mo, o feƴƴi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Fahin *Lewiyankeejo ari tawi mo ɗon, on kadi yi'i mo, takkii mo, feƴƴi. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kono Samariyankeejo wonɗo e nder safaari mun, ari tawi mo, yurmaa mo. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Onsay o ɓadii, o juurani mo njaram e nebban ka barmeeji, o haɓɓi. Onsay o waɗi mo ka mbaɗɗateeri makko, o naɓi mo haa e suudu hoɓɓe, o dankii mo. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Bimbi mun, o ƴetti *dinaruuji ɗiɗi, o jonni jom suudu hoɓɓe ndun, o wi'i mo: ‹Dankor mo ɗii ɗoo. Kala ko fawoyɗaa e hoore ɗii ɗoo, mi yoɓitoyte tuma mi rewtoyi.› »</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Ontuma Iisaa wi'i: «Ko hombo e ɓee ɗoo tato woni ɲokondo oo mo ɓee wuyɓe yani e mun?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>On waawuɗo fii Sariya jaabii, wi'i: «Ko yurmaaɗo mo on.»</para>
  <para style="p">Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «Yahu an kadi warraa non.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Mariyatu e Mariyama Werniri Iisaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Fewndo Iisaa e taalibaaɓe mun ɓen wonnoo e hoore laawol, ɓe naati ɗon e hoɗo. Debbo wi'eteeɗo Mariyatu werni ɓe ka mun. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Tawi on no mari neene-gooto wi'eteeɗo Mariyama, on jooɗii e ley koyɗe Koohoojo on no heɗitoo konguɗi makko ɗin. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Tawi Mariyatu kaɲun no jindidude e muraaɗi nder suudu ɗin. Onsay o ari, o wi'i: «Koohoojo an, on kippataa fii ko oo neene-gooto an accidimmi e ɗee golle ɗoo kon fow? Wi'anee lan mo yo o wallito lan!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Koohoojo on jaabii mo, wi'i: «Mariyatu, Mariyatu! Hiɗa maapii aani fii piiji ɗuuɗuɗi. <verse number="42" style="v"/>Kono ko huunde wootere tun hitti. Mariyama kaɲun suɓike ko ɓuri hittude kon, ɗun-le o jaɓitantaake ɗun.»</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Taalibaaɓe ɓen Haani Tororde Alla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mat. 6.9-13</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7.7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ɲande goo tawi Iisaa no toraade Alla nokku goo. Ɓay o gaynii toraade, goɗɗo e taalibaaɓe makko ɓen wi'i mo: «Koohoojo, tindinee men no torortee wano Yaayaa tindinirnoo non taalibaaɓe mun ɓen.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Nde hiɗon toroo, on wi'iray nii:</para>
  <para style="q">«Baaba,</para>
  <para style="q2">yo innde maa nden hormore,</para>
  <para style="q2">yo laamu maa ngun feeɲu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Okkor men ɲande woo ɲaametee haananɗo men on.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Yaafanoɗaa men junuubaaji amen ɗin,</para>
  <para style="q2">wano menen kadi men woni yaaforande kala bonnuɗo men.</para>
  <para style="q2">Wota a naadu men e jarrabuyee.»</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>O wi'i kadi: «Si goɗɗo e mon aru e immaade tumbere jemma, yaha ka njaatigi mun, o findina mo, o wi'a mo: ‹Njaatigi, ɲawlan bireediije tati, <verse number="6" style="v"/>ko fii miɗo heɓi koɗo ka jemma ɗoo, mi alaa hay fus ko mi okkora mo.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>«Si on non mo o findinoyi wi'ii mo: ‹Mi torike ma wota a finnan, ko fii a taw mi falii baafal ngal, min e fayɓe an ɓen men waalike. Mi waawataa immaade fewndo ɗoo, mi jonne bireedi!› <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mi andinii on, hay si o immaaki, o jonnira mo sabu njaatigiyaagal wongal hakkunde maɓɓe ngal, o jonniray mo kala ko o handi sabu ko on torotooɗo haɓɓitori angal hersa kon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>«Min-le mi wi'ii on: Toree, on okkorte. Ɗaɓɓee, on heɓay. Hoɗɗee, on udditante. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ko fii kala toriiɗo okkorte, kala ɗaɓɓuɗo heɓay, awa kadi kala on hoɗɗiiɗo udditante.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>«Ko hombo e mon, ɓiɗɗo mun torotoo ɗun bireedi, ontigi jonna mo hayre? Maa o toroo mo lingii, ontigi jonna mo mboddi? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Maa o toroo mo woofoonde, o jonna mo yaare? <verse number="13" style="v"/>Si tawii non hay onon bonɓe ɓen, hiɗon waawi waɗande ɓiɓɓe mon ɓen piiji moƴƴi, haray ko haa honto Ben mon Wonɗo ka kammu on okkorta ɓen toriiɓe mo *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on!»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Raɗori Jinnaaji ɗin</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mat. 12.22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:22-27">Mrk. 3.22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ɲande goo Iisaa raɗii jinnawii mbobinɗinngii goɗɗo. No ngii yaltirnoo e ontigi, o wowli, jamaa wonnooɗo ɗon on fow mugaa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Woɓɓe e maɓɓe wi'i: «Ko e immorde e *Balzabuula lanɗo jinnaaji ɗin o woni raɗorde jinnaaji ɗin!» <verse number="16" style="v"/>Woɓɓe goo kadi fii ndarndagol mo torii mo hollugol ɓe maande iwrunde ka kammu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Nde tawnoo himo andi ɗin miijooji maɓɓe, o wi'i: «Kala laamateeri liddondirndi, kayri tigi ndi caabay. Awa kadi si suudu liddondirii, ndu lancoto. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Onon hiɗon wi'a ko tippude e Balzabuula mi woni raɗorde jinnaaji ɗin. Si tawii non Ibuliisa liddike hoore mun tigi, ko honno laamateeri makko ndin tabitirta? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Si tawii non wonii min ko tippude e Balzabuula mi raɗorta jinnaaji ɗin, ɗun haray onon ɓe mon ɓen non ko tippude e hombo ɓe raɗorta ɗi? Ko ɗun waɗi si kamɓe tigi ɓe ɲaawoyay on. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Kono si tawii ko tippude e bawgal Alla ngal mi woni raɗorde jinnaaji ɗin, haray *laamu Alla ngun arii haa e mon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>«Nde neɗɗo dolnuɗo jom aalaaji ayni galle mun woo, jawle mun ɗen daɗay. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Kono si tawii ɓurɗo mo doole arii, yanii e makko, foolii mo, o jaɓitay ɗin jogaaji ɗi o hoolornoo, o sendita ɗen jawle makko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>«Kala mo aldaa e an, haray ko gaɲo an, awa kadi kala mo wallataa lan mooɓitude, haray ko saakoowo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>«Nde jinnawii yalti e neɗɗo woo, ngii hammiray ka wulaa, hara hingii ɗaɓɓa nokkuure fowtorde. Si ngii tawii ngii heɓaali, ngii wi'ay: ‹Yo mi yiltito ka suudu ka mi iwnoo ɗon.› <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nde ngii hewtiti, ngii tawa ndun suudu fittaama laɓɓinaama. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Onsay ngii yahay, ngii ɗaɓɓoya jinnaaji jeeɗiɗi ɓurɗi ngii hunƴude, ɗi naata ɗon, ɗi hoɗa. Onsay sakkitorde on neɗɗo ɓuray aranun ɗun bonude.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Fewndo ko Iisaa yewtaynoo ɗun, debbo ewnii ka hakkunde jamaa ton, wi'i: «Maloore wonanii nduu reedu saawundu ma e ɗin enɗi ɗi muynuɗaa!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Kono Iisaa jaabii, wi'i: «Maloore wonanii kan ɓen heɗotooɓe daaluyee Alla on, ɗoftoo mo!»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Maande Annabi Yuunusa nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mat. 12.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Nde tawnoo jamaa on no ɓeydaade tun, onsay kanko Iisaa o wi'i: «Nguu jamaanu ɗoo ko jamaanu bonngu, hingu ɗaɓɓa maande. Kono ngu jonnetaake maande si hinaa sifa ndee nde Yuunusa. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ko fii ko wano Yuunusa wonirannoo yimɓe ndee saare *Niinawa maande non, ko wano non *Ɓii-Aaden on kadi woniranta nguu jamaanu ɗoo maande. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ɲande ɲaawoore nden, nde yimɓe nguu jamaanu ɗoo no ɲaawee woo, onsay oo debbo laaminooɗo ndii leydi hikkorndi ka sengo ɲaamo immoyto, ɲaawoya ɓe sabu iwugol mo haa ka kattudi leyɗe, ara heɗitoo ngun faamu Sulaymaana, hara-le ɓurɗo Sulaymaana no ɗoo. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Awa kadi ɲande ɲaawoore nden, nde yimɓe nguu jamaanu ɗoo no ɲaawee woo, yimɓe Niinawa ɓen kadi immoyto, ɲaawoya ɓe sabu ko ɓe heɗinoo waaju Yuunusa ngun, ɓe tuubi, hara-le ɓurɗo Yuunusa no ɗoo.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Lampu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mat. 5.15</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 6:22-23">6.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:21">Mrk. 4.21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>«Hay gooto huɓɓintaa lampu suuɗa mo maa hippa mo e ley siyonwal, kono o waɗay mo e kene fii no naatooɓe ɓen yi'ira ndaygu ngun. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ko yiitere maa nden woni ndaygu ɓandu ndun. Si tawii yiitere maa nden no selli, haray ɓandu maa ndun fow no ndaygi. Si tawii non yiitere nden no ɲawi, haray ɓandu maa ndun no e nder niwre. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Reenee wota ndaygu wongu e mon ngun wontan on niwre. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Si tawii ɓandu mon ndun no ndaygi, hara teral mon hay gootal alaa ka niwre, ɗun haray ɓandu mon ndun fow no ndaygiri wa nde ndaygu lampu jalbi e mon.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Hajori Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mat. 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Mrk. 12.38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko Iisaa yewtaynoo ɗun, *Fariisiyaajo goo torii mo yo ɓe yaadu ka makko, ɓe hirtodoya. Onsay o naati, o jooɗi fii ɲaamugol. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kono Fariisiyaajo on ŋalɗi ko Iisaa toolii fii ɲaamugol kon sooɗaaki. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Onsay Koohoojo on wi'i mo: «Onon ɓee Fariisiyaaɓe, ko ɓaawo miranji ɗin tun laɓɓinton, hara hiɗon heewi miile e bonki. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Onon ko on faaɗa-hakkilɓe, hara hinaa Taguɗo ɓaawo on tagi nder on kadi? <verse number="41" style="v"/>Okkoree waasuɓe ɓen ko woni ka nder kon, onsay ko heddii kon fow laaɓanay on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>«Kono bone wonanii on, onon ɓee Fariisiyaaɓe, ɓay hiɗon ittana naana e suukooran e kala tutateeriiji wonɗi e naakoo farilla, hara hiɗon welsindanii peewal ngal Alla yeɗata ngal e giggol makko ngol. Hara-le ko ɗun haanunoɗon jokkude, tawa kadi on welsindaaki e ko heddii kon.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>«Bone wonanii on, onon ɓee Fariisiyaaɓe, ɓay hiɗon yiɗi saffawol aranol ngol ka juulirɗe e hiwreede ka fottirɗe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Bone wonanii on, ɓay hiɗon wa'i wa genaale ɗe aldaa e maande, ɗe goɗɗo rewata e mun hara andaali!»<note caller="q" style="f">11.44 Tippude e Sariya Muusa on, si goɗɗo meemi furee maa o rewii e yenaande, haray o wonii harmuɗo. Lew. 21.11, Ada. 19.11 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Onsay goɗɗo e hakkunde waawuɓe fii Sariya ɓen ƴetti haala kan, wi'i mo: «Karamoko'en, si on maakirii nii, haray on aybinii men menen kadi!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v"/>Ontuma Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Bone wonanii on onon kadi ɓee waawuɓe fii Sariya, ɓay hiɗon fawa yimɓe ɓen dolle ɗe ɓe waawataa naɓude, hara onon on fopportaa ɗun hay hoore hondu fii wallugol ɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>«Bone wonanii on, ɓay hiɗon maha maandina genaale annabaaɓe ɓen, hara-le ko baabiraaɓe mon ɓen sahinbini ɓe. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ɗun no seedintini wonde hiɗon newni ɗen kuuɗe ɓen baabiraaɓe mon, ɓay ɓen sahinbiniino annabaaɓe ɓen, onon kadi hiɗon mahude maandina genaale maɓɓe ɗen. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi si Alla, Jom faamu on, no daalunoo: ‹Mi naɓanay ɓe annabaaɓe e nulaaɓe, ɓe wara woɓɓe e ɓen, ɓe tampina ɓeya ɓen›, <verse number="50" style="v"/>fii no nguu jamaanu ɗoo ƴantiroyee ƴiiƴan annabaaɓe hibbanooɗan ɗan gila ka fuɗɗoode aduna, <verse number="51" style="v"/>ɗun ko gila e ƴiiƴan Haabiila ɗan haa addani e ƴiiƴan Zakariyaa ɗan, on waranooɗo hakkunde *layyorde nden e *juulirde mawnde nden. Mi andinii on, pellet nguu jamaanu ɗoo ƴantoyte fii ɗun.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>«Bone wonanii on, onon ɓee waawuɓe fii Sariya, ɓay on suuɗii saabiwal gandal ngal, on naataali, awa kadi on jaɓaali faalanooɓe naatude ɓen naata!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ɓay o yaltii ɗon, jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen wondude e Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen fuɗɗii mo monanaade, landoo mo lande ɗuuɗuɗe, <verse number="54" style="v"/>waɗana mo pirci, fii tun no ɓe nangira mo immorde e konguɗi makko ɗin.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Hajannde e Waaju</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26-28">Mat. 10.26-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Wa fewndo onsay, tawi yimɓe guluuje guluuje mooɓondirii haa hiɓe yaaɓindira. Onsay Iisaa attii wi'i taalibaaɓe mun ɓen: «Reenee e lewen *Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen, ɗun ko faasiqankaaku ngun. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Alaa ko suuɗii ko feeɲataa, awa kadi alaa gundoo mo andotaako. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi, kala ko wowluɗon ka niwre feeɲay ɲalorma teɗɗan, e kala ko sowndiɗon ka cuuɗi ewnorte ka warɲakke.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>«Mi andinii on yo yiɓɓe an, wota on hulu warooɓe ɓandu ɓen, toonin ɗun alaa ko ɓe waawi. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Mi hollay on On mo gasoton hulude: hulee on Marɗo bawgal warugol bugoo ka jahannama nde wari. Mi andinii on, ko on Marɗo bawgal waɗugol ɗun haanuɗon hulude. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Hinaa seresereeji jowi no yeeyee tammaaji ɗiɗi? Kono Allaahu on kaɲun yejjitaa hay gootun e majji. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Hay cukuli ko'e mon ɗen fow no limaa. Wota on hulu, ko fii hiɗon ɓuri seresereeji buy hittude ka Alla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>«Mi andinii on, kala qirritiiɗo fii an yeeso yimɓe ɓen, *Ɓii-Aaden on kadi qirritoyto fii makko yeeso malaa'ikaaɓe Alla ɓen. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Kono kala yedduɗo fii an yeeso yimɓe ɓen, fii ontigi yeddoyte e yeeso malaa'ikaaɓe Alla ɓen. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kala wowluɗo Ɓii-Aaden on ko boni, no ara ka yaafanee. Kono kala hoynuɗo *Ruuhu Seniiɗo on yaafantaake.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>«Tuma noddaɗon ka juulirɗe e yeeso mawɓe ɓen e laamiiɓe ɓen, wota on jiɓoyo ko jaaboɗon maa ko wi'on. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ko fii ɗon kisan Ruuhu Seniiɗo on tigi longinay on ko gasoton yewtude kon.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Galo Faaɗa-Hakkiljo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Goɗɗo e hakkunde on jamaa wi'i Iisaa: «Karamoko'en, maakanee ben-gooto an on yo men sendodu ndondi amen ndin.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>O jaabii on neɗɗo, o wi'i: «Ko hombo waɗimmi ɲaawoowo maa sendanoowo on?» <verse number="15" style="v"/>O watti e ɗun: «Reenee wattanon yiila e kala miile, ko fii ko aaden alɗi woo, ngurndan makko ɗan hinaa e ɗun humii.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Onsay o waɗani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i: «No woodunoo neɗɗo alɗuɗo mo toore leydi mun moƴƴiri ɗun fota. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tawi on neɗɗo no miijotonoo, wi'a: ‹Ko honno mi waɗata, ko fii mi alaa ka mi waɗa ngal coɲal an?› <verse number="18" style="v"/>O wi'itii: ‹E hino ko mi waɗata kon: Mi lancay tumusuuje an ɗen, mi moƴƴina ɓurɗe ɗe njanɗude ka mi loowa nenɗe an ɗen e piiji an ɗin fow. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Jooni yo wonkii an, ɓay miɗo mari jawle buy ko yonatammi e nder duuɓi buy, yo mi fowto, mi ɲaama, mi yara, mi weltoo!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>«Kono Allaahu on wi'i mo: ‹Ko an yo faaɗa-hakkiljo, e nder oo jemma ɗoo tigi a ƴantete wonkii maa kin. E hara koo ko faandiɗaa, ko hombo ɗun wontanta?›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>«Awa ko nii woniranta kala on mooɓuɗo jawle e ɓaawo alɗangol Alla.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hakkunde Anndeeji e Keyeeji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mat. 6.25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i taalibaaɓe mun ɓen: «Ko ɗun waɗi si mi wi'ay on wonde, wota on aanu fii ko ɲaamon e nder ngurndan mon ɗan maa fii ko ɓornon ɓalli mon ɗin. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ko fii ngurndan no ɓuri neema, awa kadi ɓandu no ɓuri koltu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ndaaree kayakayaaji ɗin: ɗi sankataa, ɗi wa'ataa, ɗi alaa tumusuuje e caagaaje, kono Allaahu on no wurni ɗi, hara-le hiɗon ɓuri colli ɗin hittude. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Ko hombo e mon e nder annde mun waawata ɓeydude ngurndan mun ɗan beru sogonal? <verse number="26" style="v"/>Si tawii non on waawataa hay ko ɓuri lo'ude kon, haray ko honɗun aananton fii ko lutti kon?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>«Ndaaree no ɗii piindiiji fuɗirta njanɗa, hara-le ɗi gollataa, ɗi saɲɲataa. Kono non mi andinii on, hay Sulaymaana e nder darja mun on fow holtiraali hay wa wootiri e majji. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Si tawii non Allaahu on no holtinirde non hay huɗo wonuko hande ka ngesa kon, bugoyteeko jango ka yiite kon, hara o ronkay waɗande on ko ɓuri ɗun, onon ɓee fanɗa-gomɗinalɓe? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Onon non wota on yango fii ko ɲaamon maa ko yaron, wota fii ɗun maapin on. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ko fii ɗun fow ko ɓe gomɗinaa ka aduna ɓen ɗaɓɓata ɗun. Kono Ben mon Wonɗo ka kammu on no andi hiɗon handi e ɗun. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Kono ɗaɓɓee tun laamu makko ngun, ɗin piiji fow ɓeydanoyte on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>«Ko onon yo wuro tosooko, wota on hulu fus, sabu Ben mon Wonɗo ka kammu on tawii no wela mo ka o yeɗa on laamu ngun. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Yeeyee ko jeyɗon kon, okkoron miskinɓe ɓen, moƴƴinee bonfooji ɗi hiɗɗataa, ɗun wonanay on keyee mo lannataa ka kammuuli, ɗon mooƴataa, awa kadi ngujjo meemataa. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ko fii ko ka keyee mon on woni woo, ɓernde mon nden wonata.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Reenugol e dow Hebulaare</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>«Wonee hebuliiɓe,<note caller="r" style="f">12.35 Maa: <char style="it">«daditiiɓe».</char> </note> hara lampuuji mon ɗin no huɓɓi. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wa'on wa nde jiyaaɗo tijjii jom mun, hara ko yahuɗo peera, hara no on hewtitiri hoɗɗii, o udditanay mo. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Ɓen jiyaaɓe malii nde jom maɓɓe ari tawi hiɓe aynude. Ka haqiiqa mi andinii on, jom ɓen daditoto, o ɓannana ɓe ko ɓe ɲaama. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Ɓen jiyaaɓe ɓe jom mun tawi no ayna tumbere jemma maa ka tataɓal jemma, haray ɓen malii. <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ko fii andee fota, si tawno jom galle no andunoo nde ngujjo on araynoo wujjugol, haray o accataano galle makko ɗen fusee. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Awa onon kadi hebilee, ko fii Ɓii-Aaden on aroyay e saa'i nde on sogitaaki.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Jiyaaɗo Holniiɗo e Jiyaaɗo Bonɗo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mat. 24.45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Onsay Petruusu wi'i mo kanko Iisaa: «Koohoojo amen, hara ngal misal ɗoo ko fii amen tun kaa ko fii yimɓe ɓen fow?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Koohoojo on jaabii mo, wi'i: «Hara ko golloowo hombo reeniiɗo holniiɗo woni ko jom mun halfinta neemingol kurkaaɗi mun ɗin e saa'i haanuɗo? <verse number="43" style="v"/>Maloore wonanii on jiyaaɗo mo jom mun ari tawi no jokkiri non. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ka haqiiqa mi andinii on, o halfinay mo jawle makko ɗen fow. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Kono si on jiyaaɗo wi'itike: ‹Jom an neeɓii araali›, onsay, o nangana tilfugol kurkaaduuɓe ɓen worɓe e rewɓe e ɲaamugol yara haa mandila, <verse number="46" style="v"/>jom on jiyaaɗo aray nde on jiyaaɗo sabbaaki mo e saa'i mo o sogitaaki, o letta mo lette sattuɗe, o waɗa mo ka ɓe gomɗinaa ɓen waɗetee ton.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>«Jiyaaɗo anduɗo faaleeji jom mun ɗin, kono o eɓɓindaaki, maa o waɗaali faaleeji jom makko ɗin, o piyete piggal ɗuuɗungal. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kono si tawii non ontigi andaa faale jom mun on, o waɗii kuuɗe fodduɗe e donkineede, o foccete ko hawri. On okkoraaɗo ko ɗuuɗi ƴantete ko ɗuuɗi, awa kadi on halfinaaɗo ko ɗuuɗi landitoyte ko ɓurti.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Liddondiral</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mat. 10.34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>«Miɗo ari bugagol yiite e oo aduna, mi faalete hara nge huɓɓii! <verse number="50" style="v"/>Kono no woodi loƴegol ngol mi loƴoytee, e maanaa ɗun ko tampere, ɗoo yo ɗun sollitanan, haray miɗo sonjii. <verse number="51" style="v"/>E hara on sikku ko addugol ɓuttu e oo aduna mi arani? Oo'o, hinaa ɗun, kono ko liddondiral mi addi. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ko fii gila jooni njowo wonduɓe e nder suudu ɓe woncondiray, tato liddondiray e ɓeya ɗiɗo, ɓeya ɗiɗo kadi liddondira e ɓeya tato. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Baaba liddondiray e ɓiɗɗo, ɓiɗɗo liddondira e baaba, neene liddondira e jiwo mun, jiwo kadi liddondira e neene mun, debbo liddondira e esiraawo mun jiwo, jiwo on kadi liddondira e esiraawo mun debbo.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Faamugol Firo Saa'iiji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2-3">Mat. 16.2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i kadi jamaa on: «No yiiruɗon duulere no immori ka hirnaange, on wi'ay kisan ‹ndiyan ɗan aray›, ɗun wonira non. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Awa kadi no yiiruɗon hendu ndun iwrii sengo ɲaamo woo, on wi'ay ‹nguleendi ndin arii›, ɗun kadi waɗa. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Ko onon yo faasiqiiɓe, on waawii faamude fii ko feeɲi ka leydi kon e ko feeɲi ka kammu kon. Ko fii honɗun non on waawaali andude oo saa'i fewndiiɗo ɗoo?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>«Hara ko fii honɗun onon on waawataa faamande hoore mon ko feewi kon? <verse number="58" style="v"/>Nde an e mo haɓiduɗaa hiɗon yaha ka yeesoojo on woo, waɗu feere no faamondiriron ka laawol, fii wota o watte e juuɗe ɲaawoowo on, on ɲaawoowo kadi watte e juuɗe aynooɓe kaso ngon, ɓen sokoye. <verse number="59" style="v"/>Mi andinii ma, a yaltataa ɗon fannamaa a yoɓaali mbuuɗu sakkitoro on.»</para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Ewol Tuubuubuyee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ko fewndo onsay, woɓɓe ari fillitanii Iisaa fii ɓee ɓe Jaliilu ɓe Pilaatu warnoo fewndo ɓe hirsata daabeeji fii ittugol sadakaaji maɓɓe. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O jaabii ɓe kanko Iisaa, o wi'i: «Hara on sikku ɓen ɓe Jaliilu no ɓuri Jaliiluyankooɓe ɓen fow junuubu ɓay ɓe lettorii non? <verse number="3" style="v"/>Min mi wi'ay on - oo'o! Kono si on tuubaali onon kadi, on fow on re'ay. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kaa hara on sikku ɓee sappoo e njeetato, ɓe nduu suudu aynirdu ka maadi Siluwaama yani e mun wari, no ɓuri ɓee ɓe Yerusalaam luttuɓe fow bakkatu? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Min mi wi'ay on - oo'o! Kono si on tuubaali onon kadi, on fow on re'ay.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Onsay o waɗani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo: «Tawi goɗɗo no marnoo ƴibbehi ka tutateeri mun. O ari ɗaɓɓugol ɓiɓɓe e makki, o heɓaali. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i gollanoowo mo on ka tutateeri: ‹Heɓii nii duuɓi tati miɗo arude ɗaɓɓugol ɓiɓɓe e ngal leggal, mi heɓaali. Hara ko nafa honɗun ngal wonani ɗoo? Jooni soppu ngal!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>«Kono golloowo on jaabii mo, wi'i: ‹Jom an, accee ngal ɗoo ndee hitaande ɗoo. Ɗoo e ɗun mi jasay binde maggal on fow mi waɗana ngal ɲolu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>No gasa ka ngal rima ko arata. Si ko liddu mun, onsay on soppoyay ngal.› »</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Debbo Jukkunnaajo on Selliniraa e Aseweere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tawi ɲande goo Iisaa no jannaynoo e juulirde goo e *ɲalaande fowteteende nden, ɗun ko asewe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Tawi no ɗon debbo mo jinnawii jukkini heɓii duuɓi sappoo e jeetati, himo turii, o waawataano ɓantaade few. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa yi'ii mo, o noddi mo, o wi'i: «Debbo, a sendaama e jukkere maa nden!» <verse number="13" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa *fawi juuɗe mun ɗen e makko. Ɗon kisan debbo on feewi e darnde, o manti Allaahu on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kono yeesoojo juulirde nden seytini kon ko Iisaa ɲawndi ɲande asewe, o wi'i jamaa on: «No woodi balɗe jeegoo gaseteeɗe golleede e mun. Aree ɲawndeɗon e ɗen balɗe ɗon, hara hinaa e ɲalaande asewe!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Koohoojo on jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ko onon yo faasiqiiɓe! Hinaa mo kala e mo'on yaltinay nagge mun maa mbabba mun ka dingiraa mun ɲande asewe, naɓa yarnoya? <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hara oo debbo iwdi Ibraahiima mo Ibuliisa haɓɓi gila duuɓi sappoo e jeetati, haanaa ka o firtanee ɗin kaɓɓi ɲande ɲalaande fowteteende nden?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ɓay o yewtirii non, ɗun hersini ayɓe makko ɓen fow, kono jamaa luttuɗo on weltori ɗii piiji hittuɗi ɗi o waɗaynoo.</para>
  <para style="s">Mise Ƴettaaɗe e Abbere Bene e Lewen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31-33">Mat. 13.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Mrk. 4.30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>O wi'i fahin: «Hara ko honɗun *laamu Alla ngun nandi, maa ko honɗun mi eɓɓindirta e maggu? <verse number="19" style="v"/>Hingu wa'i wa abbere bene nde goɗɗo ƴetti, bugii ka suntuure mun. Nden fuɗi, wonti leggal ngal colli ɗin ka weeyo arata hoɗa e calɗi mun.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>O wi'i kadi: «E ko honɗun mi eɓɓindirta e laamu Alla ngun? <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hingu wa'i wa lewen mo debbo ƴetti, jillindiri e sariyaare tati condi farin, o piya ɗun, on lewen wona sabu ɗun fow ƴura.»</para>
  <para style="s">Yewtere fii Damun Tosokun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13-14">Mat. 7.13-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ko Iisaa yahaynoo Yerusalaam, o rewayno koɗolun e koɗolii hara himo waajoo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Goɗɗo goo landii mo, wi'i: «Koohoojo, hara ko yimɓe seeɗaaɓe tun dandoytee?»</para>
  <para style="p">Onsay o wi'i ɓe: <verse number="24" style="v"/>«Etee no naatiron ka dambugal faaɗungal, ko fii mi andinii on, buy ɗaɓɓoyay no naatira ɗon, kono ɓe waawoytaa. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Nde jom galle ɗen immii ombi baafal ngal woo, hara hiɗon ka yaasi, onsay on fuɗɗoto honkande mo baafal ngal, wi'a: ‹Koohoojo, udditanee men!› O jaaboyto on, o wi'a: ‹Min mi andaa ko on ɓe honto!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>«Wi'on kadi: ‹Men ɲaamuno men yaridi e mon, awa kadi on waajotono ka ɗate amen.› <verse number="27" style="v"/>O jaaboo on kadi, o wi'a: ‹Min mi andaa ko on ɓe honto. Onon ɓee waɗaynooɓe ko ɓoylii fow, pottitee lan!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>«Tuma yi'uɗon Ibraahiima e Issaaqa e Yaaquuba e ɓeya annabaaɓe heddiiɓe fow ka nder laamateeri Alla, tawa onon ko on bugoyteeɓe ka yaasi, ka wullaandu e ŋatindiro ɲiiƴe woni ton. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iwroyte funnaange e hirnaange, nano e ɲaamo, ɓe nafodoya ka laamateeri Alla. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Awa andee wonde, no woodi ɓaawooɓe wontiroyayɓe yeeso, wano tawiri non kadi no woodi yeesooɓe wontiroyayɓe ɓaawo.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Aanirani Yerusalaam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mat. 23.37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ko e on saa'i ɗon *Fariisiyaaɓe goo ari wi'i mo kanko Iisaa: «Yahu iwaa ɗoo, ko fii *Heroodu no faalaa sahinbinde ma!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «Yahee hollon ndun saafaandu: Miɗo raɗaade jinnaaji ɗin, mi sellina ɲawɓe ɓen hande e jango, ka ɲalaande tammere haray timmanii lan. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kono bee mi seppa hande e jango e faɗɗi-jango, ko fii haanaa ka annabaajo waree ko wonaa Yerusalaam.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>«Ee Yerusalaam! Ee Yerusalaam! Ko an yo saare sahinbinoore annabaaɓe, wariroore nelaaɓe e mun kaaƴe! Ko haa honto mi faalanoo mooɓude ɓee fayɓe maa wano gertogal mooɓirta coppi e ley gabitti mun, e hin-le on jaɓaali ɗun! <verse number="35" style="v"/>Awa nokkuure mon nden eggaama. Kono mi andinii on, on yiitataa lan haa ɲande wi'oyton: ‹Yo barki wonan oo wonɗo arude e innde Joomiraaɗo on!› »<note caller="s" style="f">13.35 Zab. 118.26 </note></para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Ɲawndiri Nawnuɗo Goo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>E *aseweere goo, ɗun ko *ɲalaande fowteteende nden, Iisaa naati e suudu hooreejo Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen fii nafagol, tawi ɓen Fariisiyaaɓe no tenƴina mo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tawi aaden ɓuutuɗo no yeeso makko ɗon. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa landii waawuɓe fii Sariya ɓen e Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen, o wi'i: «Hara no dagii ka ɲawndee e aseweere kaa dagaaki?» <verse number="4" style="v"/>Kono ɓe fow ɓe deƴƴi. Onsay o ƴetti on ɲawɗo, o sellini, o acciti mo, on yahi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Ko hombo e mon, si ɓiɗɗo mun maa nagge mun aru e yanude e nder woyndu, salotoo nge ƴawnude maa ƴawna mo ɗon kisan fii nden ɲande ko asewe?» <verse number="6" style="v"/>Laatii ɓe waawaali jaabaade hay huunde e ɗun.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Saatinirtee</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ɓay o yi'ii no ɓen saatinanooɓe suɓoraynoo ndaɗɗule yeesooje ɗen, o waɗani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i ɓe: <verse number="8" style="v"/>«Si on aru e saatineede e peera, wota on wonu ka ndaɗɗule yeesooje fii hita taw ɓurɗo on hittude no saatinaa ɗon <verse number="9" style="v"/>haa saatinɗo on on ara wi'a on: ‹Accanee oo ɗoo ndaɗɗudi ndin.› Onsay on hersay ruttagol ka ndaɗɗudi ɓaawoori. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Kono tuma saatinaɗon woo, wontiree ɓaawo fii tuma nde saatinɗo on on ari woo, yo o wi'u on: ‹Giɗo an, aru wonaa yeeso gaa.› Onsay ɗun wonanay on teddungal e tawnde ɓen ɓe saatindinaɗon fow. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ko fii kala mawnintiniiɗo jippinoyte, awa kadi kala jippinɗo hoore mun mawninoyte.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>Onsay kanko Iisaa o wi'i saatinɗo mo on: «Nde hiɗa soƴƴina maa hirtina woo, wota a saatin yiɓɓe maa ɓen maa neene-gootooɓe maa ɓen maa musiɓɓe maa ɓen maa kawtalɓe maa alɗuɓe ɓen, fii wota kamɓe kadi ɓe saatine ɲande goo, ɗun wonane njoddi. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kono nde waɗataa caatal woo, saatin miskinɓe ɓen e jukkunnaaɓe ɓen, e maanaa boofooɓe ɓen e bumɓe ɓen. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ɗun a wonoyay malaaɗo, ko fii ɓen alaa ko yoɓitire, a yoɓitoyte ɲande ummutal feewuɓe ɓen.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Saatinanooɓe fii Nafagol</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mat. 22.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ɓay goɗɗo e ɓe o nafodaynoo ɓen nanii ɗin konguɗi makko kanko Iisaa, o wi'i mo: «Maloore wonanoyay on nafoytooɗo ka *laamateeri Alla!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ɲande goo goɗɗo waɗuno caatal moolanaangal, o saatini yimɓe buy. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ɓay nafagol ngol fewndike, o nuli kurkaadu makko ndun yo on yahu wi'a ɓe o saatinnoo ɓen yo ɓen aru, ko fii hebulaama.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>«Kono ɓe fow ɓe kuylitidi. Arano on e maɓɓe wi'i ndun kurkaadu: ‹Miɗo soodi ngesa, bee mi yaha mi ndaaroya mba. Mi torike mo yo o yaafo lan.› <verse number="19" style="v"/>Goɗɗo on wi'i: ‹Miɗo soodi kalali sappo, miɗo yahude mi lasindoo ɗi, mi torike mo yo o yaafo lan.› <verse number="20" style="v"/>Goɗɗo goo kadi wi'i: ‹Miɗo jombi neeɓaali, ko ɗun haɗata mi yaha.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>«Ɓay kurkaadu ndun hewtitii, o yottintini e jom makko ko o nulaa kon fow. Onsay jom galle on tikki, o wi'i ndun kurkaadu makko: ‹Yahu kisan e ɗate ɗen fow, njane e tosooke, addanoyaa mi miskinɓe ɓen e jukkunnaaɓe ɓen e bumɓe ɓen e boofooɓe ɓen fow.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>«Kurkaadu ndun wi'i: ‹Jom an, ko yamirɗon kon waɗaama, kono haa jooni ka jooɗee no lutti.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>«Onsay jom galle ɗen wi'i kurkaadu ndun: ‹Yahu haa ka fulawaa, takkoɗaa kowle ɗen fow, rewaa e ɗatoy koy fow, etoɗaa no yimɓe ɓen arda fii no ka an heewira. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ko fii mi andinii on, hay gooto e ɓee ɓe mi saatinnoo aranun mettotaako oo nafakka an!› »</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Haanaa Jokkireede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37-38">Mat. 10.37-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Tawi jamaa moolanaaɗo no jokkondirnoo e Iisaa. O fewtiti ɓe, o wi'i: <verse number="26" style="v"/>«Si goɗɗo arii e an, hara o woniraa selugol ben makko e yumma makko e ɓeyngu makko e ɓiɓɓe makko ɓen e neene-gootooɓe makko ɓen worɓe e rewɓe haa naɓani wonkii makko kin tigi, haray onɗon waawataa wonude taalibaajo an. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Awa kadi kala mo ƴettaali *leggal mun altindiraangal ngal jokkimmi, haray ontigi waawataa wonude taalibaajo an.<note caller="t" style="f">14.27 <char style="it">«Ƴettugol leggal mun altindiraangal ngal»</char> ko hebilagol jokkugol Iisaa haa maaya.</note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>«Hara ko hombo e mon si no faalaa darnude koore, ronkata jooɗaade taho, taskoo fii ko o eɓɓi kon si ko ko yonata? <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kulol wota ootigi fuɗɗo ronka gaynude, fii wota yi'uɓe mo e ɗun ɓen fow jalu mo, <verse number="30" style="v"/>wi'a: ‹Oo neɗɗo fuɗɗino darnude, kono o waawaali lannitaade!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>«Maa hara ko lanɗo hombo fokkitanta haɓidoygol e lanɗo goo mo konu mun woni embere yimɓe guluuje noogayo, hara kanko ngu makko ngun ko embere yimɓe guluuje sappo, ronkata jooɗaade taho, taskoo si o heɓoyay kutu maɓɓe? <verse number="32" style="v"/>Si o tawii non o heɓoytaa kutu maɓɓe ɓay oya no woɗɗitii mo taho, o nelay e on fii yo on waɗan mo sartiiji no ɓuttu on tabitira. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi, kala e mon mo woniraa seedugol e ko o jeyi kon, haray gasataa wonde taalibaajo an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>«Lanɗan ko huunde moƴƴere, kono si dakamme majjan on iwii, haray ko honno dakamme majjan on wattirtee? <verse number="35" style="v"/>Haray ɗan alaa nafa ka leydi maa ka ɲolu, ko hawkoyteeɗan ka yaasi.</para>
  <para style="p">«Mo no mari noppi nanirɗi yo nanu!»</para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Baalii Majjungii</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mat. 18.12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ƴantooɓe sagalle ɓen fow wondude e junuubanke'en no ɓadotonoo Iisaa fii heɗagol mo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Fariisiyaaɓe* ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on no ŋunaynoo hakkunde maɓɓe, wi'a: «Oo ɗoo kaɲun ɓannitay junuubanke'en, ɲaamida e maɓɓe!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onsay kanko Iisaa o waɗani ɓen ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i: <verse number="4" style="v"/>«Ko hombo e mon si no mari baali teemedere, gootii e ɗin majja, ronkata accude cappanɗe jeenay e jeenayji ɗin ka wulaa, yaha ɗaɓɓitoya majjungii ngin haa nde o yiitoyi ngii woo? <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nde o yiitoyi ngii, o wakkoo ngii e hoore weltaare. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Nde o hewtiti ka makko, o nodditay yiɓɓe makko ɓen e kawtalɓe makko ɓen, o wi'a ɓe: ‹Weltodee e an, ko fii mi yiitii baalii an majjunoongii ngin!› <verse number="7" style="v"/>Mi andinii on, ko wano non kadi weltaare ɓurirta woodude ka kammu sabu junuubankeejo gooto tuubuɗo, edii feewuɓe cappanɗe njeenayo e njeenayo ɓe tuubuubuyee fawaaki ɗun.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Tammaaru Majjundu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>«Maa ko debbo hombo marɗo tammaaji sappo, si wooturu e ɗin majjirii mo, ronkata huɓɓude lampu, fitta suudu mun ndun, ɗaɓɓitira hakkil haa nde o yiiti ndu woo? <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nde o yiiti ndu, o nodditay yiɓɓe makko ɓen wondude e kawtalɓe makko ɓen, o wi'a ɓe: ‹Weltodee e an, ko fii mi yiitii tammaaru an majjunoondu ndun!› <verse number="10" style="v"/>Mi andinii on, ko wano non kadi malaa'ikaaɓe Alla ɓen weltorta tuma nde junuubankeejo gooto tuubi.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Ɓiɗɗo Funsoowo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>O wi'i kadi: «Goɗɗo no marnoo ɓiɓɓe ɗiɗo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Toolaajo makko on wi'i mo: ‹Baaba an, jonnee lan geɓal an ngal mi haani hendoyaade ngal ka jawdi mon.› Onsay ben maɓɓe sendani ɓe jawdi mun ndin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>«Ɓay balɗe feƴƴii, toolaajo on mooɓi ko o jeyi kon fow, o yahi e leydi woɗɗundi, o funsitoyi ton jawdi makko ndin fow e nder jiiɓaare. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ɓay o lannii fewjande fow, heege tiiɗunge waɗi e ndin leydi. Onsay o fuɗɗaa ŋakkireede. <verse number="15" style="v"/>O halfinoyii e goɗɗo goo jeyaaɗo e ndin leydi, on naɓi mo ka gese mun fii ko aynana ɗun koseeji mun ɗin. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Himo faaletenoo ɲaamude neteeje ɗe koseeji ɗin ɲaamaynoo ɗen, kono hay gooto okkoraali mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>«O luggini miijo, o wi'i: ‹Ko gollooɓe njelo ben an mari ɲaamooɓe haa luttina, hara min miɗo maaya ɗoo heege! <verse number="18" style="v"/>Jooni non, miɗo yiltitaade ka ben an, mi wi'a ɓe: Baaben, mi waɗii junuubu ka Alla, mi heɓii hakkee mon, <verse number="19" style="v"/>mi foddaa e noddeede ɓiɗɗo mon hande kadi. Jogoree lan wa golloowo mon.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>«Onsay o yiltitii ka ben makko. Ɓay o ɓadike, ben makko haynii mo, yurmaa mo. Tun ben makko dogi, hirbii mo, lunnii. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Onsay on ɓiɗɗo makko wi'i mo: ‹Baaben, mi heɓii junuubu ka Alla mi heɓii hakkee mon, mi foddaa e noddeede ɓiɗɗo mon hande kadi!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>«Kono ben makko yamiri kurkaaduuɓe mun ɓen, o wi'i ɓe: ‹Yahee tinna addanon mo kaftaane ɓurɗo fotude on ɓornon mo, waɗanon mo hurundaare ka hondu e paɗe ko o wattoo.› <verse number="23" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: ‹Addoyee ga'un fayukun kun, hirson, ɲaamen, weltoɗen. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ko fii hari oo ɓiɗɗo an ɗoo ko mayɗo, kono jooni o wuuritii, hari kadi o majjii, kono jooni o yiitaama!› Onsay ɓe woni e fijugol weltoda.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>«Ɗun hawrondiri afo makko on no ka ngesa. Ɓay on ɓadike ka hoɗo fewndo ko o artata, o nani hito gimi e gami. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Tun o noddi golloowo maɓɓe goo fii ko humpita mo kon ko woni waɗude ka maɓɓe. <verse number="27" style="v"/>On golloowo wi'i mo: ‹Miɲan maa hewtitii. Ɓay non o hewtitii e jam, ko sabu ɗun ben maa en hirsiri ga'un fayukun kun.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>«On seytini kisan, o salii naatude. Onsay ben makko yalti jeeji mo fii yo o naatu. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kono o wi'i ben makko: ‹E hino, waɗii nii duuɓi buy miɗo yanganaade on. Haa hande mi yeddaali on. Min-le hay nde wootere on okkaali lan hay be'un fii ko mi saatinira goreeɓe an ɓen. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Kono ɓay oo ɓiɗɗo mon ɗoo dekkuɗo ndii jawdi mon dekkidi ndi e waɗooɓe jinaa artii, onɗon on hirsanii mo ga'un fayukun kun!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>«Ben makko wi'i mo: ‹An non boobo an, ɲande woo hiɗen wondi. Ko mi mari kon fow ko an jeyi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kono mi taw bee mi weltoo, mi waɗa welo-welo, ɓay hari oo miɲɲiraawo maa ɗoo ko mayɗo, kono jooni o wuuritii, hari kadi o majjii, kono jooni o yiitaama.› »</para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Mbatulaajo mo Feewaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i taalibaaɓe mun ɓen kadi: «No woodunoo aaden galo marɗo mbatulaajo, tawi on mbatulaajo makko no ɲo'iraa funsugol jawdi on galo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O noddi on mbatulaajo, o wi'i mo: ‹Ko honɗun mi woni nanude e hoore maa? Jittanan no wonɗaa gollirde, ko fii a waawataa wonude mbatulaajo an hande kadi.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>«Onsay mbatulaajo on wi'itii: ‹Hara ko honɗun mi waɗata jooni, ɓay jom an no ittude lan wonugol mbatulaajo makko? E hin-le mi maraa doole remugol, awa kadi toragol no hersinanii lan. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Mi andii ko mi waɗa fii yo mi heɓoy ko wernammi ka mun tuma mi ittaa e mbatulayaagal.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>«Onsay o nodditi kala joganiiɓe jom makko ɓen. O wi'i arano on: ‹Ko jelu joganiɗaa jom an?› <verse number="6" style="v"/>On jaabii: ‹Ko tankonje teemedere nebban.› Ontuma mbatulaajo on wi'i mo: ‹Jooɗo kisan, ƴettaa kaydi maa ndin, windaa ko cappanɗe jowi joganiɗaa mo.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>«O wi'i goɗɗo goo kadi: ‹An-le ko jelu joganiɗaa mo?› On jaabii: ‹Ko bootooji teemedere ngawri.› O wi'i onɗon kadi: ‹Ƴettu kaydi maa ndin, windaa ko bootooji cappanɗe jeetati joganiɗaa mo.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>«Onsay jom on mbatulaajo ɓoyliiɗo manti mo sabu kon ko on golliri ƴoyre. Ko fii fayɓe nguu jamaanu no ƴoƴi telen ɲokondooɓe mun ɓen ɓuri fayɓe jeyaaɓe ɓen ka ndaygu. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Min-le mi wi'ay on: yo on ɗaɓɓir ɗee jawle adunayankeeje yiɓɓe, fii tuma nde ɗen lanniroyi on, yo on wernoye ka galleeji poomayankeeji.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>«Mo nunɗii e hoore ko fanɗi, o nunɗay e hoore ko mawni. Awa kadi mo nunɗaali e hoore ko fanɗi, o nunɗataa e hoore ko mawni. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Si tawii non on nunɗaali e hoore jawle adunayankeeje ɗen, haray ko hombo halfinoyta on jawle haqiiqaaje ɗen? <verse number="12" style="v"/>Awa kadi si on nunɗaali e hoore ngel goɗɗo ngel, ko hombo jonnoyta on ko mon kon?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>«Golloowo hay gooto waawataa gollande jeyɓe ɗun ɗiɗo, ko fii o aɲay oya, o yiɗa oya, maa o haɓɓoo e oya, o itta bote e oya. Ko ɗun waɗi si on waawataa rewude Alla, rewon jawdi.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Fariisiyaaɓe* ɓen e yiɗude mun kaalisi no heɗotonoo ɗun fow liɓa bote e Iisaa. <verse number="15" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «Onon hiɗon waɗi hoore mon feewuɓe e yeeso yimɓe ɓen, kono Allaahu on kaɲun no andi ko woni ka ɓerɗe mon. Ko fii ko yimɓe ɓen ɓanti fii mun kon ko ɲidduɗun yeeso Alla.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>«Awa ko Sariya on e defte annabaaɓe ɓen wonnoo haa fewndo Yaayaa. Kono gila e fewndo Yaayaa, Kibaaru Moƴƴo fii *laamu Alla ngun no feɲɲineede, mo kala no huutorde doole fii naatugol ɗon. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Kono mi andinii on: kammu ngun e leydi ndin mutude no ɓuri newaade edii ciifun gootun wonkun ka Sariya monteede.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>«Kala accituɗo ɓeyngu mun, ƴetti goɗɗo goo, haray ontigi jeenii. Awa kadi kala ƴettuɗo debbo seedaaɗo, haray onɗon kadi jeenii.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Galo Baaso e Baaso Galo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>«Hari no woodunoo aaden galo ɓornotonooɗo conci dimi firsiniraaɗi ko wojji, waɗaynooɗo ɲande woo welii e fotii. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Tawi miskiino wi'eteeɗo Laazaru mo ɓandu mun fow temmaa no waalii ka dambugal makko. <verse number="21" style="v"/>On no faaletenoo hendaade ɲaameteeji luttaynooɗi ɗin ka on galo. Tawi hay bareeji ɗin arayno metta ɗen temmeeje makko.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>«Ɲande goo on miskiino maayi, malaa'ikaaɓe ɓen naɓi mo tawtinoyi Ibraahiima. On galo kadi maayi, surraa. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ka jahannama, tawi on galo no e nder lette, o ɓanti gite, o haynii Laazaru takko Ibraahiima ka woɗɗitii. <verse number="24" style="v"/>O ewnii, o wi'i: ‹Baaba an Ibraahiima, yurme lan, yamiraa Laazaru yo o jullu hondu makko ndun ka ndiyan, o ara o ɓuɓɓinanammi ɗenngal an ngal. Ko fii miɗo tampi ka yiite gaa!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>«Ibraahiima jaabii mo, wi'i: ‹Boobo an, anditu an a hendinoke moƴƴereeji maa ɗin ka aduna, wano non kadi Laazaru yeɗinoke ton tampereeji. Jooni non kanko ɓernde makko ɓuttinaama ɗoo, an hiɗa tampude. <verse number="26" style="v"/>E hoore ɗun kadi, wimbo moolanaango no waɗaa hakkunde men fii wota faalaaɓe iwde gaa yaha ton ɓen waawu ɗun, wano non onon kadi wota on waawu lumbitirde gaa.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>«Onsay on galo wi'i: ‹Awa mi torike ma yo baaba an, nelanan Laazaru ka galle ben an <verse number="28" style="v"/>haa e ɓee neene-gootooɓe an njowo, o hajoyoo ɓe ɗun fii wota kamɓe kadi ɓe aroy e ndee nokkuure lette.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>«Onsay Ibraahiima jaabii mo, wi'i: ‹Hiɓe jogii ton deftere Muusaa nden e defte ɓeya annabaaɓe, yo ɓe heɗo ɗen.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>«O wi'i: ‹Oo'o, yo baaba an Ibraahiima, kono si goɗɗo e mayɓe ɓen yahii e maɓɓe, ɓe tuubay.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>«Kono Ibraahiima wi'i mo: ‹Si ɓe heɗaaki Muusaa e annabaaɓe heddiiɓe ɓen, haray ɓe jaɓataa wurteede hay si ɓe immintinanaama goɗɗo e mayɓe ɓen!› »</para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Junuubu e Gomɗinal e Farilla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6-7">Mat. 18.6-7</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Mrk. 9.42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i taalibaaɓe mun ɓen: «Alaa no peggal ronkirta arirde, kono bone wonanii on wonɗo sabu ɗun. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Haray ko ɓuri mo moƴƴande ko kolmbireede tuntere hayre, o bugee ka baharu edii o wonude sabu gokkun e koy paykoy feggaade. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Reenee hoore mon!</para>
  <para style="p">«Si musiɗɗo mon ooɲike, waajee mo. Si o tuubii, yaafee mo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Awa kadi si o bonnii on laabi jeeɗiɗi e nder ɲallal, o yiltitoyike e mon laabi jeeɗiɗi hara himo wi'a: ‹mi tuubii›, on yaafoto mo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Sahaabaaɓe* ɓen wi'i Koohoojo on: «Ɓeydanee men gomɗinal.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Onsay Koohoojo on wi'i ɓe: «Hay si tawii gomɗinal mon ngal no fota e abbere bene, harayno on waaway yamirde kii ndologahi, wi'on: ‹Ɓoro, iroyoɗaa ka tumbo baharu!›, onsay ki ɗoftoto on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>«Hara ko hombo e mon, si no mari kurkaaduujo remoowo maa ngaynaako, wi'ata on no o iwtiri golle: ‹Aru ɲaamaa›? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kono ka liddu ɗun, o wi'ay mo: ‹Moƴƴinanan ko mi ɲaama, ɓornoɗaa si ɓannanaa mi. Si mi gaynii ɲaamude yara, onsay an kadi a ɲaamay yaraa›. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Hara o mantay on kurkaaduujo fii o waɗii ko o yamiraa kon? <verse number="10" style="v"/>Onon kadi wano non, si on waɗii ko yamiraɗon kon fow, wi'ee: ‹Menen ko men kurkaaduuɓe meereeɓe, ko ko men haani waɗude tun men waɗi.› »</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Yimɓe Sappo ɓe Ɗamajan Nangi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>E nder yaadu makko ndun Yerusalaam, kanko Iisaa o rewri hakkunde diiwal *Samariiya ngal e diiwal Jaliilu ngal. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko o naataynoo e hoɗo, yimɓe sappo ɓe ɗamajan nangi sutii fottugol e makko, ɓe dartii ka woɗɗi, <verse number="13" style="v"/>ɓe ewnii, ɓe wi'i: «Iisaa, ko onon yo Karamoko'en! Yurminee men!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ɓay o yi'ii ɓe, o wi'i ɓe: «Yahee hollitoyoɗon *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen.»</para>
  <para style="p">E nder yaadu maɓɓe ndun ɓe tawi ɓe sellinaama, ɓe laaɓii. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ɓay goɗɗo e maɓɓe tawii sellinaama, o yiltitii e hoore himo ewnoo manta Alla. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Hawri on neɗɗo ko Samariyankeejo. O ari, o yani e ley koyɗe Iisaa, o weltanii mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa ƴetti haala kan, wi'i: «Hinaa ɓe sappoo non ɓe sellinaama, ɓe laaɓii? Awa ko honto njeenayooɓe luttuɓe ɓen woni? <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hinaa hay gooto e maɓɓe yiltitaaki fii mantugol Alla si wonaa oo janano ɗoo tun?» <verse number="19" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i on: «Immo yahaa, gomɗinal maa ngal hisinii ma.»</para>
  <para style="s">Maandeeji Fii Arugol Laamu Alla ngun</para>
  <para style="r">(Mat. 24.23-28, 37-41)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ɲande goo *Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen landii mo kanko Iisaa ko honde tuma *laamu Alla ngun arata. Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Laamu Alla ngun ardataa no yi'orta. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Wi'etaake ‹hingu ɗoo!› maa ɗun ‹hingu ɗaa!›, ko fii mi andinii on, laamu Alla ngun no e mon.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i taalibaaɓe makko ɓen: «Saa'i aroyay nde faaleteɗon yi'ude wootere e ɲalaaɗe *Ɓii-Aaden on, kono on yi'oytaa nde. <verse number="23" style="v"/>On wi'oyte ‹himo ɗoo!› maa ‹himo ɗaa!› Wota on hammir ton, wota on dogir ton. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Awa ko wano maƴannde maƴirta non, jalba gila nano haa e ɲaamo ka weeyo, ko wano non ardu Ɓii-Aaden on woniroyta ka ɲalaande mun. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kono ɗoo e ɗun, bee o tampa fota, nguu jamaanu ɗoo hawka mo.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hebulanagol Saa'i Artoygol Ɓii-Aaden on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">Mat. 24.37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>«Ko waɗunoo kon fewndo jamaanu Nuuhu, waɗoyay kadi ka ɲalaaɗe ado artugol Ɓii-Aaden on. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ko fii fewndo Nuuhu, hari yimɓe ɓen no ɲaamaynoo yara, no jomba jombanee, haa ɲande Nuuhu naatunoo ka laana. Onsay waamere nden ari, muli luttuɓe ɓen fow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>«Ko wano non kadi e fewndo jamaanu Luutu, yimɓe ɓen no ɲaamaynoo yara, sooda soodita, tuta darna. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kono nde Luutu yaltunoo *Saduuma, mbollan yiite iwruno ka kammu yani e maɓɓe, muli ɓe fow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>«Ko wano non kadi woniroyta ɲande Ɓii-Aaden on feeɲiti. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Nden ɲande, on wonɗo ka fowtorde hoore suudu mun wota tippano piiji mun wonɗi ɗin ka nder suudu. Wano non kadi on wonɗo ka ngesa wota yiltito ka mun. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Anditee fii sonnaajo Luutu on. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kala ɗaɓɓuɗo no dandira ngurndan mun, ɗan hayriray mo, kono kala non mo ngurndan mun hayrinaa, o dandoyay ɗan.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>«Mi andinii on kadi, e nden jemmaare ɗon, yimɓe ɗiɗo waaloduɓe e danki wooti, goɗɗo e maɓɓe ƴettete, oya on lutta. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Wano non kadi, rewɓe ɗiɗo wonɓe unidude, goɗɗo e maɓɓe ƴettete, oya on lutta. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Awa kadi yimɓe ɗiɗo wonduɓe e ngesa woota, gooto e maɓɓe ƴettete, oya on lutta.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Taalibaaɓe ɓen wi'i mo: «Koohoojo amen, hara ko honto ɗun waɗoyta?»</para>
  <para style="p">O jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: «Ko ka ko maayi kon woni woo, jigaaje ɗen mooɓotoo.»</para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Ɲaawoowo Ɓoyliiɗo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iisaa waɗani taalibaaɓe mun ɓen ngal misal fii ɓanginangol ɓe nafa duumagol e toraare Alla, hara ɓe haaɓaali. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «No woodunoo e saare aaden ɲaawoowo mo hulataa Alla, awa kadi o hersataa hay gooto. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Tawi kadi no e nden saare keynguujo araynooɗo soono woo ka on ɲaawoowo, wi'a mo: ‹Ɲaawu hakkunde an e oo gaɲo an.› <verse number="4" style="v"/>Gila neeɓii hari on ɲaawoowo anniyaaki. Kono ɓawto ɗun o wi'itii: ‹Fii kala mi hulataa Alla, awa kadi mi hersataa hay gooto, <verse number="5" style="v"/>ɓay oo keynguujo sonjirii lan nii, yo mi ɲaawan mo fii wota o sonjan ɲande woo!› »</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Koohoojo on wi'i: «On nanii ko on ɲaawoowo ɓoyliiɗo wi'i kon? <verse number="7" style="v"/>E taw si hara Allaahu on ɲaawantaa ɓen ɓe o suɓii, ɗun ko ɓen torotooɓe mo jemma e ɲalorma? Hara o nennanay ɓe ɗun? <verse number="8" style="v"/>Mi andinii on, o ɲaawanay ɓe ko yaawi. Kono taw nde *Ɓii-Aaden on aroyi si o tawoyay gomɗinɓe e hoore ndii leydi?»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hakkunde Fariisiyaajo on e Ƴantoowo Sagalle on</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>O waɗi kadi ngal misal ɗoo e hoore ɓen yimɓe fellituɓe ko feewuɓe, hara hiɓe aybina ɓeya, <verse number="10" style="v"/>o wi'i ɓe: «Yimɓe ɗiɗo yahuno ka *juulirde mawnde fii juulugol, tawi goɗɗo on ko *Fariisiyaajo, oya on ko ƴantoowo sagalle. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Fariisiyaajo on immii darii, tawi himo tororanaynoo nii hoore makko, wi'a: ‹Eyoo-maa Alla, mi weltanike ma ko tawi kon mi wa'aa wa heddiiɓe ɓen, ɗun ko ɓee jattooɓe maa ɓee ɓoyliiɓe maa ɓee jeenooɓe maa wano oo ƴantoowo sagalle ɗoo. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Min-le mi hooray laabi ɗiɗi e nder yontere nden, awa kadi mi ittay sappaɓun e hoore kala ko mi heɓi.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>«Tawi on ƴantoowo sagalle hay suusataano ɓantirde gite mun ɗen ka kammu, kono himo darii ka woɗɗitii, himo tappitoo e ɓernde, wi'a: ‹Yaa an Alla, yurminan min oo junuubankeejo!›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>«Mi andinii on, ko on ƴantoowo sagalle ɗon-le yiltitinoo ka galle mun e hoore ko o jogoraaɗo wa feewuɗo edii Fariisiyaajo on. Ko fii kala mawnintiniiɗo jippinoyte, awa kadi kala jippinɗo hoore mun mawninoyte.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hakkunde Iisaa e Paykoy koy</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mat. 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Mrk. 10.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>Woɓɓe addanayno mo hay boobooɓe ɓen fii yo o meemu ɓe. Nde taalibaaɓe ɓen yi'unoo ɗun, ɓe toŋani ɓe. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kono Iisaa nodditi paykoy koy e hoore himo wi'a: «Accee paykoy koy ara e an, wota on haɗu koy, ko fii *laamu Alla ngun ko sifa makkoy wonani. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Ka haqiiqa mi andinii on, kala mo jaɓiraali laamu Alla ngun wa paykun, haray o naatataa ton few.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hooreejo Alɗuɗo on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mat. 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Mrk. 10.17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>Hooreejo goo landii Iisaa, wi'i: «Karamokoojo moƴƴo, hara ko honɗun mi haani waɗude fii yo mi heɓoy *ngurndan poomayankejan ɗan?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ko fii honɗun wi'irtaa mi moƴƴo? Hay gooto moƴƴaa si hinaa Alla Bajjo on. <verse number="20" style="v"/>Hiɗa andi yamirooje ɗen, ɗun ko wota a jeenu, wota a ittu hoore, wota a wujju, wota a seedito fenaande, teddinaa kadi yumma maa e ben maa.»<note caller="u" style="f">18.20 Egg. 20.12-16.</note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v"/>On hooreejo jaabii, wi'i: «Miɗo waɗude ɗun fow gila e cukankaaku an.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa nanii ko on wi'i kon, o wi'i mo: «No ŋakkan-maa fahin huunde wootere: yeeyitu kala ko jeyɗaa, senditanaa miskinɓe ɓen, ɗun wonanoyte keyee ka kammuuli, onsay araa jokkaa mi.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Ɓay on nanii ɗun, o aani, ko fii hari himo alɗi fota. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ɓay Iisaa yi'ii ɗun e makko, o wi'i: «Emba no sattani jom jawle en ka ɓe naata ka laamu Alla. <verse number="25" style="v"/>No ɓuri weeɓande ngelooba ka mba rewa e wuddere meselal edii ka jom jawle en naata ka laamu Alla.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Wonnooɓe mo heɗaade ɓen wi'i: «E hara ko hombo dandoytee?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Ko waawantaako neɗɗanke kon no waawanoo Alla.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Onsay Petruusu wi'i mo: «Awa e hino, men accii ko men jeyi kon fow, men jokkii on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Ka haqiiqa mi andinii on, kala accuɗo suudu mun ndun e ɓeyngu mun e siɓɓe mun ɓen e mawɓe mun ɓen e ɓiɓɓe mun ɓen sabu laamu Alla ngun, <verse number="30" style="v"/>o heɓoyay ko ɓuri ɗun ka aduna ɗoo, awa kadi ka aduna aroyoowo, o heɓoyay ngurndan poomayankejan ɗan.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii ko Saatii Heɓoyde Iisaa kon</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mat. 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Mrk. 10.32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa pottini *sahaabaaɓe mun ɓen sappoo e ɗiɗo sera, o wi'i ɓe: «Awa hiɗen yahude Yerusalaam. Kala ko annabaaɓe ɓen windunoo kon e hoore Ɓii-Aaden on laatoyto. <verse number="32" style="v"/>O wattoyte e juuɗe ɓe wonaa Yahuudiyanke ɓen, o jalee, o tiwee, tuttee e hoore makko, ɓe piyira mo cabbi, ɓe wara. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun o immitoo ka ɲalaande tammere.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Kono ɓen taalibaaɓe faamaali hay fus e ɗun, ɗin konguɗi wirnanii ɓe, ɓe ronki faamude kon ko yewtaa.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Wuntiniri Bunɗo Yeerikoo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mat. 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Mrk. 10.46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ko Iisaa ɓadii Yeerikoo, tawi bunɗo no jooɗii ka sera laawol no toroo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>On nani hito jamaa on ko feƴƴata kon, o landii ko honɗun waɗi. <verse number="37" style="v"/>O andinaa wonde ko Iisaa oo jeyaaɗo Naasirata woni feƴƴude. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Onsay o ewnii, o wi'i: «Ko an yo Iisaa, ɓii Daawuuda, yurminan!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Hikkinooɓe yeeso ɓen feli mo fii yo o fanku, kono o ɓurti ewnaade, wi'a: «Ko an yo ɓii Daawuuda, yurminan!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa dartii, o yamiri yo ɓe addan mo mo. Ɓay on ɓadike, Iisaa landii mo: <verse number="41" style="v"/>«Ko honɗun faalaɗaa yo mi waɗane?»</para>
  <para style="p">On jaabii mo, wi'i: «Koohoojo, ko yo mi hettu giiɗe an ɗen!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Wuntu, gomɗinal maa ngal hisinii ma.» <verse number="43" style="v"/>O wunti ɗon kisan, o jokki Iisaa, himo mawnina Alla. Ɓay jamaa on yi'ii ɗun, ɓe woni e mantugol Alla.</para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Gomɗinal Zaakaru ngal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Iisaa naati Yeerikoo. Ko o taƴitata saare nden, <verse number="2" style="v"/>tawi aaden galo tawaaɗo e hooreeɓe ƴantooɓe sagalle ɓen wi'eteeɗo Zaakaru <verse number="3" style="v"/>no humpanoo yi'ugol mo kanko Iisaa. Kono o ronki feere mun sabu ɗuuɗugol jamaa on, awa kadi himo raɓɓiɗi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Onsay o dogi o feƴƴi yeeso, o ƴawoyi e hoore ƴibbehi fii no o yi'ira Iisaa, ɓay hari on ko ɗon rewata.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nde Iisaa hewtunoo e ley kin ƴibbehi, o tiggitii, o wi'i: «Zaakaru, tippo heɲa, ko fii bee mi weera hande ka galle maa.» <verse number="6" style="v"/>Zaakaru tippii heɲa, jaɓɓii mo e nder weltaare.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ɓay fow yi'ii ɗun, ɓe ŋuni, ɓe wi'i: «Oo koɗoyike junuubankeejo!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Kono Zaakaru immii darii, wi'i Koohoojo on: «Heɗee yo Koohoojo an, mi okkay miskinɓe ɓen feccere jawdi an ndin. Awa kadi si miɗo bonnani goɗɗo goɗɗun, mi yoɓitiray ontigi ɗun cowalle nay.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i: «Hande kisiyee naatii e ɗee galle ɗoo. Ko fii oo ɗoo kadi ko o iwdi Ibraahiima. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Awa ko addi *Ɓii-Aaden on ko ɗaɓɓitugol majjuɓe ɓen, danda ɓe.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Manankun</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mat. 25.14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v"/>Ɓay hari o ɓadike Yerusalaam, o ɓeyditani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, ko fii hari heɗinooɓe mo ɓen no sikka *laamu Alla ngun feeɲay kisan. <verse number="12" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe: «Aaden dimo yahuno e leydi woɗɗundi fii lamminoyegol, arta. <verse number="13" style="v"/>On noddi kurkaaduuɓe mun sappo, o jonni ɓe manankunji sappo. O wi'i ɓe: ‹Gollitiree ɗii ɗoo haa mi ara.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kono tawi yimɓe leydi makko ndin no aɲi mo. Ɓe nelti woɓɓe ɓaawo makko fii andingol ɓen ton wonde ɓe faalaaka onɗon laamoo ɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>«Ɓay o lamminoyaama, o artii, o nodditi kurkaaduuɓe makko ɓe o jonnunoo mbuuɗi ɓen fii no o andira ko honno mo bee e maɓɓe gollitiriri ɗi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>«Arano on e maɓɓe ari, wi'i: ‹Koohoojo an, ɗi accirnoɗon mi ɗin ɓeydike cowalle sappo.› <verse number="17" style="v"/>O wi'i mo: ‹A waɗii ko moƴƴi, yo kurkaaduujo moƴƴo! Ko fii a nunɗii e hoore ko fanɗi, mi waɗii ma yeesoojo e hoore ca'e sappo.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>«Ɗimmo on e maɓɓe ari, wi'i: ‹Koohoojo an, ɗi accirnoɗon mi ɗin ɓeydike cowalle jowi.› <verse number="19" style="v"/>O wi'i onɗon kadi: ‹Mi waɗii ma e hoore ca'e jowi.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>«Goɗɗo e maɓɓe kadi ari, wi'i: ‹Koohoojo an, e hino ɗi accirnoɗaa mi ɗin, hari miɗo mari ɗi e lincun. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ko fii hari miɗo hulu maa, ɓay ko a ɲaaɗuɗo. A ƴettay ko a wallinaa, awa kadi a soɲitay ko a aawaa.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>«Onsay on lanɗo wi'i mo: ‹Mi ɲaawitirte konguɗi maa ɗin, yo jiyaaɗo bonɗo! Hiɗa andunoo ko mi aaden ɲaaɗuɗo? Maa mi ƴettay ko mi wallinaa, maa mi soɲitay ko mi aawaa? <verse number="23" style="v"/>Fii honɗun non a wallinaali ɗi e juuɗe gollitirooɓe ɗi ɓen,<note caller="w" style="f">19.23 Wallingol mbuuɗi e <char style="it">«juuɗe gollitiroowo ɗi on»</char> no firi wallingol ɗi ka <char style="it">«banki.»</char></note> ɗun, nde mi artunoo woo, mi hettayno ɗi e hoore tono.›</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>«Ontuma kanko lanɗo on o wi'i wonnooɓe ɗon ɓen: ‹Jaɓitee ɗi e juuɗe makko, jonnon ɗi oo jogiiɗo manankunji sappo.› <verse number="25" style="v"/>Kono ɓe wi'i mo: ‹Koohoojo amen, onɗon no jogii manankunji sappo!› <verse number="26" style="v"/>O jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: ‹Mi andinii on, ko marɗo ɓeydantee, kono mo maraa on jaɓitante hay yeru ko o mari kon. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ɗun-le wurin addanee lan ɗoo ayɓe an ɓen, ɓen ɓe faalanooka mi laamoo ɗun, waron ɓe yeeso an ɗoo.› »</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Naatugol Iisaa Yerusalaam</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mat. 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-10">Mrk. 11.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yhn. 12.12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ɓay kanko Iisaa o gaynii yewtude ɗun, o hikkii yeeso, o yaari Yerusalaam. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii o ɓadike Bayti-Faazii e *Betanii, ɗun ko takko Fello *Zaytuuni ngon, o nuli taalibaaɓe makko ɗiɗo, <verse number="30" style="v"/>o wi'i ɓe: «Yahee e ngoo hoɗo wongo yeeso mon ɗoo. No naatirɗon e maggo, on taway mbabun kun goɗɗo waɗɗaaki haa hande no humii ɗon. Hunton kun, addon. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Si goɗɗo aru on e landaade, wi'a: ‹Ko honɗun huntanɗon kun?›, on wi'ay mo: ‹Ko haaju Koohoojo on yani e makkun.› »</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Nelaaɓe ɓen yahi ɓe tawroyi no ɓe wiiranoo non. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ko ɓe huntata kun, jeyɓe mbabun kun ɓen wi'i ɓe: «Ko honɗun wonɗon kun huntande?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Ɓe jaabii, ɓe wi'i: «Ko haaju Koohoojo on yani e makkun.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ɓe addani kun Iisaa, ɓe ndaɗɗani mo conci maɓɓe ɗin e hoore makkun si ɓe ƴawni mo. <verse number="36" style="v"/>No o yaaraynoo non, yimɓe ɓen no ndaɗɗirande mo non conci mun ɗin ka laawol.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Nde tawnoo o ɓadike Yerusalaam ka tippagol Fello Zaytuuni, dental taalibaaɓe ɓen fow sowti weltaare, ɓe woni e ewnagol manta Alla, sabu ɗii kaawakeeji moƴƴi ɗi ɓe yi'i. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Tawi hiɓe wi'a:</para>
  <para style="q">«Yo barki wonan oo lanɗo</para>
  <para style="q2">wonɗo arude e innde Joomiraaɗo on.<note caller="y" style="f">19.38 Zab. 118.26 </note></para>
  <para style="q">Yo ɓuttu wonu ka kammu,</para>
  <para style="q2">darja ɓurɗo toowude wonanii ma!»</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Woɓɓe e *Fariisiyaaɓe tawaaɓe e mbatu ngun ɓen wi'i mo kanko Iisaa: «Karamoko'en, yamiree taalibaaɓe mon ɓen yo ɓe fanku!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>O jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: «Mi andinii on, si kamɓe ɓe fankii, kaaƴe ɗen sowtay!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe ɓadike saare Yerusalaam nden, nde Iisaa haynornoo nde, o fesi fii mayre, <verse number="42" style="v"/>o wi'i: «Si an kadi hiɗa andunoo hande ko wonanayno-maa ɓuttu, kono jooni ɗun wirnanike ma. <verse number="43" style="v"/>Aroyay e ɲalaaɗe nde ayɓe maa ɓen ari hunditu-maa hurgi, ɓittire cenɗe fow. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ɓe lancete, ɓe lancide e kala hoɗuɗo e maa. Ɓe accataa e maa hay kaaƴun e hoore hayre, sabu a anditaali saa'i mo Alla hoddiri faabagol ma on.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Raɗori Yeeyooɓe ɓen ka Juulirde Mawnde</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mat. 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Mrk. 11.15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-16">Yhn. 2.13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>O naati ka dingiral *juulirde mawnde, o woni e raɗagol wonnooɓe yeeyude ton ɓen, <verse number="46" style="v"/>hara himo wi'ora ɓe: «No windii: ‹Suudu an ndun ko suudu torordu Alla›,<note caller="ƴ" style="f">19.46a Isa. 56.7 </note> kono onon on wattii ndu fammeere wuyɓe!»<note caller="z" style="f">19.46b Yer. 7.11 </note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Tawi kanko Iisaa ɲande woo o jannayno ka juulirde mawnde. Kono hooreeɓe *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen e lamɓe jamaa on no ɗaɓɓaynoo no sahinbinira mo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Kono hari ɓe andaa ko honno ɓe gerdata, sabu hari jamaa on fow no tuɗi noppi mun e makko.</para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Lande fii Bawgal Iisaa ngal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mat. 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Mrk. 11.27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>E nder ɗen balɗe ɗon, tawi Iisaa no waajaade jamaa on ka *juulirde mawnde, ɗun-le ko feɲɲinangol ɓe Kibaaru Moƴƴo on. Onsay hooreeɓe *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen wondude e mawɓe ɓen ari, <verse number="2" style="v"/>wi'i mo: «Wowlan men ko e ley kongol hombo wonɗaa waɗude ɗun e ko e ley kongol hombo wonɗaa?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>O jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: «Min kadi mi landoto on huunde wootere, jaaboɗon mi. <verse number="4" style="v"/>E hara lootugol ko Yaayaa lootaynoo yimɓe ɓen kon, ko ka arsi iwri kaa ko e neɗɗanke?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kono ɓen woni e wi'indirgol: «Si en jaabike mo ko ka arsi iwri, o wi'ay en ko honɗun haɗunoo gomɗinen mo? <verse number="6" style="v"/>Si en jaabike mo-le ko e neɗɗanke ɗun iwri, jamaa on fow fiɗay en kaaƴe, sabu hiɓe felliti Yaayaa ko annabaajo.» <verse number="7" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe jaabii mo, ɓe wi'i: «Men andaa ka ngol lootugol ɗon iwri.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i ɓe: «Min kadi mi wowlantaa on ko e ley kongol hombo mi woni waɗirde ɗun.»</para>
  <para style="s">Misal Ƴettaangal e Fariisiyaaɓe ɓen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mat. 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Mrk. 12.1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ontuma o fewtiti jamaa on, o waɗani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i ɓe: «Goɗɗo tutuno *wiiɲu, o halfini tutateeri ndin remooɓe wiiɲu ɓen, o yahi safaari ka o neeɓoyta. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ɓay saa'i soɲitugol wiiɲu on hewtii, o immini kurkaadu makko haa e remooɓe wiiɲu ɓen fii yo ɓen jonnan mo ɓiɓɓe wiiɲu geɓal makko ngal. Kono ɓen piyi on, ɓe immintini mo juuɗe mehe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>O immini kurkaadu makko goo kadi, ɓe piyi onɗon kadi, ɓe hersini, ɓe immintini mo juuɗe mehe. <verse number="12" style="v"/>O immini tammo kadi, ɓe barmini onɗon kadi, ɓe raɗii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>«Jom tutateeri ndin wi'i: ‹Ko honɗun mi waɗata jooni? Yo mi immin ɓiɗɗo an yiɗaaɗo on, no gasa ka ɓe teddinoya onɗon.› <verse number="14" style="v"/>Kono no ɓen remooɓe wiiɲu haynornoo mo, ɓe wi'indiri: ‹Ko oo woni ronoowo on, waren mo fii yo ndondi ndin wontan en!› <verse number="15" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe naɓi mo ka ɓaawo tutateeri, ɓe wari.»</para>
  <para style="p">Iisaa wi'i kadi: «Jooni non, hara ko honɗun jom ndin tutateeri wiiɲu waɗata ɓen? <verse number="16" style="v"/>On aray, re'a ɓen remooɓe wiiɲu, o halfina ndi woɓɓe goo.»</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓay ɓen heɗinooɓe mo kanko Iisaa nanii ɗun, ɓe wi'i: «Wota ɗun wonir non!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>E nder ko o tenƴinta ɓe kon, kanko Iisaa, o wi'i: «Hara ko honɗun koo ko windii firi:</para>
  <para style="q">‹Hayre nde mahooɓe ɓen hawkunoo nden</para>
  <para style="q2">wontii hittunde ka soɓɓundu›?<note caller="a" style="f">20.17 Zab. 118.22 </note></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v"/>«Awa kala yanuɗo e nden hayre, o lancoto,</para>
  <para style="q2">kala kadi mo nde yani e hoore mun, o muncoto.»<note caller="b" style="f">20.18 Isa. 8.14-15 </note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ɓay hooreeɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen faamii wonde ko e hoore maɓɓe Iisaa waɗi ngal misal, tawi hiɓe ɗaɓɓude no ɓe fawira juuɗe e makko ɗon kisan, kono hari hiɓe huli jamaa on.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Ndarndoraa fii Yoɓugol Sagalle</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mat. 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Mrk. 12.13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ɓe woni e aynugol Iisaa, ɓe immini e makko tefooɓe bonɓe waɗitiiɓe ko feewuɓe fii ko nangira mo konguɗi makko ɗin, watta mo e juuɗe laamu ngun e ley kongol lamminaaɗo diiwal ngal. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Ɓen landii mo, wi'i: «Karamoko'en, meɗen andi hiɗon jannude waajoo no feewiri, awa kadi on ɓurdindinaa yimɓe ɓen, hiɗon jannirde laawol Alla ngol goonga. <verse number="22" style="v"/>E hara no haani ka men yoɓa lanɗo mawɗo Roomu on sagalle kaa haanaa?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kono ɓay Iisaa faamii janfa maɓɓe kan, o jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: <verse number="24" style="v"/>«Hollee lan *dinaruuru. Ko nandolla hombo e bindi hombo woni e mayru?»</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓe jaabii: «Ko lanɗo mawɗo Roomu on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Onsay o jaabii ɓe, o wi'i: «Jonnitee lanɗo mawɗo Roomu on ko makko kon, jonniton Alla kadi ko mun kon.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Ɓe ronki heɓude feere no ɓe nangira mo e ɗin konguɗi makko yeeso jamaa on, kono ɓay ɓe ŋalɗidii e ngol jaabawol makko, ɓe deƴƴi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Sadduusiyaaɓe ɓen e Ummutal ngal</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mat. 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Mrk. 12.18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v"/>Woɓɓe e ɓee *Sadduusiyaaɓe, wi'uɓe wonde ummutal alaa ɓen, ari landii Iisaa, ɓe wi'i mo: <verse number="28" style="v"/>«Karamoko'en, e hino ko Muusaa wi'i men kon: Si goɗɗo maayii accii ɓeyngu e ɓaawo ɓiɗɗo, haray miɲɲiraawo on mayɗo no haani ƴettude on keynguujo mo o acci fii no o heɓirana on kotiraawo makko jurriya. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Tawa non no woodi ɓiɓɓe njeeɗiɗo. Arano on jombii, maayii, heɓaali ɓiɗɗo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>Ɗimmo on kadi ƴettii mo, maayii. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tammo on kadi wano non. Ɗun yaarii non haa ɓen njeeɗiɗo non ɓe timmi, ɓe accaali jurriya. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun debbo on kadi maayii. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ɓay hari ɓen njeeɗiɗoo non resii on debbo, ko hombo e ɓen on debbo wontanoyta ka ummutal?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Fayɓe nguu jamaanu ɗoo tiggay tiggete. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Kono ɓen yeɗoyaaɓe immintineede e hakkunde mayɓe ɓen e tawegol e nguu jamaanu aroyayngu, resoytaa, resetaake. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Awa kadi ɓe maayitoytaa, ko fii haray hiɓe wa'i wa malaa'ikaaɓe. Ko ɓe fayɓe Alla kadi, ɓay ko ɓe ɓiɓɓe ummutal ngal. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Seedee mayɓe ɓen immitoto, ko ɗun Muusaa ɓanginnoo ka o wowli ɗon fii pitahun kun fewndo o noddi Joomiraaɗo on, on Alla Ibraahiima e Alla Issaaqa e Alla Yaaquuba.<note caller="c" style="f">20.37 Egg. 3.6 </note> <verse number="38" style="v"/>Awa Alla wonaa Alla mayɓe ɓen, kono ko o Alla wurɓe ɓen, ɓay fii makko kanko, ɓen fow ko wurɓe.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Woɓɓe e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen wi'i mo: «Karamoko'en, on yewtii haqiiqa.» <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun ɓe suusaali mo landaade hay huunde.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Hakkunde Almasiihu on e Daawuuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mat. 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Mrk. 12.35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i ɓe: «Ko honno wi'iraa wonde *Almasiihu on ko jurriya Daawuuda? <verse number="42-43" style="v"/>Daawuuda tigi no holli ka Zabuura wonde:</para>
  <para style="q">‹Joomiraaɗo on daalani Joomi an on:</para>
  <para style="q2">Jooɗor ka sengo an ɲaamo</para>
  <para style="q2">haa mi waɗa ayɓe maa ɓen ka ley teppe maa.›<note caller="d" style="f">20.42-43. Zab. 110.1 </note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>«Daawuuda tigi wi'ii Almasiihu on ‹Joomi›, haray ko honno non Almasiihu on woniri jurriya makko?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Fewndo ka yimɓe ɓen fow heɗii mo ɗon, o wi'i taalibaaɓe makko ɓen: <verse number="46" style="v"/>«Reenee e ɓee jannooɓe fii Sariya on, ɗun ko ɓee yiɗuɓe jindidugol e dolokkaaji njani, yiɗi hiwreede ka fottirɗe, yiɗi saffawol aranol ngol ka juulirɗe, yiɗi ndaɗɗule arane ɗen ka nafagol. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Hiɓe jatta galleeji keynguuɓe, hiɓe juutina julɗe maɓɓe fii yiingo, awa ɓen heɓoyay ɲaawooje ɓurɗe sattuɗe.»</para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Sadaka mo Keynguujo on Itti on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Mrk. 12.41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa ɓanti gite mun ɗen, o yi'i alɗuɓe no itta sadakaaji, watta ka nder arkawal sadaka. <verse number="2" style="v"/>O yi'i kadi keynguujo baaso no liɓa ton tammahoy ɗiɗoy. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i: «Miɗo haalande on goonga, oo keynguujo baaso no ɓuri ɓeya fow ko ittaa. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ko fii ɓeya fow ko ko ɓurtani ɗun kon ɓe waɗi, kono kanko keynguujo on e waasiɗude, ko ko o mari kon fow fii ko o wuurira o waɗoyi ton.»</para>
  <para style="s">Maandeeji fii Artoygol Iisaa Almasiihu on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mat. 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Mrk. 13.1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Nde tawnoo woɓɓe no yewta fii *juulirde mawnde nden e kon ko nde fotiniraa kaaƴe labaaɗe e piiji ittaaɗi sadaka, onsay Iisaa wi'i ɓe: <verse number="6" style="v"/>«Ɲalaaɗe no ara nde tawata koo ko yi'oton ɗoo fow lancaama, hay hayre e hoore hayre luttoytaa ɗoo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe landii mo, ɓe wi'i: «Karamoko'en, ko honde tuma ɗun waɗoyta e ko honɗun wonoyta maande laatagol ɗun?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Reenee e faljineede, ko fii buy aroyay ɓaarora innde an nden hara no wi'a ko kaɲun woni *Almasiihu on, saa'i on ɓadike. Wota on jokkoy ɓen. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Awa kadi nde nanoyɗon fii hareeji e murtaldu woo, haray wota on hulu. Ko fii ko ɗun haani adaade waɗude, kono lannoode nden hinaa ɗon kisan.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: «Hareeji waɗoyay hakkunde leƴƴi ɗin. Laamateeriiji ɗin kadi immondirana. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Awa kadi dimbanɗe leydi tiiɗuɗe waɗa, heege e ɲabbeeli raaɓooji waɗa e nokkeeli goo, kaawakeeji hulbiniiɗi waɗa, maandeeji njani kadi waɗa ka kammu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>«Kono ɗoo e ɗun, ɓe faway on juuɗe, ɓe cukkoo on, ɓe naɓoyay on ka juulirɗe, ɓe bugoo on ka kaso, ɓe ardoo on haa e lamɓe ɓen e yeesooɓe diiwe ɗen sabu innde an nden. <verse number="13" style="v"/>Kono ɗun wonanoyay on sabu no seeditoron. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Fiɓee ka ɓerɗe mon wonde on hebulotaako jaabagol ko liddeteɗon kon. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Ko fii mi okkoyay on faamu, mi longina on konguɗi haa ka tawata ayɓe mon ɓen waawataa dartaade on maa yedda. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Awa hay mawɓe mon ɓen e neene-gootooɓe mon ɓen e siɓɓe mon ɓen e yiɓɓe mon ɓen waɗoyay on e joge ɓe wona sabu woɓɓe e mon waree. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Fow aɲoyay on sabu innde an nden. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Kono cukulol hoore mon hay gootol majjoytaa. <verse number="19" style="v"/>Kono si on ŋaɲɲike, haray on hiwii wonkiiji mon ɗin.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>«Nde yi'uɗon koneeli ɗin daakanike saare Yerusalaam nden haa hunditii woo, haray andee lancagol mayre ɓadike. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Onsay yo hoɗuɓe ka diiwal Yahuuda ɓen dogir ka pelle, yo wonɓe ka nder saare Yerusalaam ɓen kadi yaltu. Wota wonɓe ka fulawaa ɓen kadi aru ka saare. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ko fii ɗen wonoyay ɲalaaɗe yottanɗe fii laatingol kala ko windinoo. <verse number="23" style="v"/>E nder ɗen balɗe ɗon, bone wonanay sowiiɓe ɓen e muyninayɓe ɓen. Ko fii annde tiiɗunde waɗay e leydi ndin, tikkere yana e hoore oo jamaa. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Ɓe liɓiroyee mbelndi kaafa, ɓe naɓee, ɓe maccindinanoyoo leyɗe ɗen fow. Ɓe wonaa Yahuudiyanke ɓen yaaɓita Yerusalaam haa saa'iiji ɗi ɓe happanaa ɗin timma.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>«Awa kadi maandeeji waɗoyay ka naange e ka lewru e ka koode. Jamaaji ɗin maapoo ka hoore leydi haa ɓe jiɓoo ko ɓe waɗa sabu uumaango ndiyan ɗan ka baharu e ko ɗan piyondirta kon. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Yimɓe ɓen faɗɗee kulol e nder ko ɓe miijotoo fii ko aroyta ka hoore leydi kon, ko tiiɗi kon ka kammu kadi dimboyoo.› <verse number="27" style="v"/>Ontuma non *Ɓii-Aaden on yi'oyte, no ara e duulere, hara himo arda e bawgal e mangural mawngal. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Nde ɗun fuɗɗii waɗude woo, haray ɓantee townon ko'e mon ɗen, ko fii haray kisiyee mon on ɓadike.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v"/>Onsay o waɗani ɓe ngal misal ɗoo, o wi'i ɓe: «Ndaaree kii ƴibbehi maa leɗɗe goo. <verse number="30" style="v"/>No ɗe wilitiri, on andanay hoore mon wonde setto ngon ɓadike. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Ko wano non kadi, no yiiruɗon ɗii piiji no waɗa woo, haray andee wonde *laamu Alla ngun ɓadike. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ka haqiiqa mi andinii on, ɗun fow waɗay ado nguu jamaanu feƴƴude. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Kammu ngun e leydi ndin feƴƴay, kono min konguɗi an ɗin feƴƴataa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>«Reenee hoore mon fii wota ɓerɗe mon ɗen heewu anndeeji aduna maa faale ɲaamugol yara haa ɓetoo, haa nde ndee ɲalaande mawnde juhirta on wa pircol. <verse number="35" style="v"/>Ko fii nde hewtay e hoore kala wonɗo e ndelo oo aduna. <verse number="36" style="v"/>Findinee hakkillaaji mon ɗin saa'i woo saa'i, toroɗon fii no heɓiron doole daɗugol ɗin piiji waɗoyayɗi, e fii no daroroyoɗon yeeso Ɓii-Aaden on.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tawi e nder ɲalle ɗen, Iisaa waajotono ka juulirde mawnde, o waaloya jemma e hoore ngoo fello wi'eteengo *Zaytuuni. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Jamaa on fow dawrayno ka juulirde mawnde fii heɗagol mo kanko Iisaa.</para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Janforaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mat. 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Mrk. 14.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yhn. 11.45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Hari *Juldeere Bireedi ɗe Aldaa e Lewen nden ɓadike, nden no wi'ee kadi *Juldeere Yawtaneede.<note caller="ɗ" style="f">22.1 Egg. 12 </note> <verse number="2" style="v"/>Tawi hooreeɓe *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen no ɗaɓɓaynoo feere no ɓe mulira Iisaa, kono tawi hiɓe huli jamaa on. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Onsay Ibuliisa naati e ɓernde Yudaasi, ɗun ko oo jammaaɗo Iskariiyu, on ko tawaaɗo e *sahaabaaɓe Iisaa ɓen sappoo e ɗiɗo. <verse number="4" style="v"/>On yahi yewtidoyi e hooreeɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen wondude e halfinaaɓe aynugol *juulirde mawnde nden fii no o wattira Iisaa e juuɗe maɓɓe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ɓen weltori ɗun, ɓe haldi yeenugol mo kaalisi. <verse number="6" style="v"/>O jaɓi ɗun, o woni e ɗaɓɓugol feere no o wattira Iisaa e juuɗe maɓɓe, hara jamaa on hoyɗaali.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Nafakka Juldeere Yawtaneede nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-29">Mat. 26.17-29</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-26">Mrk. 14.12-26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yhn. 13.21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ɓay ɲalaande Juldeere Bireedi ɗe Aldaa e Lewen nden hewtii, ɗun ko ɲalaande hirsanteende baalun nden, <verse number="8" style="v"/>onsay Iisaa immini Petruusu e Yuuhanna, o wi'i ɓe: «Yahee moƴƴinanon en nafakka fii ko nafoɗen ka juldeere.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Ɓen wi'i mo: «Ko honto faalaɗon yo men moƴƴinanoy en ɗun?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «No naatirɗon ka saare, on fottay e gorko rondiiɗo loonde ndiyan. On jokkay mo haa e suudu ndu o naati e mun woo. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Onsay on wi'ay jom suudu ndun: ‹Karamoko'en wi'ii men yo men lando on: Ko e suudu hondu ɓe nafodata e taalibaaɓe maɓɓe ɓen nafakka Juldeere Yawtaneede nden?› <verse number="12" style="v"/>Ontuma o hollay on konkooru njanndu weƴƴitaandu ka koore dow. Ko ɗon moƴƴinton.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ɓe yahi ɓe tawroyi no o haalirannoo ɓe non, ɓe moƴƴini nafakka juldeere nden.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Ɓay saa'i on hewtii, Iisaa ɓadii fii nafagol wondude e sahaabaaɓe ɓe o toɗɗinoo ɓen sappoo e ɗiɗo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Miɗo faalanoo fota hawtidugol e mon oo nafakka ado mi tampude. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Ko fii mi andinii on, mi ɲaamitataa oo nafakka ndee juldeere hande kadi haa nde laatoyoo ka *laamateeri Alla.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Onsay o ƴetti jardukun waɗorkun njaram, o jarni Alla, o wi'i: «Jaɓee kun jardukun njaram, senditon hakkunde mon. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Ko fii mi andinii on, mi yaritataa hande kadi njaram ɓiɓɓe wiiɲu haa tuma laamateeri Alla ndin ari.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun o ƴetti kadi bireedi, o jarni Alla, o taƴiti, o jonni ɓe, o wi'i: «Ɗunɗoo ko ɓandu an ndu okkaɗon ndun nii, waɗee ɗunɗoo maande ko anditiron fii an.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Ko wano non kadi, ɓay ɓe gaynii ɲaamude, o ƴetti jardukun waɗorkun njaram, o wi'i: «Kun jardukun ko maande fii *ahadi heyri tippundi e ɗan ƴiiƴan an hibboyteeɗan fii mon. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kono non janfotooɗo lan on no ɲaamidude e an. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Ɓii-Aaden* on no yahude wano muuyiranoo non, kono bone wonanii on janfotooɗo mo!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe woni e landondirgol, wi'a: «Hara ko hombo e men waɗoyta ɗun?»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Yeɗeteeɓe Laamu ɓen ka Laamateeri Alla</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:25-28">Mat. 20.25-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:42-45">Mrk. 10.42-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v"/>Yeddondiral waɗi hakkunde maɓɓe fii andugol ko hombo e maɓɓe gasata wonude mawɗo. <verse number="25" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i ɓe: «Lamɓe ɗiya leƴƴi no laamori ɗi doole, ɓen laamiiɓe no wi'aa waɗooɓe ko moƴƴi. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Kono onon, wota on wa'u wa ɓen. Ɓurɗo teddude on e mon, yo wa'u wa suka. Awa kadi lanɗo on, yo wa'u wa kurkaadu. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Hara ko hombo ɓuri teddude hakkunde wonɗo nafaade on e wonɗo ɓannude nafakka on? Hinaa wonɗo nafaade on? Min-le non, miɗo woniri hakkunde mon wa on ɓannoowo. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Onon-le, ko onon wondunoo e an e nder ɗii tampereeji an fow. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ko ɗun waɗi si mi lamminiray on wano Baaba an lamminirimmi non, <verse number="30" style="v"/>fii no ɲaamiroyon yaron ka ndaɗɗudi an, ɗun ko ka nder laamateeri an, jooɗoɗon kadi ka julle laamu fii laamoyagol *bolondaaji Isra'iila ɗin sappoo e ɗiɗi.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i: «Sim'uunu, Sim'uunu! Ibuliisa torike hendagol on, wesira wa nendi. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Kono min mi toranike ma fii wota gomɗinal maa ngal hayru. An kadi tuma yiltitiɗaa e an eto tabintinaa wondiɓɓe maa ɓen.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Onsay Sim'uunu Petruusu jaabii mo, wi'i: «Koohoojo, miɗo hebulanii yaadugol e maa haa e kaso maa haa e mayde.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Petruusu, mi andinii ma, ndonto ƴoggataa hande hara a yeddaali wonde hiɗa andimmi haa timma laabi tati.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: «Fewndo ko mi neli on e ɓaawo mbuuɗi e bonfo e paɗe, on ŋakkiroyano ton goɗɗun?»</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓe jaabitii: «Hay huunde.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: «Jooni non ko nii: Kala jogiiɗo mbuuɗi yo ƴettu, wano non kadi on mo no mari bonfo yo ƴettu, awa kadi mo maraa kaafa e mon yo yeeyitu waramba mun on sooda. <verse number="37" style="v"/>Awa mi andinii on, bee ko windii fii an kon laatoo, wonde: ‹O wattidete e waɗooɓe bone ɓen.›<note caller="e" style="f">22.37 Isa. 53.12 </note> Wano non kadi, kala ko windanoo fii an kon ko e laataade woni.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe wi'i mo: «Koohoojo, e hino ɗoo kaafaaje ɗiɗi.»</para>
  <para style="p">O wi'i ɓe: «Awa yonii.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Torori Alla ka wi'etee ɗon Jatsaymaani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mat. 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Mrk. 14.32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ontuma o yalti o yahi ka Fello *Zaytuuni wano o woowiri non. Taalibaaɓe makko ɓen kadi jokki mo. <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe hewtii e nden nokkuure, o wi'i ɓe: «Toree Alla fii wota on naatu e jarrabi.» <verse number="41" style="v"/>Onsay o woɗɗitori ɓe yeru bugannde hayre, o jiccii o torii, <verse number="42" style="v"/>o wi'i: «Baaba an, si hiɗa faalaa, yo kun jardukun tampere pottito lan. Kono non wota faale an on waɗu, kono yo faale maa on waɗu.» <verse number="43" style="v"/>Onsay malaa'ikaajo iwri ka kammu, ari e makko no tiiɗina mo. <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ɓay sonjaa wonkii heɓii mo, o ɓurti toragol. Onsay lakkere makko nden wa'i wa cinte ƴiiƴan ɗe no sinta e leydi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ɓay o gaynii toragol, o immii o yahi ka taalibaaɓe makko ɓen woni ton, o tawi hiɓe ɗaanii sabu annde nde ɓe wondi nden. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Ko fii honɗun ɗaanantoɗon? Immee toroɗon fii wota on naatu e jarrabi.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Nangiraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mat. 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Mrk. 14.43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yhn. 18.3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>E nder ko o yewtata kon, hawrondiri jamaa yimɓe hewtii. Tawi ko oo wi'eteeɗo Yudaasi tawdaaɗo e sappoo e ɗiɗooɓe ɓen ardii ɓen. On ɓadii Iisaa fii lunnagol mo. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i mo: «Yudaasi, hara ko lunnagol janfortaa Ɓii-Aaden on?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v"/>Ɓay wondiɓɓe Iisaa ɓen sogitike ko saatii waɗude kon, onsay ɓe wi'i: «Koohoojo, hara yo men huutor kaafaaje amen ɗen?» <verse number="50" style="v"/>Tun goɗɗo e maɓɓe soppi kurkaadu yottinoowo mawɗo sadaka on, o itti mo nowru ɲaamuru ndun.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v"/>Kono Iisaa ƴetti haala kan, wi'i: «Hattinee ɗoo!» Onsay o meemi nowru on ndun, ndu wattii.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v"/>Iisaa wi'i ɓen arɓe hendagol mo kadi, ɗun ko hooreeɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e hooreeɓe aynooɓe juulirde mawnde nden e mawɓe ɓen: «Hiɗon ardi e kaafaaje e bedi wa si ko ngujjo aranɗon. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Hara-le ɲande woo miɗo wondi e mon ka juulirde mawnde, kono on fawaali juuɗe e an. Kono ɗoo ko saa'i mon nii, e saa'i mbawdi niɓe ɗen.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Petruusu Yeddiri fii Iisaa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mat. 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Mrk. 14.66-72</ref>; Yhn. 18.15-18, 25-27)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii ɓe nangii Iisaa, ɓe naɓi mo ka galle yottinoowo mawɗo sadaka on. Petruusu iwtiri ɓaawo maɓɓe ka woɗɗitii. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe huɓɓi yiite ka hakkunde tande, ɓe jooɗii. Petruusu kadi ari jooɗodi e maɓɓe. <verse number="56" style="v"/>No debbo kurkaaduujo goo yiirunoo mo kanko Petruusu himo jooɗii ka binde yiite, kanko debbo on o tenƴini mo, o wi'i: «Oo ɗoo ko wondiɗɗo Iisaa!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v"/>Kono kanko Petruusu o yeddi, o wi'i: «Hey ko an yo debbo, min mi andaa oo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v"/>Ɓay nettii seeɗa, goɗɗo goo kadi yi'i mo, wi'i: «An ko a tawdaaɗo e maɓɓe.»</para>
  <para style="p">Petruusu wi'i onɗon kadi: «Mi tawdaaka e maɓɓe!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii embere saa'i gooto feƴƴii, goɗɗo goo kadi catii, wi'i: «Pellet, oo ko wondiɗɗo makko nii, ko fii oo ko mo Jaliilu.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v"/>Petruusu jaabii onɗon kadi, wi'i: «An mi andaa ko honɗun wonɗaa wowlude!» Wa fewndo o wowlata ɗun, ndontoori ndin ƴoggi. <verse number="61" style="v"/>Onsay Koohoojo on yeƴƴitii, cikki gite mun ɗen e Petruusu. Tun Petruusu anditi fii ko Koohoojo on wowlannoo mo kon wondema: «Ado ndonto ƴoggude hande, haray a yeddii fii an haa timmii laabi tati!» <verse number="62" style="v"/>Onsay Petruusu yalti ka yaasi, o wulli wullaandu sattundu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v"/>Tawi yimɓe joginooɓe Iisaa ɓen no jalaynoo mo luuboo, <verse number="64" style="v"/>awa kadi ɓe buumayno mo yeeso ngon, ɓe wi'a: «Hotto ko hombo luubi-maa!» <verse number="65" style="v"/>E hoore ɗun ɓe kongayno mo, ɓe hoyna.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Naɓiraa Yeeso Mawɓe Jamaa on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-68">Mat. 26.59-68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Mrk. 14.55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Yhn. 18.19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v"/>Ɓay weetii, mawɓe jamaa on, ɗun ko hooreeɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen, mottondiri. Ɓe addi Iisaa ka yeeso dental maɓɓe, <verse number="67" style="v"/>ɓe wi'i mo: «Si tawii ko an woni *Almasiihu on, wowlan men.»</para>
  <para style="p">Iisaa jaabii ɓe, wi'i: «Si mi haalanii on, on hoolotaako, <verse number="68" style="v"/>awa kadi si mi landike on, on jaabotaako lan. <verse number="69" style="v"/>Kono gila jooni Ɓii-Aaden on jooɗoto ka sengo ɲaamo Allaahu on, on Jom Bawgal.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v"/>Ɓe fow ɓe wi'i: «Kere ko an woni *Ɓiɗɗo Alla on?»</para>
  <para style="p">Ontuma o wi'i ɓe: «Ko ko wowluɗon kon onon tigi, ko mi ɗun.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe wi'i: «Ko seedee hombo faalaɗen kadi? Kanko tigi o wowlii, en nanii!»</para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Addiraa Yeeso Lamɓe Ɗiiwe ɗen</para>
  <para style="r">(Mat. 27.1-2, 11-26; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-15">Mrk. 15.1-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-40">Yhn. 18.28-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Onsay dental ngal fow immii naɓi Iisaa ka Pilaatu. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ɓe woni e tooɲugol mo, wi'a: «Men taw oo no murtinde jamaa men on haɗa ɓe yoɓugol lanɗo mawɗo Roomu on sagalle. Awa kadi himo wi'itii *Almasiihu, ɗun ko lanɗo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Pilaatu landii mo, wi'i: «Hara ko an woni lanɗo Yahuudiyanke'en?»</para>
  <para style="p">Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Ko wano wi'irɗaa non.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v"/>Onsay Pilaatu wi'i hooreeɓe *yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e jamaa on: «Mi yi'aali hujja woo ko oo neɗɗo jogoree!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v"/>Kono ɓe catii e ɗun, ɓe wi'i: «Himo lowirde jamaa on jannugol ɓe. O fuɗɗii gila ka diiwal Jaliilu, o rewi e diiwal Yahuuda ngal fow haa o hewtii ɗoo jooni.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Ɓay Pilaatu nanii ɗun, o landii si oo neɗɗo ko mo Jaliilu. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ɓay kanko Pilaatu o andii wonde Iisaa ko e laamateeri *Heroodu ndin jeyaa, o feƴƴini mo ka Heroodu. Tawi e ɗen balɗe ɗon, on no Yerusalaam.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ɓay Heroodu yi'ii Iisaa, ɗun weltini mo fota. Tawi gila neeɓi himo faalanoo mo yi'ude sabu ko o nanaynoo no wowlee fii makko kon. Awa kadi himo faalanoo yi'ude himo waɗa kaawakeeji moƴƴi goo. <verse number="9" style="v"/>O landii mo haa juuti, kono Iisaa jaabaaki mo fus.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Tawi hooreeɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen wondude e jannooɓe fii Sariya on ɓen no ɗon, ɓen no tooɲa mo tooɲe sattuɗe. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Heroodu e suufaaɓe mun ɓen kadi jali mo aybini. Onsay o ɓorni mo dolokke fotuɗo, o nattani mo Pilaatu. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Nden ɲande tigi Pilaatu e Heroodu ɓen ayrunooɓe welditi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ontuma Pilaatu nodditi hooreeɓe yottinooɓe sadaka ɓen e yeesooɓe ɓen wondude e jamaa on, <verse number="14" style="v"/>o wi'i ɓe: «On addanii lan oo neɗɗo, on wi'ii ko kanko woni murtinde jamaa on. E hino mi landike mo e tawnde mon, mi yi'aali dalil woo e hoore oo neɗɗo ko tooɲiron mo. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Awa Heroodu kadi-le wano non, ko fii o artiranii en mo. Awa-le oo neɗɗo waɗaa hay huunde ko foddi e wareede. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Jooni mi donkinay mo, mi accita.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Tawi no farlii mo kanko Pilaatu, juldeere bee accitangol ɓe nangaaɗo goo. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe fow ɓe sonki, ɓe wi'i: «Waree oo ɗoo! Accitanon men Barabaasi!» ( <verse number="19" style="v"/>Tawi on-le ko sokiraa, ko sabu gere no waɗunoo ka saare e waru hoore.)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Pilaatu yewti ɓe fahin, ɓay hari no e fondo makko accitugol Iisaa. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Kono hiɓe sonkaynoo, wi'a: «Fempee mo! Fempee mo!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>Pilaatu wi'i ɓe tammun: «Hara ko honɗun oo bonni? Min mi yi'aali dalil woo ko oo wariree. Jooni mi donkinay mo, mi accita.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v"/>Kono ɓe catii e ɗun e hoore sonko njano, hiɓe toroo yo o fempe. Ngon sonko maɓɓe fooli mo kanko Pilaatu. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Pilaatu jaɓani ɓe faale maɓɓe on. <verse number="25" style="v"/>O acciti on mo ɓe torii mo fii mun, ɗun ko oo sokiranooɗo fii gere e waru hoore, o waɗi Iisaa faale maɓɓe on.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Wariraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mat. 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Mrk. 15.21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yhn. 19.17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v"/>Fewndo ɓe naɓaynoo Iisaa fii warugol mo, ɓe hendii goɗɗo mo Sirenii iwaynooɗo ngesa, on no wi'ee Sim'uunu. Ɓe rondi mo *leggal altindiraangal ngal, o iwtiri ɓaawo Iisaa. <verse number="27" style="v"/>Tawi jamaa moolanaaɗo no iwtiri ɓaawo makko wondude e rewɓe, ɓen no wulla fesa fii makko kanko Iisaa. <verse number="28" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa fewtiti ɓe, wi'i: «Ko onon yo rewɓe Yerusalaam, wota on wullu fii an, kono wullee fii mon e fii ɓiɓɓe mon ɓen. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Ko fii ɲalaaɗe no aroya ka wi'oytee: ‹Maloore wonanii ɓen ɓe jiidotaako e ɓen ɓe heɓaali ɓiɓɓe e ɓen ɓe muyninaali!› <verse number="30" style="v"/>Onsay yimɓe ɓen wi'oyay: ‹Pelle yanee e hoore amen! Cehe suumee men!› <verse number="31" style="v"/>Hara si leɗɗe kecce ɗen warraama nii, haray ko honno yorɗe ɗen warroytee?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v"/>Tawi bonɓe ɗiɗo no naɓideede e Iisaa fii waridoyegol e makko. <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ɓay ɓe hewtii e ndee nokkuure wi'eteende Laalagal Hoore, ɓe fempi mo ɗon wondude e ɓen bonɓe ɗiɗo, goɗɗo on ka sengo makko ɲaamo, oya on ka nano makko. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Onsay Iisaa wi'i: «Baaba an, yaafo ɓee, ko fii ɓe andaa koo ko ɓe woni waɗude.» Onsay ɓen suufaaɓe sendiri conci makko ɗin urɓa<note caller="f" style="f">23.34 Zab. 22.19 </note>.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v"/>Tawi yimɓe ɓen no darii ɗon no ndaara. Yeesooɓe ɓen kaɲun no awmotonoo mo, wi'a: «O dandii ɓeya, awa yo o dandu hoore makko kadi si tawii ko kanko woni Almasiihu Alla, Suɓaaɗo on!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Suufaaɓe ɓen kaɲun kadi no jalaynoo mo, ɓe ɓadii ɓannangol mo ndiyan lammuɗan, <verse number="37" style="v"/>hiɓe wi'a: «Si tawii ko an woni Lanɗo Yahuudiyanke'en, dandito an tigi!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v"/>Tawi no windii dow makko wonde: «Oo ɗoo ko Lanɗo Yahuudiyanke'en nii.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v"/>Tawi bonɗo mo o fempidaa wengaa goo no hoynaynoo mo, wi'a: «Wonaa an woni Almasiihu on? Awa dandu goy hoore maa, dandaa men menen kadi!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Kono ɗimmo makko on feli mo, wi'i: «An a hulataa Alla? An oo yagginiraaɗo wa makko, <verse number="41" style="v"/>enen ɗiɗo-le hiɗen foddi e ɗun, ko fii ko kuuɗe men hettuɗen. Kono oo ɗoo waɗaali hay fus ko boni.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'iti kadi: «Iisaa, anditoyee fii an tuma artoyɗon ka laamu mon.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v"/>Iisaa jaabii mo, wi'i: «Mi holnii ma wondema hande tigi a wonday e an ka aljanna.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Mayde Iisaa nden</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mat. 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Mrk. 15.33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:25-30">Yhn. 19.25-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii naange e hoore, niwre waɗi e leydi ndin fow haa ka ɓaawo fanaa. <verse number="45" style="v"/>Naange ngen weɲi, *wirngallo hormorde nden ka *juulirde mawnde feeri e hakkunde. <verse number="46" style="v"/>Iisaa ewnii ko tiiɗi, o wi'i: «Baaba an, mi wattii ruuhu an on e juuɗe maa.» No o gaynirnoo wi'ude ɗun, o timmi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v"/>Ɓay hooreejo suufaaɓe ɓen yi'ii kon ko waɗi ɗon, o mawnini Alla, o wi'i: «Ka haqiiqa, hari oo neɗɗo ko feewuɗo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ɓay jamaa arnooɓe yi'ugol ko waɗaynoo ɗon kon yi'ii ɗun, ɓe yiltitii hiɓe tappitoo e ɓerɗe. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Tawi kala andunooɓe mo kanko Iisaa, wondude e rewɓe iwtirnooɓe ɓaawo makko ɓen gila Jaliilu, no darii ka woɗɗitii, no ndaara kon ko woni waɗude.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Surriraa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mat. 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Mrk. 15.42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yhn. 19.38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Tawi neɗɗo moƴƴo feewuɗo wi'eteeɗo Yuusufu no tawanoo e ngal dental mawɓe *Banii-Isra'iila'en ɓen, <verse number="51" style="v"/>on kaɲun jaɓaano taweede e fewjoore maɓɓe nden e ɗen kuuɗe maɓɓe. Hari on ko jeyaaɗo e ndee saare Yahuudiyankeeɓe wi'eteende Raamati, tawi on ko *laamu Alla ngun tijjii. <verse number="52" style="v"/>On yahi ka Pilaatu, o torii mo hettugol furee Iisaa on. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun, o yahi, o tippini furee Iisaa on ka hoore leggal, o tumbi e kasannge, o belnoyi mo e qaburu asaaɗo e feto, mo hari hay gooto surraaka e mun. <verse number="54" style="v"/>Ɗun hawri ɲande hebulanagol *ɲalaande fowteteende nden, ɓay hari nden ɓadike ka naata. <verse number="55" style="v"/>Rewɓe ardunooɓe e Iisaa ɓen gila Jaliilu jokki Yuusufu, ɓe yi'oyi yenaande nden e no furee on belniraa. <verse number="56" style="v"/>Onsay rewɓe ɓen yiltitii fii moƴƴinoygol tiiri e angiri. No asewe on naatirnoo, ɓe fowtii wano Sariya on wi'iri non.</para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Fii Wurniteede Iisaa Almasiihu on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-10">Mat. 28.1-10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-8">Mrk. 16.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yhn. 20.1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>E alat, ɗun ko ɲallal aranal e nder yontere nden, ɓen rewɓe dawi bimbi subaka ka yenaande, hiɓe yooɓii tiiri ndi ɓe moƴƴinnoo. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ɓe tawi hayre ombiranoonde yenaande nden tallaama, <verse number="3" style="v"/>ɓe naati, kono ɓe tawaali ton furee Iisaa Koohoojo on. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko ɓe miijotoo fii ɗun, worɓe ɗiɗo ɓorniiɓe conci jalbuɗi, feeɲani ɓe. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Ɓe fow ɓe huli, ɓe ugginii ka leydi. Kono ɓen worɓe ɗiɗo wi'i ɓe: «Ko fii honɗun ɗaɓɓitanton wurɗo on e hakkunde mayɓe ɓen? <verse number="6" style="v"/>O alaa ɗoo, o immintinaama. Anditee ko o wowlanaynoo on kon fewndo o wonnoo Jaliilu, <verse number="7" style="v"/>himo wi'aynoo on: ‹Bee *Ɓii-Aaden on wattee e juuɗe junuubanke'en, o fempee, o waree, o immintinoyee ka ɲalaande tammere.› » <verse number="8" style="v"/>Tun, ɓen anditi ɗin konguɗi Iisaa Almasiihu on.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe iwi ka yenaande ɗon, ɓe yahi yeetoyagol ɗun *sahaabaaɓe ɓen sappoo e go'o wondude e heddiiɓe ɓen fow. <verse number="10" style="v"/>Ɓen rewɓe ko Mariyama Magaduuna e Yuuwanna e Mariyama yumma Yaaquuba wondude e woɓɓe goo, wowlanoynoo ɗun sahaabaaɓe ɓen sappoo e go'o. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Kono ɓe ronki hoolaade ɓen rewɓe, tawi konguɗi ɓen ɗin no wa'ani ɓe wa fuyanteeji. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Kono Petruusu immii dogiri ton. Ɓay o hewtii, o ugginii ka yenaande, ko kasannge on tun o yi'i ton. Onsay o hooti ka makko e hoore himo ŋalɗi sabu kon ko waɗi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Taalibaaɓe ɓen Ɗiɗo ka Laawol Emayuusu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12-13">Mrk. 16.12-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Tawi nden ɲande tigi ɗiɗo e maɓɓe no yahaynoo e hoɗo no wi'ee Emayuusu woɗɗitorngo Yerusalaam embere kilomeeterji sappoo e ɗiɗi. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Tawi ɓen no yewta fii ko waɗunoo kon fow. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko ɓe yewtata ɗun ɓe landondira, Iisaa ɓadii ɓe, o waddi e maɓɓe laawol. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Kono tawi giiɗe maɓɓe ɗen no wirnanaa anditugol mo.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Ko konguɗi honɗi wonɗon bugondirde e nder nduu yaadu mon?»</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓe dartii, ɓe yoomi. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Onsay goɗɗo e maɓɓe wi'eteeɗo Keleyopaasu jaabii mo, wi'i: «Haray ko an tun woni koɗo wonɗo Yerusalaam mo andaali ko waɗi kon e ɗee balɗe ɗoo?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Honɗun?»</para>
  <para style="p">Ɓe wi'i mo: «Koo ko waɗi e hoore Iisaa oo jeyaaɗo Naasirata, ɗun ko oo annabaajo jom kuugal e kongol yeeso Alla e yeeso jamaa on fow, <verse number="20" style="v"/>e ko honno kadi hooreeɓe *yottinooɓe sadaka men ɓen e hooreeɓe men ɓen wattiri mo e juuɗe ɓeya fii yo ɓen ɲaawu mo, ɓe fempa mo e leggal, ɓe wara. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Meɗen tanƴininoo ko kanko yaltinayno *Banii-Isra'iila'en e njaggu. Kono e nder ɗun fow, e hino heɓii hande balɗe tati gila ɗun waɗi. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Awa kadi rewɓe wondiɓɓe amen goo ŋalɗinii men fota, nde ɓe dawunoo ka yenaande, <verse number="23" style="v"/>ɓe tawaali ton furee makko on. Ɓe ari ɓe wi'i men malaa'ikaaɓe feeɲanii ɓe, ɓen wi'ii ɓe wonde kanko Iisaa himo wuuri. <verse number="24" style="v"/>Onsay wondiɓɓe amen goo kadi yahi ka yenaande, ɓe tawaali furee Iisaa on ton, tawi ko no rewɓe ɓen wiirunoo men non tigi woniri!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v"/>Onsay kanko Iisaa o wi'i ɓe: «Ko onon yo njofooɓe, hiɗon nennanii gomɗingol kala ko annabaaɓe ɓen *hiitinoo kon! <verse number="26" style="v"/>Hara haananaa *Almasiihu on ka o tampira nii ado o naatude ka mangural makko?» <verse number="27" style="v"/>Onsay o nangi sifanagol ɓe ko windii fii makko kon fow ka defte, gila e Muusaa e ɓeya annabaaɓe fow.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii ɓe ɓadike hoɗo ngo ɓe yahaynoo e mun ngon, o faaminani ɓe wonde ko toonin ton o sutii. <verse number="29" style="v"/>Kono ɓe jeeji mo, ɓe wi'i: «Wonen, ko fii naange ngen yoroyii, niɓɓay woni.» Onsay o naatidi e maɓɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v"/>Fewndo o jooɗodi e maɓɓe fii ɲaamugol, o ƴetti bireedi on, o du'ii, o taƴiti, o jonni ɓe. <verse number="31" style="v"/>Tun, giiɗe maɓɓe ɗen udditii, ɓe anditi mo, onsay o majjitori ɓe. <verse number="32" style="v"/>Ɓe woni e wi'indirgol: «Hinaa ɓerɗe men ɗen no amaynoo weltaare fewndo ko o yewtata en ka laawol, o sifanoo en ko windii kon ka defte?»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v"/>Ɓe immii kisan, ɓe yiltitii Yerusalaam, ɓe ari ɓe tawi sahaabaaɓe ɓen sappoo e go'o e wondiɓɓe mun ɓen no mottondiri ɗon. <verse number="34" style="v"/>Tawi ɓen wonnooɓe ɗon no wi'a: «Ka haqiiqa, Koohoojo on immintinaama, o feeɲanii Sim'uunu!»<note caller="g" style="f">24.34 Ko Sim'uunu oo ɗoo woni jammaaɗo Petruusu.</note> <verse number="35" style="v"/>Onsay ɓeya ɗiɗo kadi sifanii ɓe ko ɓe yi'i kon ka laawol e ko honno ɓe anditiri mo ka sendo bireedi.</para>
  <para style="s">Fii no Iisaa Feeɲirani Sahaabaaɓe ɓen</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mat. 28.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Mrk. 16.14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yhn. 20.19-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko ɓe yewtaynoo ɗun, kanko tigi o ari hakkunde maɓɓe, o wi'i ɓe: «Yo jam wonu e mon!»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v"/>Tun ɓe ɗenƴii, ɓe huli, ɓe sikki ko mbeelu ɓe yi'i. <verse number="38" style="v"/>Kono o wi'i ɓe: «Ko honɗun jiɓiɗon? Ko fii honɗun kadi ndee sikkitaare wonani ka ɓerɗe mon? <verse number="39" style="v"/>Ndaaree ɗee juuɗe an e ɗee koyɗe an. Ko min tigi nii! Meemee lan, ndaaron, ko fii mbeelu alaa teewu, alaa ƴi'e, on yi'ii-le min miɗo mari.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v"/>Ɓay wonii o wi'ii ɗun, onsay o holli ɓe juuɗe makko ɗen e koyɗe makko ɗen. <verse number="41" style="v"/>Ɓay tawii e nder weltaare maɓɓe nden haa jooni ɓe hoolaaki, hiɓe e nder ŋalaw, onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Hara hiɗon mari ɗoo goɗɗun ko ɲaametee?» <verse number="42" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe ɓannani mo huntere lingii sa'aangii. <verse number="43" style="v"/>O ƴetti ngii, o nafii yeeso maɓɓe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v"/>Onsay o wi'i ɓe: «Ko ɗunɗoo mi wowlannoo on fewndo mi wondunoo e mon, wonde bee ko windii fii an kon fow ka Sariya Muusaa e ka Zabuura e ka defte ɓeya annabaaɓe laatoo.»</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v"/>Ontuma o udditani ɓe hakkille maɓɓe ɗen fii no ɓe faamira defte ɗen. <verse number="46" style="v"/>O wi'i ɓe kadi: «Ko ɗunɗoo windii wondema Almasiihu on tampay, o immintinee e hakkunde mayɓe ɓen ka ɲallal tammal. <verse number="47" style="v"/>Awa kadi leƴƴi ɗin fow waajete e innde makko gila Yerusalaam fii yo ɓe tuubu, ɓe yaafanee junuubaaji maɓɓe ɗin. <verse number="48" style="v"/>Ko onon woni seedeeɓe ɗun ɓen. <verse number="49" style="v"/>Jooni non mi addanoyay on ko Baaba an fodunoo kon. Kono onon luttee ka nder saare, haa tuma yeɗaɗon bawgal iwrayngal ka dow ngal.»</para>
  <para style="s">Fii Ƴentineede Iisaa Almasiihu on</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Mrk. 16.19-20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Sah. 1.9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v"/>Ɓawto ɗun Iisaa nawri ɓe telen *Betanii, o fonti juuɗe makko ɗen, o du'anii ɓe. <verse number="51" style="v"/>Wa fewndo ko o du'antoo ɓe, o acci ɓe ɗon, o ƴentinaa ka kammu. <verse number="52" style="v"/>Ɓay kamɓe ɓe sujjanii mo, ɓe yiltitii Yerusalaam e hoore welo-welo mawngo. <verse number="53" style="v"/>Onsay ɓe tabiti ka *juulirde mawnde, hiɓe mawnina Alla.</para>
</usx>
